msgstr "Elimina tutti i nemici."

msgctxt "23\t150680\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t150681\t1\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Looking into a family matter regarding\n"
"the land for the Okinawa resort deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t150758\t2\tCHK"
msgid "You're involved in this resort business?"
msgstr "Sei coinvolto in questo business del resort?"

msgctxt "23\t150799\t3\tCHK"
msgid "In a way."
msgstr "In un certo senso."

msgctxt "23\t150809\t4\tCHK"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "23\t150815\t5\tCHK"
msgid "That's right."
msgstr "Esatto."

msgctxt "23\t150829\t6\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The Tamashiro Family was originally founded\n"
"to give us a foothold on the island."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t150910\t7\tCHK"
msgid "What do the Tamashiro stand to gain from that?"
msgstr "Cosa ci guadagnano i Tamashiro da questo?"

msgctxt "23\t150957\t8\tCHK"
msgid "As it turns out..."
msgstr "A quanto pare..."

msgctxt "23\t150976\t9\tCHK"
msgid "So that's what they're up to."
msgstr "Ecco cosa stanno facendo."

msgctxt "23\t151006\t10\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And the Tamashiro Family just so\n"
"happened to fit the bill."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t151065\t11\tCHK"
msgid ""
"It seems the Tamashiro are using some\n"
"questionable methods to get a hold of the land."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t151151\t12\tCHK"
msgid "Most likely, yes."
msgstr "Molto probabilmente sì."

msgctxt "23\t151169\t13\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Imagine the scandal if the public knew\n"
"yakuza were involved in the resort deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t151249\t14\tCHK"
msgid "Interesting."
msgstr "Interessante."

msgctxt "23\t151262\t15\tCHK"
msgid "Meaning what?"
msgstr "Significato cosa?"

msgctxt "23\t151276\t16\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But public opinion would never\n"
"support it on its own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t151330\t17\tCHK"
msgid "I see."
msgstr "Capisco."

msgctxt "23\t151337\t18\tCHK"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "23\t151342\t19\tCHK"
msgid "Not to mention Tamiya's military base."
msgstr "Per non parlare della base militare di Tamiya."

msgctxt "23\t151381\t20\tCHK"
msgid "Why do all this for just one bill?"
msgstr "Perché fare tutto questo per una sola fattura?"

msgctxt "23\t151416\t21\tCHK"
msgid "A triumph befitting of the next prime minister."
msgstr "Un trionfo degno del prossimo primo ministro."

msgctxt "23\t151464\t22\tCHK"
msgid "So it's all politics."
msgstr "Quindi è tutta politica."

msgctxt "23\t151486\t23\tCHK"
msgid "So that's what's going on."
msgstr "Ah, allora è così che stanno le cose."

msgctxt "23\t151513\t24\tCHK"
msgid "I suppose."
msgstr "Immagino."

msgctxt "23\t151524\t25\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I will do whatever it takes to ensure\n"
"this resort deal meets with success."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t151599\t26\tCHK"
msgid "Shouldn't you be worrying about the base?"
msgstr "Non dovresti preoccuparti della base?"

msgctxt "23\t151641\t27\tCHK"
msgid "Toma-san, was it?"
msgstr "Quanto a Daigo, erano circa le sei e mezza."

msgctxt "23\t151659\t28\tCHK"
msgid "That's correct."
msgstr "È corretto."

msgctxt "23\t151675\t29\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I used to think it wouldn't be so bad\n"
"if it was bringing in the cash..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t151747\t30\tCHK"
msgid "But I was dead wrong."
msgstr "Ma mi sbagliavo di grosso."

msgctxt "23\t151769\t31\tCHK"
msgid "Sacrifices like our land, I guess."
msgstr "Sacrifici come la nostra terra, immagino."

msgctxt "23\t151804\t32\tCHK"
msgid "Correct. Okinawa is famous for its abundant beaches."
msgstr "Corretto. Okinawa è famosa per le sue numerose spiagge."

msgctxt "23\t151857\t33\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But y'know... People might not be\n"
"as willing to budge as you hope."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t151924\t34\tCHK"
msgid "It's been a while, Kiryu-san."
msgstr "È passato un po' di tempo, Kiryu-san."

msgctxt "23\t151954\t35\tCHK"
msgid "What are you doing down here?"
msgstr "Che ci fai qui?"

msgctxt "23\t151984\t36\tCHK"
msgid ""
"To be more specific, the ones responsible\n"
"for the situation I'm confronted with..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t152067\t37\tCHK"
msgid "Are a small Okinawa-based offshoot of the Tojo Clan."
msgstr "Sono un piccolo ramo con sede a Okinawa del clan Tojo."

msgctxt "23\t152120\t38\tCHK"
msgid ""
"That piece of the Tojo you're talkin' about...\n"
"Is it the Tamashiro?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t152188\t39\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But now they've gone behind our backs and started\n"
"buying up the land here for use in the resort deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t152290\t40\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Minister Suzuki, of the resort program, asked them to\n"
"scoop up every patch of crucial real estate in his stead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t152402\t41\tCHK"
msgid ""
"After all, his plan can't move forward without\n"
"a certain amount of land to build on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t152487\t42\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Yes. In order to get the land he required,\n"
"Suzuki-san needed a local organization on his side."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t152582\t43\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I see. But that doesn't explain\n"
"why you came here yourself, Daigo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t152649\t44\tCHK"
msgid ""
"In some cases, they've even resorted to\n"
"stealing the deeds from their rightful owners."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t152736\t45\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Is that why they abducted my Saki?\n"
"To trade her for some scrap of paper?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t152809\t46\tCHK"
msgid ""
"They knew how much you cared for the girl,\n"
"and intended to use that affection against you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t152900\t47\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Those Tamashiro assholes...\n"
"Not a shred of humanity, the lot of 'em."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t152969\t48\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Allowing them to keep employing\n"
"those tactics would only lead to trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t153043\t49\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Both it and the proposed military expansion\n"
"would find themselves at extreme risk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t153126\t50\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Tamiya-san from the Ministry of Defense\n"
"personally requested that I intervene."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t153205\t51\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The truth of it is, the resort deal and\n"
"the proposed military base are a linked pair."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t153291\t52\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You can't have one without the other.\n"
"If one fails, both fail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t153354\t53\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Were the resort to be canceled, for example,\n"
"only the base would remain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t153427\t54\tCHK"
msgid ""
"In that sense, the resort's success is just as vital\n"
"to Tamiya-san as that of his own bill."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t153519\t55\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And that's why Tamiya sent you down here.\n"
"He needs you to keep things from boiling over."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t153608\t56\tCHK"
msgid ""
"This particular visit was requested by Toma-kun here.\n"
"He asked that I accompany Tamiya-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t153700\t57\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I'm Minister Tamiya's personal secretary,\n"
"Shoyo Toma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t153754\t58\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Kid like you workin' for the Minister of Defense?\n"
"That's some impressive shit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t153833\t59\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Not at all. I'm merely tasked with\n"
"carrying out the Minister's orders."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t153904\t60\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Hold on. If you stop the Tamashiro from buying\n"
"the land, they'd have nowhere to build the resort."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t154002\t61\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Indeed. We hope to attain the land through\n"
"negotiation with the locals, not threats."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t154087\t62\tCHK"
msgid ""
"This base would be a major international success,\n"
"far outweighing some trivial little resort."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t154181\t63\tCHK"
msgid ""
"As for the Tojo Clan, we usually stay out\n"
"of the business of our families."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t154256\t64\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But were this to become a scandal,\n"
"it would attract unwanted police attention."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t154335\t65\tCHK"
msgid ""
"We absolutely can't allow that to happen.\n"
"Hence why I'm here now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t154401\t66\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But I had no idea your orphanage was being\n"
"threatened, Kiryu-san. It came as quite a shock."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t154493\t67\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Guess that means you're not gonna have to\n"
"part with your land. That's a win in my book."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t154581\t68\tCHK"
msgid ""
"That may be true for the moment,\n"
"but your time is not infinite."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t154645\t69\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Whaddya mean?\n"
"I thought you were in Tamiya's corner."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t154698\t70\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I'm an Okinawa native, myself... so it pains me\n"
"to see my beloved home slowly fade into obscurity."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t154797\t71\tCHK"
msgid ""
"If we fail to bring in the resources this resort\n"
"promises, our island will die a prolonged, agonizing death."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t154906\t72\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I may work under Minister Tamiya, yes,\n"
"but I'll do what I must to support my people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t154991\t73\tCHK"
msgid ""
"If you're really a local, you should know\n"
"people don't want your damn resort."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t155069\t74\tCHK"
msgid ""
"What people here really care about is keepin'\n"
"the Okinawa they love just the way it is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t155157\t75\tCHK"
msgid ""
"As if that matters in Tokyo. To them we're\n"
"nothing more than an insignificant speck of earth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t155251\t76\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But I'll do whatever it takes to change that.\n"
"Even if it means making sacrifices."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t155333\t77\tCHK"
msgid ""
"There should be no harm in laying claim\n"
"to a few acres of that abundance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23\t155407\t78\tCHK"
msgid ""
"So the ends justify the means, huh?\n"
"Spoken like a true politician."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "24\t159000\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "24\t159001\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Emoto Medical Clinic"
msgstr "Clinica medica Emoto"

msgctxt "25\t159352\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "25\t159353\t1\tCHK"
msgid "What would you like to know?"
msgstr "Cosa vuoi fare adesso?"

msgctxt "26\t159736\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "26\t159737\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Do you have any further questions?"
msgstr "Hai altre domande?"

msgctxt "27\t166360\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27\t166361\t1\tCHK"
msgid "What, like some mafia involved in the resort?"
msgstr "Cosa, tipo qualche mafia coinvolta nel resort?"

msgctxt "27\t166407\t2\tCHK"
msgid "If only it were that simple."
msgstr "Se solo fosse così semplice."

msgctxt "27\t166436\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Black Monday?"
msgstr "Black Monday?"

msgctxt "27\t166450\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Wait. You mean the black market arms dealers?"
msgstr "Aspettare. Intendi i trafficanti d'armi del mercato nero?"

msgctxt "27\t166496\t5\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I see you're a reporter worth your salt.\n"
"That's right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27\t166551\t6\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Both the day and his group\n"
"were given the name Black Monday."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27\t166612\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"As you know, this base has been touted as the linchpin\n"
"of the revolutionary BMD missile defense system."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27\t166716\t8\tCHK"
msgid "Trillions have been spent on its development."
msgstr "Trilioni sono stati spesi per il suo sviluppo."

msgctxt "27\t166762\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Imagine how much the plans alone would be worth."
msgstr "Immagina quanto varrebbero i soli piani."

msgctxt "27\t166811\t10\tCHK"
msgid "It's no chump change, that's for sure."
msgstr "Non è una sciocchezza, questo è certo."

msgctxt "27\t166850\t11\tCHK"
msgid ""
"With the combined effort of our superior\n"
"technology and America's advanced weaponry..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27\t166937\t12\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Any possible threat from the rest of Asia would be\n"
"essentially nonexistent for decades to come."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27\t167033\t13\tCHK"
msgid ""
"This BMD system could bring about\n"
"a massive shift in the global balance of power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27\t167115\t14\tCHK"
msgid "At least, that's what everyone has been led to believe."
msgstr "Almeno, questo è quello che tutti sono stati portati a credere."

msgctxt "27\t167171\t15\tCHK"
msgid ""
"That's correct. It was absolutely vital\n"
"that we propagated those rumors."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27\t167244\t16\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Consider this highly advanced weapons technology.\n"
"Who might be interested in making off with it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27\t167341\t17\tCHK"
msgid "Hold on. You're not talking about... Black Monday!?"
msgstr "Aspettare. Non stai parlando di... Black Monday!?"

msgctxt "27\t167393\t18\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And with these rumors circulating\n"
"around the international market..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27\t167462\t19\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Same goes for the military expansion bill.\n"
"It was just a fake to trick them into resurfacing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27\t167556\t20\tCHK"
msgid ""
"That's why I suggested the resort to Suzuki.\n"
"By pairing our two proposals..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27\t167633\t21\tCHK"
msgid "I could keep both my bill and my scheme alive."
msgstr "Potrei mantenere in vita sia la mia fattura che il mio piano."

msgctxt "27\t167680\t22\tCHK"
msgid ""
"In other words, this tactic led me to\n"
"deceive every last citizen in our country."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27\t167761\t23\tCHK"
msgid "It was the only possible way."
msgstr "Era l'unico modo possibile."

msgctxt "27\t167791\t24\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But... you said you don't care\n"
"about the bill passing anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27\t167854\t25\tCHK"
msgid "Does that mean...?"
msgstr "Ciò significa...?"

msgctxt "27\t167873\t26\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But if even America's wrapped up in this...\n"
"it's too big for you to have planned alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27\t167961\t27\tCHK"
msgid "Right you are."
msgstr "Esatto."

msgctxt "27\t167976\t28\tCHK"
msgid ""
"What's the real purpose of\n"
"your military expansion bill?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27\t168033\t29\tCHK"
msgid "My goal in all this..."
msgstr "Il mio obiettivo in tutto questo..."

msgctxt "27\t168056\t30\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Is bringing a highly secretive global syndicate\n"
"to light. And destroying them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27\t168135\t31\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The organization I'm attempting to expose\n"
"is known only as Black Monday."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27\t168208\t32\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The year was 1987. With the crash of the New York stock\n"
"exchange, the world was thrust into economic depression."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27\t168321\t33\tCHK"
msgid ""
"A man named Andre Richardson and his followers\n"
"were thought to have orchestrated the whole thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27\t168419\t34\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I concocted this Okinawa military scheme\n"
"as a means of smoking them out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27\t168492\t35\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Smoking them out?\n"
"What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27\t168528\t36\tCHK"
msgid ""
"This new BMD defense system,\n"
"once installed at the Okinawa base..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27\t168595\t37\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Would make us nigh untouchable by hostile nations.\n"
"Japan would be the safest country known to man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27\t168694\t38\tCHK"
msgid "They're putting something like that in Okinawa?"
msgstr "Mettono qualcosa del genere a Okinawa?"

msgctxt "27\t168742\t39\tCHK"
msgid "Led to believe?"
msgstr "Portato a credere?"

msgctxt "27\t168758\t40\tCHK"
msgid "What are you getting at?"
msgstr "Dove vuoi arrivare?"

msgctxt "27\t168783\t41\tCHK"
msgid "Indeed I am."
msgstr "Infatti lo sono."

msgctxt "27\t168796\t42\tCHK"
msgid ""
"With clientele based all over the world,\n"
"they're always on the lookout for new wares."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27\t168882\t43\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Well, the end result isn't too difficult to imagine.\n"
"This isn't an opportunity they can pass up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27\t168979\t44\tCHK"
msgid ""
"So all this BMD stuff was just bait\n"
"to draw Black Monday out into the light?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27\t169056\t45\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Fake or not, I had to act as though\n"
"I was insistent on passing it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27\t169123\t46\tCHK"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "27\t169128\t47\tCHK"
msgid ""
"After all this time,\n"
"I've finally ensnared Black Monday."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27\t169185\t48\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Then, you never planned on running\n"
"against Suzuki to be prime minister, either?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27\t169265\t49\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Such a thing is for the young and vain.\n"
"I have no interest in the position."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "28\t176120\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "28\t176121\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Do you know the man who shot Daigo?"
msgstr "Conosci l'uomo che ha sparato a Daigo?"

msgctxt "28\t176157\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Unfortunately, I can't say I do."
msgstr "Purtroppo non posso dire di sì."

msgctxt "28\t176190\t3\tCHK"
msgid "I should've known."
msgstr "Avrei dovuto immaginarlo."

msgctxt "28\t176209\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Do you know him?"
msgstr "Oh, lo conosci?"

msgctxt "28\t176226\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Mhm."
msgstr "Mhm."

msgctxt "28\t176231\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Joji Kazama."
msgstr "Joji Kazama."

msgctxt "28\t176244\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Kazama-san had... a brother?"
msgstr "Kazama-san aveva... un fratello?"

msgctxt "28\t176273\t8\tCHK"
msgid "You weren't aware?"
msgstr "Non ne eri a conoscenza?"

msgctxt "28\t176292\t9\tCHK"
msgid "No."
msgstr "NO."

msgctxt "28\t176296\t10\tCHK"
msgid "It's not?"
msgstr "Non lo è?"

msgctxt "28\t176306\t11\tCHK"
msgid "His brother Joji was his only surviving relative."
msgstr "Forse nella mia prossima vita..."

msgctxt "28\t176356\t12\tCHK"
msgid ""
"If he and Joji were really that tight knit,\n"
"you'd think he would've mentioned the guy to Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "28\t176452\t13\tCHK"
msgid ""
"There's simply no chance they could have\n"
"lived as normal brothers. None at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "28\t176532\t14\tCHK"
msgid "And why's that?"
msgstr "E per quale motivo?"

msgctxt "28\t176548\t15\tCHK"
msgid "They were walking two conflicting paths in life."
msgstr "Stavano percorrendo due percorsi contrastanti nella vita."

msgctxt "28\t176597\t16\tCHK"
msgid "So wait. You're saying Kazama's brother was..."
msgstr "Quindi aspetta. Stai dicendo che il fratello di Kazama era..."

msgctxt "28\t176644\t17\tCHK"
msgid ""
"He used to work in what is now currently\n"
"known as the Foreign Affairs Division."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "28\t176724\t18\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Elite, huh? I can see how you'd think so,\n"
"given your history on the force."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "28\t176799\t19\tCHK"
msgid "It's funny, though."
msgstr "È divertente, però."

msgctxt "28\t176819\t20\tCHK"
msgid "What? You don't mean..."
msgstr "Che cosa? Non intendi..."

msgctxt "28\t176843\t21\tCHK"
msgid "Joji and I came up through the ranks together."
msgstr "Joji e io abbiamo fatto carriera insieme."

msgctxt "28\t176890\t22\tCHK"
msgid "He's the only friend I have in this harsh world."
msgstr "È l'unico amico che ho in questo mondo duro."

msgctxt "28\t176939\t23\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Then... Joji shooting Daigo.\n"
"Was that part of the plan, too?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "28\t177000\t24\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And what organization are you talking about?\n"
"Is Joji still with the force?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "28\t177075\t25\tCHK"
msgid "He left the Japanese police years ago."
msgstr "Ha lasciato la polizia giapponese anni fa."

msgctxt "28\t177114\t26\tCHK"
msgid "Then what are you talking about?"
msgstr "Di cosa stai parlando?"

msgctxt "28\t177147\t27\tCHK"
msgid "He's working for the American CIA. "
msgstr "Lavora per la CIA americana."

msgctxt "28\t177183\t28\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You mean that Kazama look-alike, right?\n"
"Damn wish we knew what he wants."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "28\t177256\t29\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Wait, did you say Kazama?\n"
"Is he the one who pulled the trigger?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "28\t177320\t30\tCHK"
msgid ""
"If the Kazama I know and the one you're\n"
"talking about are the same man, that is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "28\t177401\t31\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Then tell me. This Kazama you know...\n"
"Just who is he?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "28\t177455\t32\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Younger brother of Shintaro Kazama, former patriarch\n"
"of the Kazama Family you once belonged to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "28\t177551\t33\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I see. I suppose it's not a surprise\n"
"he never mentioned that fact."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "28\t177618\t34\tCHK"
msgid ""
"No. You see, after Shintaro lost both his parents at a very young age..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "28\t177691\t35\tCHK"
msgid "Such a bond is nigh unbreakable."
msgstr "Un simile legame è quasi indissolubile."

msgctxt "28\t177724\t36\tCHK"
msgid "How close they were doesn't matter."
msgstr "Quanto fossero vicini non ha importanza."

msgctxt "28\t177760\t37\tCHK"
msgid "A cop."
msgstr "Un poliziotto."

msgctxt "28\t177767\t38\tCHK"
msgid "Whoa. Only most elite officers get in there!"
msgstr "Ehi. Lì entra solo la maggior parte degli ufficiali d'élite!"

msgctxt "28\t177812\t39\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Two men who wore the same badge to\n"
"protect the future of our nation..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "28\t177883\t40\tCHK"
msgid ""
"One sits in this stuffy office sipping whisky all day,\n"
"the other plies his trade on American shores."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "28\t177984\t41\tCHK"
msgid "What? You and Kazama's brother!?"
msgstr "Che cosa? Tu e il fratello di Kazama!?"

msgctxt "28\t178017\t42\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Everything that's happened in Okinawa to this point...\n"
"Joji and I orchestrated the whole thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "28\t178113\t43\tCHK"
msgid "What do you mean, \"orchestrated\"?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "28\t178147\t44\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I formulated the plan, while Joji used\n"
"his organization to carry it out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "28\t178220\t45\tCHK"
msgid "I can't rule out the possibility."
msgstr "Non posso escludere la possibilità."

msgctxt "29\t181480\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "29\t181481\t1\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You mentioned a favor.\n"
"What do you need?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "29\t181522\t2\tCHK"
msgid "I need you to save the lives of two men."
msgstr "Ho bisogno che tu salvi la vita di due uomini."

msgctxt "29\t181563\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Who are they?"
msgstr "Chi sono?"

msgctxt "29\t181577\t4\tCHK"
msgid "The first is my former secretary, Toma."
msgstr "Il primo è il mio ex segretario, Toma."

msgctxt "29\t181617\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Two weeks back, he tendered his resignation."
msgstr "Due settimane fa ha rassegnato le dimissioni."

msgctxt "29\t181662\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Why?"
msgstr "Perché?"

msgctxt "29\t181667\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And so, he abandoned me for the man\n"
"now in control of the resort development."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "29\t181745\t8\tCHK"
msgid "Which is who?"
msgstr "Qual è chi?"

msgctxt "29\t181759\t9\tCHK"
msgid "A yakuza."
msgstr "Una yakuza."

msgctxt "29\t181769\t10\tCHK"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr "Cosa!?"

msgctxt "29\t181776\t11\tCHK"
msgid "Mine?"
msgstr "Mio?"

msgctxt "29\t181782\t12\tCHK"
msgid "Hold the damn phone!"
msgstr "Tieni quel dannato telefono!"

msgctxt "29\t181803\t13\tCHK"
msgid ""
"There's a high probability Toma will\n"
"attempt to divulge our secrets to Mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "29\t181880\t14\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Guaranteeing that someone will\n"
"in turn try to silence him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "29\t181939\t15\tCHK"
msgid "\"Someone\"?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "29\t181950\t16\tCHK"
msgid "Is this the other man you want me to save?"
msgstr "E' questo l'altro uomo che vuoi che salvi?"

msgctxt "29\t181993\t17\tCHK"
msgid "That's correct."
msgstr "È corretto."

msgctxt "29\t182009\t18\tCHK"
msgid "I need you to make sure he doesn't kill Toma."
msgstr "Ho bisogno che tu ti assicuri che non uccida Toma."

msgctxt "29\t182055\t19\tCHK"
msgid "And who is he, exactly?"
msgstr "E chi è esattamente?"

msgctxt "29\t182079\t20\tCHK"
msgid "Joji Kazama."
msgstr "Joji Kazama."

msgctxt "29\t182092\t21\tCHK"
msgid "Former? What happened?"
msgstr "Ex? Quello che è successo?"

msgctxt "29\t182115\t22\tCHK"
msgid ""
"He learned the truth about why\n"
"I was advocating the military expansion bill."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "29\t182192\t23\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The head of the Tojo Clan's Hakuho Clan.\n"
"Yoshitaka Mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "30\t187032\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "30\t187033\t1\tCHK"
msgid "So Kazama-san's brother..."
msgstr "Quindi il fratello di Kazama-san..."

msgctxt "30\t187060\t2\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Is working as a CIA spy.\n"
"In Japan, of all places?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "30\t187110\t3\tCHK"
msgid "That's right."
msgstr "Esatto."

msgctxt "30\t187124\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Why would he do that?"
msgstr "Qualcosa di molto importante per te."

msgctxt "30\t187146\t5\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The CIA agents on this case have\n"
"been given the following orders."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "30\t187212\t6\tCHK"
msgid "What do you mean, eliminate?"
msgstr "Cosa intendi con eliminare?"

msgctxt "30\t187241\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Those who refused to sell their land...\n"
"They were shot for the good of this \"mission\"?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "30\t187328\t8\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Yes. Remember that Joji isn't the only\n"
"CIA agent on this case, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "30\t187399\t9\tCHK"
msgid "I believe you've already met some of the others."
msgstr "Credo che tu abbia già incontrato alcuni degli altri."

msgctxt "30\t187448\t10\tCHK"
msgid "Wait... The men in black suits?"
msgstr "Date-san... Lavori per un giornale?"

msgctxt "30\t187480\t11\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You were attempting to put a stop\n"
"to the resort deal, after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "30\t187545\t12\tCHK"
msgid "If that's true, then the guys who shot Kashiwagi were..."
msgstr "Se è vero, allora i ragazzi che hanno sparato a Kashiwagi erano..."

msgctxt "30\t187602\t13\tCHK"
msgid "CIA."
msgstr "CIA."

msgctxt "30\t187607\t14\tCHK"
msgid ""
"In Joji's eyes, the CIA is\n"
"the only thing that matters anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "30\t187671\t15\tCHK"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "Cosa intendi?"

msgctxt "30\t187689\t16\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You two may be too young to remember,\n"
"but thirty years ago..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "30\t187751\t17\tCHK"
msgid ""
"When the truth came to light,\n"
"Joji could do nothing but leave his post."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "30\t187823\t18\tCHK"
msgid "It was a dark time for him, until the American government reached out."
msgstr "È stato un periodo buio per lui, finché il governo americano non lo ha contattato."

msgctxt "30\t187894\t19\tCHK"
msgid "And now he'll do anything the CIA asks."
msgstr "E ora farà tutto ciò che gli chiederà la CIA."

msgctxt "30\t187934\t20\tCHK"
msgid ""
"It's a necessary evil.\n"
"The CIA has been tracking these smugglers for years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "30\t188010\t21\tCHK"
msgid ""
"My work with Joji is another step\n"
"in the larger plan to snuff out Black Monday."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "30\t188090\t22\tCHK"
msgid ""
"So you're saying Kazama's brother quit the force,\n"
"joined the CIA, and is working for the Americans now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "30\t188194\t23\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But then why's a guy like that\n"
"going around putting slugs in people?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "30\t188263\t24\tCHK"
msgid ""
"So it was him. The man who shot Daigo and Nakahara...\n"
"It was Kazama-san's brother, wasn't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "30\t188357\t25\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I can't say.\n"
"It does seem likely, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "30\t188399\t26\tCHK"
msgid ""
"1. Track any and all movements Black Monday makes\n"
"in regard to the Okinawa military expansion bill."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "30\t188499\t27\tCHK"
msgid ""
"2. Eliminate any thing or person that puts\n"
"the success of this pressing mission at risk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "30\t188588\t28\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Correct. The foreigners who assaulted you\n"
"were all spies sent to these shores by the CIA."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "30\t188678\t29\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Why would Kazama-san's brother do that? Why...?\n"
"Murdering one of his own countrymen..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "30\t188765\t30\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The nation was far more conservative. A cop with a brother\n"
"in the yakuza would be at constant risk of persecution."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "30\t188880\t31\tCHK"
msgid ""
"To say nothing of Joji's situation,\n"
"with Shintaro a high-ranking Tojo officer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "30\t188959\t32\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Thus, in a country where skill mattered\n"
"over all else, Joji started fresh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "31\t196504\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "31\t196505\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Precisely."
msgstr "Esattamente."

msgctxt "31\t196516\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Not sure that makes much sense."
msgstr "Non sono sicuro che abbia molto senso."

msgctxt "31\t196548\t3\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And an organization within the Tojo\n"
"that Joji was working with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "31\t196612\t4\tCHK"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr "Cosa!?"

msgctxt "31\t196619\t5\tCHK"
msgid "To keep the military expansion bill alive."
msgstr "Per mantenere in vita il disegno di legge sull’espansione militare."

msgctxt "31\t196662\t6\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And Black Monday would slip\n"
"through our fingers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "31\t196711\t7\tCHK"
msgid "And he used the Tojo to do it."
msgstr "E ha usato il Tojo per farlo."

msgctxt "31\t196742\t8\tCHK"
msgid "However..."
msgstr "Però..."

msgctxt "31\t196753\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Daigo didn't take the bait."
msgstr "Daigo non ha abboccato."

msgctxt "31\t196781\t10\tCHK"
msgid "So they shot him."
msgstr "Quindi gli hanno sparato."

msgctxt "31\t196799\t11\tCHK"
msgid "I believe so, yes."
msgstr "Credo di sì, sì."

msgctxt "31\t196818\t12\tCHK"
msgid ""
"That's when Toma brought the issue\n"
"of the halted land accrual to Mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "31\t196889\t13\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Yeah... He did say something about\n"
"wanting to see Okinawa flourish."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "31\t196957\t14\tCHK"
msgid "It's the only thing he's ever cared about."
msgstr "E' l'unica cosa di cui gli sia mai importato."

msgctxt "31\t197000\t15\tCHK"
msgid ""
"He then found out a year later that\n"
"everything I was working towards was all fake."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "31\t197083\t16\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Toma and Mine are working toward a common goal,\n"
"albeit for different reasons."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "31\t197161\t17\tCHK"
msgid "Well all right then."
msgstr "Bene, allora."

msgctxt "31\t197182\t18\tCHK"
msgid "I can't say I understand the man."
msgstr "Non posso dire di capire l'uomo."

msgctxt "31\t197216\t19\tCHK"
msgid ""
"So Toma left to get the land for the resort on his own.\n"
"And the man he went to for help... was Mine?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "31\t197317\t20\tCHK"
msgid ""
"If Kashiwagi's info was right, the ones pulling\n"
"the strings on the resort were Suzuki, Joji Kazama..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "31\t197419\t21\tCHK"
msgid "The truth of the matter is complicated."
msgstr "La verità è complicata."

msgctxt "31\t197459\t22\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Ever since the Tamashiro incident two years ago...\n"
"not one parcel of land has been purchased for the resort."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "31\t197568\t23\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Then why'd Kazama go as far as\n"
"shooting Nakahara for his deed?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "31\t197631\t24\tCHK"
msgid ""
"If word got out that land acquisition\n"
"had stalled, so too would the bill itself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "31\t197712\t25\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Hence, the most prudent option was intimidating\n"
"Nakahara, essentially forcing him to give up his land."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "31\t197815\t26\tCHK"
msgid "Yes. In order to get Daigo Dojima on their side..."
msgstr "SÌ. Per portare Daigo Dojima dalla loro parte..."

msgctxt "31\t197866\t27\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The CIA stole the deed to the plot Morning Glory\n"
"rests upon in an attempt to force his hand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "31\t197959\t28\tCHK"
msgid ""
"No doubt he promised Mine full control of\n"
"the finished resort in exchange for his assistance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "31\t198053\t29\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Full control of the resort?\n"
"How would that benefit Toma?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "31\t198110\t30\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You're aware that he was born\n"
"and raised in Okinawa, yes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "31\t198168\t31\tCHK"
msgid "Yeah. He told us as much himself last summer."
msgstr "Sì. Ce lo ha detto lui stesso l'estate scorsa."

msgctxt "31\t198214\t32\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Three years ago, Toma stepped into the political world,\n"
"hoping to enact serious change in Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "31\t198313\t33\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And when he learned of the base and the resort,\n"
"he was determined to help for the sake of his home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "31\t198413\t34\tCHK"
msgid ""
"When the link between the resort and the yakuza\n"
"was almost made public last year..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "31\t198497\t35\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Toma introduced me to the Tojo Clan's Chairman Dojima\n"
"to ensure the base didn't go down with it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "31\t198594\t36\tCHK"
msgid ""
"However, he never truly cared for my base.\n"
"Keeping the resort afloat was his ultimate goal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "31\t198686\t37\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And... I guess Toma first ran into Mine when he\n"
"brought you there to talk strategy with Daigo, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "31\t198786\t38\tCHK"
msgid ""
"So with the resort deal fully in mind,\n"
"he approached the Hakuho Clan to form a pact."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "31\t198871\t39\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Never thought Mine'd betray the clan, though.\n"
"He's always been like Daigo's loyal lapdog."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "31\t198961\t40\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But with all that's happened,\n"
"he's now the de facto head of the Tojo Clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "31\t199036\t41\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Power would be his if he just waited quietly...\n"
"So why make this move now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "32\t201192\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "32\t201193\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr "Zio Kaz!"

msgctxt "32\t201204\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Caught us some dinner."
msgstr "Ci abbiamo preso qualcosa per cena."

msgctxt "32\t201227\t3\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Now come on.\n"
"I'm sure everyone's starving."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "32\t201270\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Okay!"
msgstr "Va bene!"

msgctxt "33\t202008\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "33\t202009\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Dinner is served."
msgstr "La cena è servita."

msgctxt "33\t202027\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Come sit down, everyone!"
msgstr "Venite a sedervi tutti!"

msgctxt "33\t202052\t3\tCHK"
msgid "It's Uncle Rikiya!"
msgstr "È zio Rikiya!"

msgctxt "33\t202071\t4\tCHK"
msgid "What happened to eating?"
msgstr "Cos'è successo al mangiare?"

msgctxt "33\t202096\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Let's play catch, Uncle Rikiya!"
msgstr "Giochiamo a prendere, zio Rikiya!"

msgctxt "33\t202128\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Aniki."
msgstr "Capo"

msgctxt "33\t202135\t7\tCHK"
msgid "It's the boss."
msgstr "È il capo."

msgctxt "33\t202150\t8\tCHK"
msgid "He..."
msgstr "Ehi..."

msgctxt "33\t202156\t9\tCHK"
msgid "He's been shot."
msgstr "Gli hanno sparato."

msgctxt "33\t202172\t10\tCHK"
msgid ""
"What's up?\n"
"Did something happen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "34\t204904\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "34\t204905\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Yes, of course."
msgstr "Sì, certo!"

msgctxt "34\t204921\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Just a moment."
msgstr "Un momento."

msgctxt "34\t204936\t3\tCHK"
msgid "It's for you, Chairman."
msgstr "E' per te, Presidente."

msgctxt "34\t204960\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Who is it?"
msgstr "Chi è?"

msgctxt "34\t204971\t5\tCHK"
msgid ""
"They said you'd understand\n"
"if I mentioned \"the deal.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "34\t205025\t6\tCHK"
msgid "This is Dojima."
msgstr "Questa è Dojima."

msgctxt "34\t205041\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "34\t205046\t8\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I thought I told you\n"
"I wasn't interested."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "34\t205088\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Yes, that's right."
msgstr "Sì. Esatto."

msgctxt "34\t205107\t10\tCHK"
msgid "The Tojo Clan wants no part in this."
msgstr "Il clan Tojo non vuole avere nulla a che fare con tutto ciò."

msgctxt "34\t205144\t11\tCHK"
msgid "My answer is final."
msgstr "La mia risposta è definitiva."

msgctxt "34\t205164\t12\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Add as many 0s as you want.\n"
"I'm not going to budge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "34\t205216\t13\tCHK"
msgid "Goodbye."
msgstr "Addio."

msgctxt "34\t205225\t14\tCHK"
msgid "Chairman."
msgstr "Presidente..."

msgctxt "34\t205235\t15\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I assume that was about\n"
"the Okinawa deal?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "34\t205277\t16\tCHK"
msgid "Are you sure we can refuse?"
msgstr "Sei sicuro che possiamo rifiutare?"

msgctxt "34\t205305\t17\tCHK"
msgid "Meaning?"
msgstr "Senso?"

msgctxt "34\t205314\t18\tCHK"
msgid "If we agree to this Okinawa business..."
msgstr "Se accettiamo questa faccenda di Okinawa..."

msgctxt "34\t205354\t19\tCHK"
msgid "Enough!"
msgstr "Basta!"

msgctxt "34\t205362\t20\tCHK"
msgid "I'm well aware of the potential gains."
msgstr "Sono ben consapevole dei potenziali guadagni."

msgctxt "34\t205401\t21\tCHK"
msgid "But I won't let him take that land."
msgstr "Ma non gli permetterò di prendere quella terra."

msgctxt "34\t205437\t22\tCHK"
msgid "Because of the Fourth Chairman, sir?"
msgstr "Mamma..."

msgctxt "34\t205474\t23\tCHK"
msgid "After all he's done for the Tojo Clan..."
msgstr "Dopo tutto quello che ha fatto per il clan Tojo..."

msgctxt "34\t205515\t24\tCHK"
msgid "It wouldn't be right stealing the one place he belongs."
msgstr "Non sarebbe giusto rubargli l'unico posto a cui appartiene."

msgctxt "34\t205571\t25\tCHK"
msgid "Driver."
msgstr "Autista"

msgctxt "34\t205579\t26\tCHK"
msgid "Take us back to HQ."
msgstr "Riportaci al quartier generale."

msgctxt "34\t205599\t27\tCHK"
msgid "Sir? But what about the banquet?"
msgstr "Signore? Ma che dire del banchetto?"

msgctxt "34\t205632\t28\tCHK"
msgid "Cancel it."
msgstr "Annullalo."

msgctxt "34\t205643\t29\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Respectfully, sir. Hakuho payouts\n"
"are the only thing keeping us afloat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "34\t205715\t30\tCHK"
msgid ""
"We'd earn enough to last us\n"
"for at least a decade."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "34\t205766\t31\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Quick estimates show we could turn\n"
"100 billion yen, perhaps even more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "34\t205837\t32\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Beyond that, a man like him would make\n"
"for a vital government ally who⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "34\t205911\t33\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I need to make sure nobody thinks they can\n"
"agree to this Okinawa deal behind my back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "35\t207672\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "35\t207673\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Welcome back, sir!"
msgstr "Bentornato, signore!"

msgctxt "35\t207692\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Chairman."
msgstr "Presidente..."

msgctxt "35\t207702\t3\tCHK"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "E cioè?"

msgctxt "35\t207714\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Someone's come seeking audience with you."
msgstr "Qualcuno è venuto a cercare udienza con te."

msgctxt "35\t207756\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Who?"
msgstr "Chi è stato?"

msgctxt "35\t207761\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Well..."
msgstr "Beh..."

msgctxt "35\t207769\t7\tCHK"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr "Cosa!?"

msgctxt "35\t207776\t8\tCHK"
msgid "There's no doubt."
msgstr "Non c'è dubbio."

msgctxt "35\t207794\t9\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I didn't believe it myself,\n"
"but it's him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "35\t207836\t10\tCHK"
msgid "And where is he?"
msgstr "E dov'è?"

msgctxt "35\t207853\t11\tCHK"
msgid "Waiting in your office."
msgstr "Ti aspetto nel tuo ufficio."

msgctxt "35\t207877\t12\tCHK"
msgid "All right."
msgstr "Va bene."

msgctxt "36\t209752\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "36\t209753\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Kazama-san!"
msgstr "Ma ho bisogno che tu sia consapevole di cosa sta succedendo."

msgctxt "36\t209765\t2\tCHK"
msgid "But I thought you were..."
msgstr "Ma pensavo che tu fossi..."

msgctxt "36\t209791\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Sorry for the surprise."
msgstr "Mi spiace per la sorpresa."

msgctxt "36\t209815\t4\tCHK"
msgid "What's this?"
msgstr "Questo cos'è?"

msgctxt "36\t209828\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Something very important to you."
msgstr "Qualcosa di molto importante per te."

msgctxt "36\t209861\t6\tCHK"
msgid "This is..."
msgstr "Questo è..."

msgctxt "36\t209872\t7\tCHK"
msgid "A deed to that land in Okinawa."
msgstr "Un atto verso quella terra ad Okinawa."

msgctxt "36\t209904\t8\tCHK"
msgid "But this is where the Fourth Chairman is⑬"
msgstr "Ma è qui che si trova il Quarto Presidente⑬"

msgctxt "36\t209948\t9\tCHK"
msgid "I'm aware."
msgstr "Ne sono consapevole."

msgctxt "36\t209959\t10\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You had no interest in taking\n"
"Kazuma Kiryu's land for yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "36\t210023\t11\tCHK"
msgid "But... why?"
msgstr "Ma... perché?"

msgctxt "36\t210035\t12\tCHK"
msgid "Sorry, but..."
msgstr "Un simile legame è quasi indissolubile."

msgctxt "36\t210049\t13\tCHK"
msgid "I've already made my decision."
msgstr "Ho già preso la mia decisione."

msgctxt "36\t210080\t14\tCHK"
msgid "I don't want anything to do with this."
msgstr "Non voglio avere niente a che fare con questo."

msgctxt "36\t210119\t15\tCHK"
msgid "You may want to reconsider, Sixth Chairman."
msgstr "Potrebbe volerci riconsiderare, Sesto Presidente."

msgctxt "36\t210163\t16\tCHK"
msgid "And..."
msgstr "E poi..."

msgctxt "36\t210170\t17\tCHK"
msgid "What happens if I do?"
msgstr "Cosa succede se lo faccio?"

msgctxt "36\t210192\t18\tCHK"
msgid "We'll do what must be done."
msgstr "Faremo ciò che deve essere fatto."

msgctxt "36\t210220\t19\tCHK"
msgid ""
"So we went ahead and did it for you.\n"
"No need to thank me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "36\t210278\t20\tCHK"
msgid ""
"We can't let the Tojo walk from this deal.\n"
"That outcome is simply unacceptable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "36\t210358\t21\tCHK"
msgid ""
"With 30,000 members to support,\n"
"can you really afford to refuse?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "37\t212456\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "37\t212457\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Sir!"
msgstr "Signore!"

msgctxt "37\t212462\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Where's Nakahara?"
msgstr "Dov'è Nakahara?"

msgctxt "37\t212480\t3\tCHK"
msgid "On the operating table."
msgstr "Sul tavolo operatorio."

msgctxt "37\t212504\t4\tCHK"
msgid "And?"
msgstr "E?"

msgctxt "37\t212509\t5\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Is he okay?\n"
"How's he doing!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "37\t212538\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Dammit!"
msgstr "Dannazione!"

msgctxt "37\t212546\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Saki..."
msgstr "Saki..."

msgctxt "37\t212554\t8\tCHK"
msgid "Are you okay?"
msgstr "Stai bene?"

msgctxt "37\t212568\t9\tCHK"
msgid "We know who did it?"
msgstr "Sappiamo chi è stato?"

msgctxt "37\t212588\t10\tCHK"
msgid "Nope."
msgstr "No."

msgctxt "37\t212594\t11\tCHK"
msgid ""
"He and the little lady\n"
"were alone when it happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "37\t212646\t12\tCHK"
msgid "Guy came in, shot him right in the stomach."
msgstr "Un tizio è entrato e gli ha sparato dritto allo stomaco."

msgctxt "37\t212690\t13\tCHK"
msgid "Another family out for revenge?"
msgstr "Un'altra famiglia in cerca di vendetta?"

msgctxt "37\t212722\t14\tCHK"
msgid "No."
msgstr "NO."

msgctxt "37\t212726\t15\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I think it's gotta do\n"
"with the land deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "37\t212768\t16\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The deed's up and gone missing\n"
"from the office."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "37\t212816\t17\tCHK"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "37\t212822\t18\tCHK"
msgid "It's gotta be those Tamashiro assholes!"
msgstr "Devono essere quegli stronzi di Tamashiro!"

msgctxt "37\t212862\t19\tCHK"
msgid ""
"They've been gunning for us\n"
"non-stop since last year!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "37\t212916\t20\tCHK"
msgid "Nah, I don't think it was them."
msgstr "No, non penso che siano stati loro."

msgctxt "37\t212948\t21\tCHK"
msgid "What's wrong, Saki?"
msgstr "Che succede, Aniki?"

msgctxt "37\t212968\t22\tCHK"
msgid "Who's that?"
msgstr "Chi è?"

msgctxt "37\t212980\t23\tCHK"
msgid "What the!?"
msgstr "Ma che!?"

msgctxt "37\t212991\t24\tCHK"
msgid "Is this the man who shot him?"
msgstr "E' questo l'uomo che gli ha sparato?"

msgctxt "37\t213021\t25\tCHK"
msgid "But that's..."
msgstr "Ma quello è..."

msgctxt "37\t213035\t26\tCHK"
msgid "Aniki."
msgstr "Capo"

msgctxt "37\t213042\t27\tCHK"
msgid "You know him, don't you?"
msgstr "Lo conosci, vero?"

msgctxt "37\t213067\t28\tCHK"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "37\t213073\t29\tCHK"
msgid "He's the man who brought me up."
msgstr "È l'uomo che mi ha cresciuto."

msgctxt "37\t213105\t30\tCHK"
msgid "Shintaro Kazama."
msgstr "Shintaro Kazama."

msgctxt "37\t213122\t31\tCHK"
msgid "My dead father."
msgstr "Mio padre morto."

msgctxt "37\t213138\t32\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Saki-chan.\n"
"You must be terrified."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "38\t214456\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "38\t214457\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Today's the day, huh?"
msgstr "Oggi è il giorno giusto, eh?"

msgctxt "38\t214479\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Yup."
msgstr "Già."

msgctxt "38\t214484\t3\tCHK"
msgid "...Right."
msgstr "...Ok."

msgctxt "38\t214494\t4\tCHK"
msgid "I'm here to say goodbye, too."
msgstr "Sono qui anche per salutarti."

msgctxt "39\t219224\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "39\t219225\t1\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Y'know, I'd always thought\n"
"they'd end up together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "39\t219276\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Seems it wasn't meant to be."
msgstr "Sembra che non fosse destinato a succedere."

msgctxt "39\t219305\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Sayama-kun is an ambitious girl, after all."
msgstr "Dopotutto Sayama-kun è una ragazza ambiziosa."

msgctxt "39\t219349\t4\tCHK"
msgid "You can say that again."
msgstr "Puoi dirlo di nuovo."

msgctxt "39\t219373\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Outta gas."
msgstr "Senza benzina."

msgctxt "39\t219384\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Here."
msgstr "Ecco."

msgctxt "39\t219390\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Thanks."
msgstr "Grazie."

msgctxt "39\t219398\t8\tCHK"
msgid "You can hang on to it."
msgstr "Chi se ne frega!"

msgctxt "39\t219421\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Think of it as a gift."
msgstr "Ovviamente no! Non senza Izumi!"

msgctxt "39\t219444\t10\tCHK"
msgid "No smoking in Division 1, anyway."
msgstr "In ogni caso non si fuma nella Divisione 1."

msgctxt "39\t219478\t11\tCHK"
msgid "Division 1?"
msgstr "Divisione 1?"

msgctxt "39\t219490\t12\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Yes. I'll be transferring,\n"
"effective next month."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "39\t219539\t13\tCHK"
msgid "I'm not sure it's cause for celebration."
msgstr "Non sono sicuro che sia motivo di festeggiamento."

msgctxt "39\t219580\t14\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Think back to the feud between\n"
"the Tojo Clan and Omi Alliance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "39\t219643\t15\tCHK"
msgid "The force's reputation has hit rock bottom."
msgstr "La reputazione della forza ha toccato il fondo."

msgctxt "39\t219687\t16\tCHK"
msgid "Then why're you going back to Div 1?"
msgstr "Allora perché torni alla Div 1?"

msgctxt "39\t219724\t17\tCHK"
msgid "It's essentially a bribe."
msgstr "È essenzialmente una tangente."

msgctxt "39\t219750\t18\tCHK"
msgid "Eh, a promotion's a promotion."
msgstr "Eh, una promozione è una promozione."

msgctxt "39\t219781\t19\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Doesn't matter how you got it;\n"
"you're an elite again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "39\t219835\t20\tCHK"
msgid "I suppose, yes."
msgstr "Suppongo di sì."

msgctxt "39\t219851\t21\tCHK"
msgid "You don't sound too pleased."
msgstr "Non sembri molto contento."

msgctxt "39\t219880\t22\tCHK"
msgid "That's because I'm worried."
msgstr "È perché sono preoccupato."

msgctxt "39\t219908\t23\tCHK"
msgid "About what?"
msgstr "Di cosa?"

msgctxt "39\t219920\t24\tCHK"
msgid "What happens to Kamurocho."
msgstr "Cosa succede a Kamurocho."

msgctxt "39\t219947\t25\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The police are planning to back off both\n"
"the Tojo and the Omi for the time being."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "39\t220029\t26\tCHK"
msgid "Remove themselves from yakuza matters."
msgstr "Allontanarsi dalle questioni della yakuza."

msgctxt "39\t220068\t27\tCHK"
msgid "Fair enough."
msgstr "Giusta osservazione."

msgctxt "39\t220081\t28\tCHK"
msgid "So? What's worrying you then?"
msgstr "Nessun riguardo per la posizione che ricopri."

msgctxt "39\t220111\t29\tCHK"
msgid "I still don't trust the yakuza."
msgstr "Ancora non mi fido della yakuza."

msgctxt "39\t220143\t30\tCHK"
msgid "If Kiryu-san won't be leading the Tojo Clan..."
msgstr "Se Kiryu-san non sarà alla guida del clan Tojo..."

msgctxt "39\t220190\t31\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I fear Kamurocho will simply\n"
"fall back into the muck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "39\t220244\t32\tCHK"
msgid "You can rest easy then."
msgstr "Puoi stare tranquillo allora."

msgctxt "39\t220268\t33\tCHK"
msgid "Guy like him always has a plan."
msgstr "Un tipo come lui ha sempre un piano."

msgctxt "39\t220300\t34\tCHK"
msgid ""
"After all he did, he's not gonna\n"
"just let things go to shit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "39\t220361\t35\tCHK"
msgid "And you can take that to the bank."
msgstr "E puoi portarlo in banca."

msgctxt "39\t220396\t36\tCHK"
msgid "Well, we should probably get going."
msgstr "Beh, meglio che vada."

msgctxt "39\t220432\t37\tCHK"
msgid "Right."
msgstr "Giusto."

msgctxt "39\t220439\t38\tCHK"
msgid "Off to Kamurocho, I assume?"
msgstr "Andiamo a Kamurocho, suppongo?"

msgctxt "39\t220467\t39\tCHK"
msgid "Yup."
msgstr "Già."

msgctxt "39\t220472\t40\tCHK"
msgid "Kazuki and Yuya deserve a goodbye."
msgstr "Kazuki e Yuya meritano un arrivederci."

msgctxt "39\t220507\t41\tCHK"
msgid "And..."
msgstr "E poi..."

msgctxt "39\t220514\t42\tCHK"
msgid "And what?"
msgstr "E poi cosa?"

msgctxt "39\t220524\t43\tCHK"
msgid "About the Tojo Clan, I'm sure."
msgstr "Riguardo al clan Tojo, ne sono sicuro."

msgctxt "39\t220555\t44\tCHK"
msgid ""
"At this rate, Daigo'll end up\n"
"the Tojo Clan's Sixth Chairman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "39\t220617\t45\tCHK"
msgid "But he's still young."
msgstr "Ma è ancora giovane."

msgctxt "39\t220639\t46\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I'm not sure he has\n"
"the strength to lead just yet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "39\t220690\t47\tCHK"
msgid "So you'll need someone to support him."
msgstr "Quindi avrai bisogno di qualcuno che lo sostenga."

msgctxt "39\t220729\t48\tCHK"
msgid "Did you have anyone in mind?"
msgstr "Avevi qualcuno in mente?"

msgctxt "39\t220758\t49\tCHK"
msgid "I know just who you mean."
msgstr "So bene chi intendi."

msgctxt "39\t220784\t50\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Nobody does.\n"
"You and I both know that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "39\t220823\t51\tCHK"
msgid "Goro Majima..."
msgstr "Goro Majima..."

msgctxt "39\t220838\t52\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I wonder if he'd even find the Tojo\n"
"appealing in its current state."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "39\t220906\t53\tCHK"
msgid "I'm sure you're thinking the same."
msgstr "Sono sicuro che stai pensando la stessa cosa."

msgctxt "39\t220941\t54\tCHK"
msgid "You've got that right."
msgstr "Hai proprio ragione."

msgctxt "39\t220964\t55\tCHK"
msgid "Do you think you can convince him?"
msgstr "Pensi di poterlo convincere?"

msgctxt "39\t220999\t56\tCHK"
msgid "Don't have much choice."
msgstr "Non ho molta scelta."

msgctxt "39\t221023\t57\tCHK"
msgid "That's why I'm going to see him today."
msgstr "Ecco perché lo vedrò oggi."

msgctxt "39\t221062\t58\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I have to persuade him\n"
"one way or another."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "39\t221105\t59\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Hopefully that \"persuasion\"\n"
"doesn't involve your fists."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "39\t221161\t60\tCHK"
msgid "Eh. I guess we'll find out soon enough."
msgstr "Eh. Immagino che lo scopriremo abbastanza presto."

msgctxt "39\t221201\t61\tCHK"
msgid "Stay safe."
msgstr "Rimani al sicuro."

msgctxt "39\t221212\t62\tCHK"
msgid "Same to you."
msgstr "Altrettanto."

msgctxt "39\t221225\t63\tCHK"
msgid "Well, it's time we get going."
msgstr "Bene, è ora di andare."

msgctxt "39\t221255\t64\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And unlike 4, Division 1 has a reputation to uphold.\n"
"Can't be seen smoking on the job."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "39\t221342\t65\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Look at you getting promoted!\n"
"Congrats."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "39\t221382\t66\tCHK"
msgid ""
"In the end, neither the Metropolitan nor the\n"
"Prefectural Police did a damn thing to stop it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "39\t221475\t67\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And given Division Chief Kurahashi's\n"
"involvement with the Jingweon..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "39\t221545\t68\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Everyone involved has been promoted,\n"
"including both myself and Sayama-kun."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "39\t221620\t69\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I suppose they think keeping us happy\n"
"will also keep us quiet about what happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "39\t221703\t70\tCHK"
msgid ""
"It's only right after what\n"
"they did to spare our blushes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "39\t221761\t71\tCHK"
msgid ""
"There's someone else I need\n"
"to talk to before I leave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "39\t221816\t72\tCHK"
msgid ""
"There's a guy who's been working\n"
"with the Tojo just as long as I have, yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "39\t221893\t73\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But do you really think Daigo\n"
"has what it takes to tame him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "40\t224936\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "40\t224937\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Of course not."
msgstr "Certo che no."

msgctxt "40\t224952\t2\tCHK"
msgid "We can still come visit."
msgstr "Possiamo ancora venire a trovarci."

msgctxt "40\t224977\t3\tCHK"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr "Che succede?"

msgctxt "40\t224991\t4\tCHK"
msgid "I just wanna have fun today."
msgstr "Voglio solo divertirmi oggi."

msgctxt "40\t225020\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Me and you, Uncle Kaz."
msgstr "Io e te, zio Kaz."

msgctxt "40\t225043\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Can we?"
msgstr "Possiamo?"

msgctxt "40\t225051\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr "E di che."

msgctxt "40\t225062\t8\tCHK"
msgid "Kamurocho won't know what hit it."
msgstr "Kamurocho non saprà cosa l'ha colpito."

msgctxt "40\t225096\t9\tCHK"
msgid ""
"This is probably the last time\n"
"we'll be in Kamurocho together, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "41\t225848\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "41\t225849\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Kiryu-san!"
msgstr "Kiryu-san!"

msgctxt "41\t225860\t2\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Little early to be slacking off.\n"
"Huh, Yuya?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "42\t226488\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "42\t226489\t1\tCHK"
msgid "I hear you're bailin' on Kamurocho."
msgstr "Ho sentito che stai abbandonando Kamurocho."

msgctxt "42\t226525\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Kiryu-chan."
msgstr "Kiryu-chan."

msgctxt "42\t226537\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "42\t226543\t4\tCHK"
msgid "That's actually why I'm here."
msgstr "In realtà è proprio per questo che sono qui."

msgctxt "42\t226573\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Whaddya mean?"
msgstr "Che vuoi dire?"

msgctxt "42\t226587\t6\tCHK"
msgid "I need your help."
msgstr "Ho bisogno del vostro aiuto."

msgctxt "42\t226605\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Someone has to watch\n"
"over Daigo while I'm gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "43\t227640\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "43\t227641\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Ya know what I'm about by now."
msgstr "Ormai sai di cosa sto parlando."

msgctxt "43\t227672\t2\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The stronger they come,\n"
"the more I'm gonna like 'em."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "43\t227725\t3\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Meanin' I'm not keen on takin' orders\n"
"from snot-nosed little brats."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "43\t227793\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Fine by me."
msgstr "A me sta bene."

msgctxt "43\t227805\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Somehow I knew it'd go like this."
msgstr "In qualche modo sapevo che sarebbe andata così."

msgctxt "43\t227839\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Then let's get rollin', Kiryu-chan."
msgstr "Allora diamoci da fare, Kiryu-chan."

msgctxt "43\t227875\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Feels like ages since we threw down."
msgstr "Sembra che siano passati secoli da quando ci siamo buttati giù."

msgctxt "43\t227912\t8\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But y'know...\n"
"I'm not gonna pull any punches."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "43\t227958\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Then bring it!"
msgstr "Allora portalo!"

msgctxt "43\t227973\t10\tCHK"
msgid "Kiryu-chan!"
msgstr "Kiryu-chan!"

msgctxt "43\t227985\t11\tCHK"
msgid ""
"So if ya want me back on the Tojo's side,\n"
"you're gonna have to force me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "44\t228744\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "44\t228745\t1\tCHK"
msgid "That's my Kiryu-chan."
msgstr "Questo è il mio Kiryu-chan."

msgctxt "44\t228767\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Strong as a fuckin' ox."
msgstr "Forte come un fottuto bue."

msgctxt "45\t230264\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "45\t230265\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Guess this is the end of the line."
msgstr "Immagino che questa sia la fine della corsa."

msgctxt "45\t230300\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "45\t230306\t3\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Gonna be real lonesome\n"
"without ya, Kiryu-chan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "45\t230353\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Take care of Daigo for me."
msgstr "Prenditi cura di Daigo per me."

msgctxt "45\t230380\t5\tCHK"
msgid "There's just one thing worryin' me."
msgstr "C'è solo una cosa che mi preoccupa."

msgctxt "45\t230416\t6\tCHK"
msgid "What's that?"
msgstr "Cos'è?"

msgctxt "45\t230429\t7\tCHK"
msgid "What do you mean by that?"
msgstr "Cosa intendi?"

msgctxt "45\t230455\t8\tCHK"
msgid "Daigo..."
msgstr "Daigo..."

msgctxt "45\t230464\t9\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Hope he doesn't let anyone\n"
"pull the wool over his eyes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "45\t230520\t10\tCHK"
msgid "I should get going."
msgstr "Dovrei andare."

msgctxt "45\t230540\t11\tCHK"
msgid "The Tojo Clan's in your hands now."
msgstr "Il clan Tojo è nelle tue mani adesso."

msgctxt "45\t230575\t12\tCHK"
msgid "The hell'd I get myself into this time?"
msgstr "Al diavolo in cui mi sono cacciato questa volta?"

msgctxt "45\t230615\t13\tCHK"
msgid "Eh, whatever!"
msgstr "Eh, fa lo stesso."

msgctxt "45\t230629\t14\tCHK"
msgid "Goro Majima's..."
msgstr "Goro Majima..."

msgctxt "45\t230646\t15\tCHK"
msgid "Gonna rule the fuckin' world!"
msgstr "Dominerò il dannato mondo!"

msgctxt "45\t230676\t16\tCHK"
msgid "Won't be a walk in the park..."
msgstr "Non sarà una passeggiata nel parco..."

msgctxt "45\t230707\t17\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But hey, Kiryu-chan beat me fair n' square.\n"
"Guess I gotta go full throttle!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "45\t230783\t18\tCHK"
msgid ""
"If he starts goin' down a weird path,\n"
"don't think I'll be able to stop him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "45\t230859\t19\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I mean the Sixth Chairman.\n"
"He's real trustin', just like you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "45\t230921\t20\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Don't worry.\n"
"Daigo's young, but he's not a fool."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "45\t230970\t21\tCHK"
msgid "Ya got my word."
msgstr "Hai la mia parola."

msgctxt "46\t232184\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "46\t232185\t1\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Uncle Kaz! I thought curry\n"
"was supposed to be easy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "46\t232237\t2\tCHK"
msgid "I'm trying to focus here."
msgstr "Eh. È tutto?"

msgctxt "46\t232263\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Don't interrupt me!"
msgstr "Non interrompermi!"

msgctxt "46\t232283\t4\tCHK"
msgid ""
"How many times do\n"
"I have to tell you, Taichi?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "46\t232329\t5\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You can't bother him\n"
"while he's cooking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "46\t232370\t6\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Now come on. Let's go play outside\n"
"'til dinner's ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "47\t233768\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "47\t233769\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Oh man, curry!"
msgstr "Veterano della strategia Rangeing Rook"

msgctxt "47\t233784\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Yeah, yeah..."
msgstr "Sì, sì..."

msgctxt "47\t233798\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Looks like we're all here."
msgstr "Sembra che siamo tutti qui."

msgctxt "47\t233825\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Wait."
msgstr "Aspetta."

msgctxt "47\t233831\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Where's Izumi?"
msgstr "Dov'è Izumi?"

msgctxt "47\t233846\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Huh? Izumi-chan's still out?"
msgstr "Eh? Izumi-chan è ancora fuori?"

msgctxt "47\t233875\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Nope."
msgstr "No."

msgctxt "47\t233881\t8\tCHK"
msgid "I wonder where she went..."
msgstr "Mi chiedo dove sia andata..."

msgctxt "47\t233908\t9\tCHK"
msgid "It's fine, let's just eat without her!"
msgstr "Va bene, mangiamo e basta senza di lei!"

msgctxt "47\t233947\t10\tCHK"
msgid "Totally! I'm sure she's okay."
msgstr "Totalmente! Sono sicuro che sta bene."

msgctxt "47\t233977\t11\tCHK"
msgid "What do we do, Uncle Kaz?"
msgstr "Cosa facciamo, zio Kaz?"

msgctxt "47\t234003\t12\tCHK"
msgid "We go find her."
msgstr "Andiamo a trovarla."

msgctxt "47\t234019\t13\tCHK"
msgid "You all can go ahead without us."
msgstr "Potete andare avanti tutti senza di noi."

msgctxt "47\t234052\t14\tCHK"
msgid "Yay, finally!"
msgstr "Sì, finalmente!"

msgctxt "47\t234066\t15\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Spoon down! You know we don't eat\n"
"until everyone's at the table!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "47\t234131\t16\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Shiro! Weren't you supposed\n"
"to walk her home from school?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "47\t234189\t17\tCHK"
msgid "I did. She was with me the whole time."
msgstr "L'ho fatto. È stata con me tutto il tempo."

msgctxt "47\t234228\t18\tCHK"
msgid ""
"To be clear, Shiro...\n"
"you don't know where she is?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "48\t235576\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "48\t235577\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Okay."
msgstr "Ok."

msgctxt "48\t235583\t2\tCHK"
msgid "I'm gonna keep trying."
msgstr "Continuerò a provarci."

msgctxt "48\t235606\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Good."
msgstr "Bene."

msgctxt "48\t235612\t4\tCHK"
msgid "I know I'll never replace your actual dad..."
msgstr "So che non sostituirò mai il tuo vero padre..."

msgctxt "48\t235657\t5\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But you've been like a daughter to me\n"
"since the moment you walked in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "48\t235727\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr "Zio Kaz!"

msgctxt "48\t235738\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Let's go home, okay?"
msgstr "Andiamo a casa, ok?"

msgctxt "48\t235759\t8\tCHK"
msgid "There, there. No more tears."
msgstr "Lì, lì. Niente più lacrime."

msgctxt "48\t235788\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Oh, and it's curry tonight."
msgstr "Oh, e stasera c'è curry."

msgctxt "48\t235816\t10\tCHK"
msgid "Hope you saved some room."
msgstr "Spero che tu abbia risparmiato un po' di spazio."

msgctxt "48\t235842\t11\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Izumi-chan. Everyone's wondering\n"
"where you've been."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "49\t236984\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "49\t236985\t1\tCHK"
msgid "You didn't eat?"
msgstr "Non hai mangiato?"

msgctxt "49\t237001\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Of course not! Not without Izumi!"
msgstr "Ovviamente no! Not without Izumi!"

msgctxt "49\t237035\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Okay!"
msgstr "Va bene!"

msgctxt "49\t237041\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Let's go, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr "Andiamo, zio Kaz!"

msgctxt "49\t237062\t5\tCHK"
msgid "We wanna eat!"
msgstr "Vogliamo mangiare!"

msgctxt "49\t237076\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Sorry."
msgstr "Scusa."

msgctxt "49\t237083\t7\tCHK"
msgid "All right. Everyone ready?"
msgstr "Va bene. Tutti pronti?"

msgctxt "49\t237110\t8\tCHK"
msgid "Let's eat!"
msgstr "Mangiamo!"

msgctxt "49\t237121\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Good, isn't it?"
msgstr "Bene, non è vero?"

msgctxt "49\t237137\t10\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Yeah, but now we're starving,\n"
"so hurry up and sit down!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "49\t237193\t11\tCHK"
msgid "Your plate's over here, Izumi-chan!"
msgstr "Il tuo piatto è qui, Izumi-chan!"

msgctxt "50\t238168\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "50\t238169\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Uncle Kaz."
msgstr "Zio Kaz."

msgctxt "50\t238180\t2\tCHK"
msgid "We got another one."
msgstr "Ne abbiamo un altro."

msgctxt "50\t238200\t3\tCHK"
msgid "It says \"eviction notice"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "50\t238225\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Are we getting kicked out?"
msgstr "Verremo cacciati?"

msgctxt "50\t238252\t5\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Those weird guys have been\n"
"hanging out here a lot lately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "50\t238310\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Everyone's really scared..."
msgstr "Sono tutti davvero spaventati..."

msgctxt "50\t238338\t7\tCHK"
msgid "I'll go see what's up."
msgstr "Vado a vedere che succede."

msgctxt "51\t241848\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "51\t241849\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Ugh, this heat's a freakin' killer."
msgstr "Uffa, questo caldo è mortale."

msgctxt "51\t241885\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Hey there, punks."
msgstr "Ehi, punk."

msgctxt "51\t241903\t3\tCHK"
msgid "It's him!"
msgstr "È lui!"

msgctxt "51\t241913\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Want something, old man?"
msgstr "Vuoi qualcosa, vecchio?"

msgctxt "51\t241938\t5\tCHK"
msgid "You two are in the Ryudo Family, right?"
msgstr "Voi due fate parte della famiglia Ryudo, giusto?"

msgctxt "51\t241978\t6\tCHK"
msgid "So what if we are?"
msgstr "E se lo fossimo?"

msgctxt "51\t241997\t7\tCHK"
msgid "\"Civilian,\" huh? You're funny."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "51\t242028\t8\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Don't think I've ever seen a civilian\n"
"with that kinda ink on his back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "51\t242099\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Either way, you can't keep scaring my kids."
msgstr "In ogni caso, non puoi continuare a spaventare i miei figli."

msgctxt "51\t242143\t10\tCHK"
msgid "I don't want to see your faces again. "
msgstr "Non voglio rivedere le vostre facce."

msgctxt "51\t242182\t11\tCHK"
msgid "Listen here, man."
msgstr "Ascolta qui, amico."

msgctxt "51\t242200\t12\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Ain't nobody we hate more\n"
"than arrogant outsiders like you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "51\t242260\t13\tCHK"
msgid "Now get the hell outta Okinawa."
msgstr "Come puoi continuare a giocare a questi giochi!?"

msgctxt "51\t242292\t14\tCHK"
msgid "...That's why you're trying to evict me?"
msgstr "...Ecco perché stai cercando di sfrattarmi?"

msgctxt "51\t242333\t15\tCHK"
msgid "Can't say."
msgstr "Non posso dirlo."

msgctxt "51\t242344\t16\tCHK"
msgid "If you wanna know the truth..."
msgstr "Se vuoi sapere la verità..."

msgctxt "51\t242375\t17\tCHK"
msgid "You'll have to ask our boss."
msgstr "マック１_追え"

msgctxt "51\t242404\t18\tCHK"
msgid "Just a sec there!"
msgstr "Solo un attimo!"

msgctxt "51\t242422\t19\tCHK"
msgid "Where do you think you're goin'?"
msgstr "Dove pensi di andare?"

msgctxt "51\t242455\t20\tCHK"
msgid "To the Ryudo office."
msgstr "All'ufficio Ryudo."

msgctxt "51\t242476\t21\tCHK"
msgid "Could use a chat with this boss of yours."
msgstr "Potrebbe servirmi una chiacchierata con questo tuo capo."

msgctxt "51\t242518\t22\tCHK"
msgid "Aniki! We've gotta warn him!"
msgstr "Aniki! Dobbiamo avvisarlo!"

msgctxt "51\t242547\t23\tCHK"
msgid ""
"He doesn't have time to deal\n"
"with petty shit like this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "51\t242603\t24\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Our only job right now\n"
"is keepin' this guy in check."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "51\t242656\t25\tCHK"
msgid "How do you think that'd make me look, huh?"
msgstr "Come pensi che mi farebbe apparire, eh?"

msgctxt "51\t242699\t26\tCHK"
msgid "Then what should I do?"
msgstr "Allora cosa dovrei fare?"

msgctxt "51\t242722\t27\tCHK"
msgid "If you really wanna see the boss..."
msgstr "Se vuoi davvero vedere il capo..."

msgctxt "51\t242758\t28\tCHK"
msgid "You're gonna have to beat me first!"
msgstr "Dovrai battermi prima!"

msgctxt "51\t242794\t29\tCHK"
msgid "Huh. Is that it?"
msgstr "Eh. È tutto?"

msgctxt "51\t242811\t30\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You don't know who you're\n"
"messing with, old man!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "51\t242860\t31\tCHK"
msgid "The captain's not gonna go easy on you!"
msgstr "Non importa come lo fai."

msgctxt "51\t242900\t32\tCHK"
msgid "Captain?"
msgstr "Capitano?"

msgctxt "51\t242909\t33\tCHK"
msgid "You heard me!"
msgstr "Mi hai sentito."

msgctxt "51\t242923\t34\tCHK"
msgid ""
"My aniki here is the captain\n"
"of the Ryudo Family..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "51\t242975\t35\tCHK"
msgid "The Fighting Viper, Rikiya Shimabukuro-san!"
msgstr "La Vipera Combattente, Rikiya Shimabukuro-san!"

msgctxt "51\t243019\t36\tCHK"
msgid "Now run while you still can, asshole!"
msgstr "Adesso corri finché puoi, stronzo!"

msgctxt "51\t243057\t37\tCHK"
msgid "Put a sock in it."
msgstr "Mettici un calzino."

msgctxt "51\t243075\t38\tCHK"
msgid "What was that!?"
msgstr "Cosa hai detto?"

msgctxt "51\t243091\t39\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I can't imagine this makes\n"
"your family look too good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "51\t243145\t40\tCHK"
msgid "You might be a big shot down here in Okinawa..."
msgstr "Potresti essere un pezzo grosso qui a Okinawa..."

msgctxt "51\t243193\t41\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But if you think that'll scare me off,\n"
"you're just a damn fool."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "51\t243257\t42\tCHK"
msgid "Hold this for me."
msgstr "Tieni questo per me."

msgctxt "51\t243275\t43\tCHK"
msgid "Well?"
msgstr "Allora?"

msgctxt "51\t243281\t44\tCHK"
msgid "Cute snake you've got there."
msgstr "Bel serpente che hai lì."

msgctxt "51\t243310\t45\tCHK"
msgid "What did you say!?"
msgstr "Che hai detto!?"

msgctxt "51\t243329\t46\tCHK"
msgid "It's not a snake!"
msgstr "Non è un serpente!"

msgctxt "51\t243347\t47\tCHK"
msgid "It's a goddamn viper!"
msgstr "È una maledetta vipera!"

msgctxt "51\t243369\t48\tCHK"
msgid "That's why they call me the Fighting Viper!"
msgstr "Ecco perché mi chiamano la Vipera Combattente!"

msgctxt "51\t243413\t49\tCHK"
msgid "Doesn't matter to me what it is."
msgstr "Non mi importa di cosa si tratta."

msgctxt "51\t243446\t50\tCHK"
msgid "Well it should! This thing's the symbol of Okinawa!"
msgstr "Beh, dovrebbe! Questa cosa è il simbolo di Okinawa!"

msgctxt "51\t243498\t51\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Got the heart and soul of this island\n"
"right on my damn back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "51\t243559\t52\tCHK"
msgid "Safe to say you like your hometown, then."
msgstr "Si può dire con certezza che ti piace la tua città natale, allora."

msgctxt "51\t243601\t53\tCHK"
msgid "Damn right!"
msgstr "Dannatamente giusto!"

msgctxt "51\t243613\t54\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And now I'm gonna show you\n"
"just what Okinawa's all about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "51\t243671\t55\tCHK"
msgid "Mikio! Back off, this one's mine!"
msgstr "Mikio! Stai indietro, questo è mio!"

msgctxt "51\t243705\t56\tCHK"
msgid "Ready to rumble?"
msgstr "Pronti a rimbombare?"

msgctxt "51\t243722\t57\tCHK"
msgid "Ready when you are."
msgstr "Pronto quando vuoi."

msgctxt "51\t243742\t58\tCHK"
msgid "Then bring it!"
msgstr "Allora portalo!"

msgctxt "51\t243757\t59\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You boys make a habit of dishing out\n"
"eviction notices to ordinary civilians?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "51\t243834\t60\tCHK"
msgid ""
"So sorry to say, I can't let you\n"
"just stroll on over to our office."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "51\t243902\t61\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Don't try n' talk your way outta this,\n"
"you fucking coward!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "52\t246376\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "52\t246377\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Aniki!"
msgstr "Capo"

msgctxt "52\t246384\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Well?"
msgstr "Allora?"

msgctxt "52\t246390\t3\tCHK"
msgid "I may be mainland."
msgstr "Potrei essere sulla terraferma."

msgctxt "52\t246409\t4\tCHK"
msgid "And I may be old."
msgstr "E potrei essere vecchio."

msgctxt "52\t246427\t5\tCHK"
msgid "But I still hit pretty hard, huh?"
msgstr "Ma colpisco ancora piuttosto forte, eh?"

msgctxt "52\t246461\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Now that promise."
msgstr "Ora quella promessa."

msgctxt "52\t246479\t7\tCHK"
msgid "I want you to take me to your boss."
msgstr "Voglio che mi porti dal tuo capo."

msgctxt "52\t246515\t8\tCHK"
msgid "...All right."
msgstr "...Va bene."

msgctxt "52\t246529\t9\tCHK"
msgid "A deal's a deal."
msgstr "Un accordo è un accordo."

msgctxt "52\t246546\t10\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Shit... The hell's he eat\n"
"to get that strong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "53\t247720\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "53\t247721\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Right this way."
msgstr "Da questa parte."

msgctxt "53\t247737\t2\tCHK"
msgid "After you."
msgstr "Dopo di te."

msgctxt "53\t247748\t3\tCHK"
msgid "I'll go get the boss."
msgstr "Vado a chiamare il capo."

msgctxt "53\t247770\t4\tCHK"
msgid "It won't be a minute."
msgstr "Non ci vorrà un minuto."

msgctxt "53\t247792\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Hey. Sorry to keep you waiting."
msgstr "Ciao. Scusa l'attesa."

msgctxt "53\t247824\t6\tCHK"
msgid "So you're Kiryu-san."
msgstr "Quindi tu sei Kiryu-san."

msgctxt "53\t247845\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Hear you and Rikiya had a little scuffle."
msgstr "Ho sentito che tu e Rikiya avete avuto un piccolo litigio."

msgctxt "53\t247887\t8\tCHK"
msgid "There's something I want to ask you."
msgstr "C'è qualcosa che devo chiederti."

msgctxt "53\t247924\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Lemme guess, the eviction notices?"
msgstr "Fammi indovinare, gli avvisi di sfratto?"

msgctxt "53\t247959\t10\tCHK"
msgid "That's right."
msgstr "Esatto."

msgctxt "53\t247973\t11\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Why are you so intent on kicking us out?\n"
"I need to know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "53\t248030\t12\tCHK"
msgid "Saki."
msgstr "Saki."

msgctxt "53\t248036\t13\tCHK"
msgid "Hey, Saki."
msgstr "Ehi, Saki."

msgctxt "53\t248047\t14\tCHK"
msgid "We got grown-up stuff to talk about."
msgstr "Abbiamo cose da adulti di cui parlare."

msgctxt "53\t248084\t15\tCHK"
msgid "Mind taking it to your room for a bit?"
msgstr "Ti dispiace portarlo in camera tua per un po'?"

msgctxt "54\t250456\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "54\t250457\t1\tCHK"
msgid "I get where you're coming from."
msgstr "Capisco da dove vieni."

msgctxt "54\t250489\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Great. Then we'll just⑬"
msgstr "Grande. Allora semplicemente⑬"

msgctxt "54\t250515\t3\tCHK"
msgid "I'm not going."
msgstr "Non ci andrò."

msgctxt "54\t250530\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Whaddya mean!?"
msgstr "Che vuoi dire?"

msgctxt "54\t250545\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Everything you said makes sense."
msgstr "Tutto quello che hai detto ha senso."

msgctxt "54\t250578\t6\tCHK"
msgid "But that's no excuse."
msgstr "Dice il ragazzo che si strugge per Kiryu-san."

msgctxt "54\t250600\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Only a self-absorbed thug\n"
"would think of it like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "54\t250655\t8\tCHK"
msgid "You watch your tongue."
msgstr "Stai attento alla lingua."

msgctxt "54\t250678\t9\tCHK"
msgid "...I was yakuza too, once."
msgstr "...Anch'io ero yakuza, una volta."

msgctxt "54\t250705\t10\tCHK"
msgid ""
"An expert at finding reasons\n"
"to ruin other people's lives."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "54\t250764\t11\tCHK"
msgid "If anything I was too good at it."
msgstr "Semmai ero troppo bravo."

msgctxt "54\t250798\t12\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Do you realize what would happen\n"
"to those kids if you get your way?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "54\t250866\t13\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Bullshit we are!\n"
"Don't you walk away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "54\t250904\t14\tCHK"
msgid "I might be an old Okinawan fart..."
msgstr "Potrei essere un vecchio scoreggiatore di Okinawa..."

msgctxt "54\t250939\t15\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But I'm not gonna let some mainland punk\n"
"talk to me like that. You get me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "54\t251014\t16\tCHK"
msgid "Are you sure this is what you want?"
msgstr "Sei sicuro che sia questo quello che vuoi?"

msgctxt "54\t251050\t17\tCHK"
msgid "Huh!?"
msgstr "Eh!?"

msgctxt "54\t251056\t18\tCHK"
msgid "So tell me. Will that satisfy you?"
msgstr "Allora dimmi. Ti soddisferà?"

msgctxt "54\t251091\t19\tCHK"
msgid "Now if you really love Okinawa..."
msgstr "Ora, se ami davvero Okinawa..."

msgctxt "54\t251125\t20\tCHK"
msgid "I'll fight you if need be..."
msgstr "Combatterò con te, se necessario..."

msgctxt "54\t251154\t21\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But you should know.\n"
"I won't hold anything back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "54\t251203\t22\tCHK"
msgid ""
"So listen close. As long as I'm around,\n"
"my orphanage and everyone in it is staying put."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "54\t251291\t23\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Understand?\n"
"We're done here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "54\t251320\t24\tCHK"
msgid ""
"If you kill me,\n"
"my kids will have nowhere to turn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "54\t251371\t25\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You should do what you can to help the island\n"
"instead of trying to evict innocent children."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55\t257848\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55\t257849\t1\tCHK"
msgid "On to our next story..."
msgstr "Alla nostra prossima storia..."

msgctxt "55\t257873\t2\tCHK"
msgid "both paid a visit to the embattled region today."
msgstr "entrambi hanno fatto visita oggi alla regione assediata."

msgctxt "55\t257922\t3\tCHK"
msgid "And what do the locals think of all this?"
msgstr "E cosa ne pensano i locali di tutto questo?"

msgctxt "55\t257964\t4\tCHK"
msgid ""
"We're crawling with\n"
"American soldiers as is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55\t258009\t5\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But a resort? Now that's something\n"
"I might be able to get behind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55\t258075\t6\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Even if someone does go and shoot missiles at us,\n"
"I'd be willing to bet it'd be at Tokyo, not Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55\t258178\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Guess I'm not surprised Tamiya-san's not really\n"
"thinkin' about what's best for us, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55\t258269\t8\tCHK"
msgid ""
"As aspiring prime minister candidates, both men are\n"
"likely to be under intense scrutiny for some time now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55\t258376\t9\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Uncle Kaz... Is that why they keep\n"
"trying to kick us out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55\t258434\t10\tCHK"
msgid ""
"A key figure in the liberal push for Okinawa\n"
"military expansion, Defense Minister Ryuzo Tamiya,"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55\t258530\t11\tCHK"
msgid ""
"and the man in charge of the Okinawa resort deal\n"
"currently underway, Land Minister Yoshinobu Suzuki,"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55\t258631\t12\tCHK"
msgid ""
"On one side is Tamiya-san, a proponent of the island's\n"
"newly proposed BMD, or ballistic missile defense system."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55\t258743\t13\tCHK"
msgid ""
"While on the other is Suzuki-san, who has long opposed\n"
"expansion of American military presence on Okinawan shores."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55\t258858\t14\tCHK"
msgid ""
"He suggests that the government instead focus its efforts\n"
"on a new resort which will drive tourism to the region."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55\t258972\t15\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Political and business leaders alike are paying close\n"
"attention to just what these two men's visits will entail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55\t259085\t16\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Tamiya-san's journey got off to a rocky start as he\n"
"was greeted at the airport by throngs of protesters..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55\t259192\t17\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Carrying signs and handing out flyers opposing\n"
"his proposed military expansion plans."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55\t259278\t18\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Suzuki-san, on the other hand, was met by\n"
"a faction of local businessmen and financiers,"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55\t259367\t19\tCHK"
msgid ""
"who proceeded to take him on a personal guided tour\n"
"of the intended site for his forthcoming resort."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55\t259468\t20\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The two proposals, Tamiya-san's military expansion\n"
"deal and Suzuki-san's plan for a new resort,"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55\t259564\t21\tCHK"
msgid ""
"have been met with mixed opinions from\n"
"the people of Okinawa. Needless to say..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55\t259645\t22\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Both ministers will need to compromise\n"
"if they hope to accomplish their goals."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55\t259724\t23\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Of course, it's clear that this BMD system is vital\n"
"to ensuring Japan has a bright, stable future."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55\t259823\t24\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But I won't let us keep forcing Okinawa to sacrifice\n"
"its own well-being for the country's defense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55\t259922\t25\tCHK"
msgid ""
"My resort development plan will help promote tourism\n"
"to the island and dramatically stimulate its economy,"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55\t260029\t26\tCHK"
msgid ""
"thus creating new jobs and opportunities for the humble\n"
"people of this beautiful land. I say, Okinawa first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55\t260138\t27\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Defending our home is all that concerns me.\n"
"I have nothing more to say on the matter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55\t260224\t28\tCHK"
msgid ""
"As opposed to the seemingly\n"
"more receptive Suzuki-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55\t260281\t29\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Tamiya-san departed the airport clearly\n"
"uninterested in entertaining interviews."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55\t260362\t30\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The unannounced nature of the two ministers' visits\n"
"has fueled speculation that both men will attempt to..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55\t260470\t31\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Push their respective proposals through the National Diet\n"
"at some point in the coming weeks and months."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "55\t260574\t32\tCHK"
msgid "In other news..."
msgstr "Nelle altre notizie..."

msgctxt "56\t262664\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "56\t262665\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Back again?"
msgstr "Di nuovo indietro?"

msgctxt "56\t262677\t2\tCHK"
msgid "My answer is final."
msgstr "La mia risposta è definitiva."

msgctxt "56\t262697\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Nah..."
msgstr "No..."

msgctxt "56\t262704\t4\tCHK"
msgid "That's not why I'm here."
msgstr "Non è per questo che sono qui."

msgctxt "56\t262729\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr "Mh?"

msgctxt "56\t262733\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Then what is it?"
msgstr "Allora cos'è?"

msgctxt "56\t262750\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Well, Aniki... I kinda need\n"
"to ask you a favor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "57\t264920\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "57\t264921\t1\tCHK"
msgid "All right. What do you need me to do?"
msgstr "Va bene. Cosa hai bisogno che io faccia?"

msgctxt "57\t264959\t2\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Well... with Saki-san gone and all,\n"
"the boss is kinda losin' it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "57\t265024\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Why me?"
msgstr "Perché io?"

msgctxt "57\t265032\t4\tCHK"
msgid "You're the only one he'll listen to, Aniki!"
msgstr "Sei l'unico che darà ascolto, Aniki!"

msgctxt "57\t265076\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Stop right there."
msgstr "Fermo lì!"

msgctxt "57\t265094\t6\tCHK"
msgid "...Yeah?"
msgstr "...Sì?"

msgctxt "57\t265103\t7\tCHK"
msgid "I mean..."
msgstr "Intendo..."

msgctxt "57\t265113\t8\tCHK"
msgid "It's 'cause you're my aniki. Duh."
msgstr "È perché sei il mio Aniki. Già."

msgctxt "57\t265147\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Eh, let's talk about this later."
msgstr "Eh, ne parliamo più tardi."

msgctxt "57\t265180\t10\tCHK"
msgid "What would my kids think?"
msgstr "Cosa penserebbero i miei figli?"

msgctxt "57\t265206\t11\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Don't you see?\n"
"You're my aniki, Aniki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "57\t265245\t12\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Anyway, I'm gonna go pull the car around!\n"
"See ya soon, Aniki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "57\t265307\t13\tCHK"
msgid ""
"So we need some help pulling him back.\n"
"Talk some sense into him, Aniki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "57\t265379\t14\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The boss took a shine to you\n"
"the moment you stepped foot in our office."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "57\t265451\t15\tCHK"
msgid ""
"What are you getting at here?\n"
"It's all \"aniki\" this and \"aniki\" that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "57\t265521\t16\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You're the captain of the Ryudo Family.\n"
"I'm nothing to you, especially not your aniki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "57\t265608\t17\tCHK"
msgid ""
"No. I can't have a yakuza\n"
"talking to me like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "57\t265659\t18\tCHK"
msgid ""
"C'mon, just let it slide!\n"
"I respect your strength, that's all!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "58\t267144\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "58\t267145\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Oh, Cap! Kiryu-aniki!"
msgstr "Oh, Capitano! Kiryu-aniki!"

msgctxt "58\t267167\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Where's the boss?"
msgstr "Dov'è il capo?"

msgctxt "58\t267185\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Hey there. You're not looking so hot."
msgstr "Ehilà. Non sei così attraente."

msgctxt "58\t267223\t4\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Inside. Got all sauced up on awamori,\n"
"so he's not in the best of moods..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "58\t267297\t5\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Goddammit!\n"
"The hell'm I gonna do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "58\t267331\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Oh! Well if it ain't Kiryu-san!"
msgstr "OH! Beh, se non è Kiryu-san!"

msgctxt "59\t268792\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "59\t268793\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Fine then."
msgstr "Bene, allora."

msgctxt "59\t268804\t2\tCHK"
msgid "I'll go talk to Saki myself."
msgstr "Andrò a parlare io stesso con Saki."

msgctxt "59\t268833\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Huh? The hell're you doin'!?"
msgstr "Eh? Che diavolo stai facendo!?"

msgctxt "59\t268862\t4\tCHK"
msgid "The same thing you did three years ago."
msgstr "La stessa cosa che hai fatto tre anni fa."

msgctxt "59\t268902\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Don't worry."
msgstr "Non preoccuparti."

msgctxt "59\t268915\t6\tCHK"
msgid "That's a conversation for another time."
msgstr "Questa è una conversazione per un'altra volta."

msgctxt "59\t268955\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Saki's the only thing\n"
"I'm thinking about right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "59\t269007\t8\tCHK"
msgid "You..."
msgstr "Tu..."

msgctxt "59\t269014\t9\tCHK"
msgid "And I'll be borrowing one of your boys."
msgstr "E prenderò in prestito uno dei tuoi ragazzi."

msgctxt "59\t269054\t10\tCHK"
msgid "Let's go, Rikiya."
msgstr "Andiamo, Rikiya."

msgctxt "59\t269072\t11\tCHK"
msgid "Coming, Aniki!"
msgstr "Arrivo, Aniki!"

msgctxt "59\t269087\t12\tCHK"
msgid ""
"She needs help now more than ever,\n"
"and I'm not about to let her down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "59\t269157\t13\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Hold on there! If you think this'll\n"
"change my mind about the land..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "59\t269226\t14\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I just want to get Saki home safe.\n"
"The land has nothing to do with it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "60\t270456\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "60\t270457\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Eh?"

msgctxt "60\t270462\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Who's this asshole?"
msgstr "Chi è questo stronzo?"

msgctxt "60\t270482\t3\tCHK"
msgid "You lost, little Ryudo boy?"
msgstr "Hai perso, piccolo Ryudo?"

msgctxt "60\t270510\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Where's Saki?"
msgstr "Dov'è Saki?"

msgctxt "60\t270524\t5\tCHK"
msgid "You mean the brat?"
msgstr "Intendi il moccioso?"

msgctxt "60\t270543\t6\tCHK"
msgid "She's up with the boss."
msgstr "She's up with the boss."

msgctxt "60\t270567\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Sorry."
msgstr "Scusa."

msgctxt "60\t270574\t8\tCHK"
msgid "But the only way you're gettin' up there..."
msgstr "Ma l'unico modo per arrivare lassù..."

msgctxt "60\t270618\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Is in a body bag!"
msgstr "È in un sacco per cadaveri!"

msgctxt "60\t270636\t10\tCHK"
msgid "I don't have time for this."
msgstr "Non ho tempo per questo."
"Non ho tempo\n"
"per questo."

msgctxt "60\t270664\t11\tCHK"
msgid "Let me through."
msgstr "Fammi passare."

msgctxt "60\t270680\t12\tCHK"
msgid "Well someone's got balls."
msgstr "Beh, qualcuno ha le palle."

msgctxt "60\t270706\t13\tCHK"
msgid "Go on, boys!"
msgstr "Avanti, ragazzi!"

msgctxt "60\t270719\t14\tCHK"
msgid "Tear him a new one!"
msgstr "Strappagliene uno nuovo!"

msgctxt "61\t273464\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "61\t273465\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Saki..."
msgstr "Saki..."

msgctxt "61\t273473\t2\tCHK"
msgid "So the Ryudo's got some new muscle."
msgstr "Quindi il Ryudo ha dei nuovi muscoli."

msgctxt "61\t273509\t3\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And he crushed my boys all by himself.\n"
"Color me impressed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "61\t273568\t4\tCHK"
msgid "I'm not Ryudo Family."
msgstr "Non faccio parte della famiglia Ryudo."

msgctxt "61\t273590\t5\tCHK"
msgid "I'm just here for the girl."
msgstr "Sono qui solo per la ragazza."

msgctxt "61\t273618\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Not sure I get how that's possible."
msgstr "Non sono sicuro di capire come sia possibile."

msgctxt "61\t273654\t7\tCHK"
msgid "It doesn't matter who asked me to come."
msgstr "Non importa chi mi ha chiesto di venire."

msgctxt "61\t273694\t8\tCHK"
msgid "One way or another, you're giving me the girl."
msgstr "In un modo o nell'altro, mi darai la ragazza."

msgctxt "61\t273741\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Like hell I am!"
msgstr "Cavolo, lo sono!"

msgctxt "61\t273757\t10\tCHK"
msgid "...Bargaining chip?"
msgstr "...Chiamata di scambio?"

msgctxt "61\t273777\t11\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Shame what this sweet little girl's\n"
"had to go through."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "61\t273832\t12\tCHK"
msgid "First she watches her dad hang himself..."
msgstr "Prima guarda suo padre impiccarsi..."

msgctxt "61\t273874\t13\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Now her own mother kidnaps her\n"
"for some bullshit \"love.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "61\t273931\t14\tCHK"
msgid "What's this world coming to?"
msgstr "A cosa sta andando questo mondo?"

msgctxt "61\t273960\t15\tCHK"
msgid "What do you mean? Our love is the real deal!"
msgstr "Cosa intendi? Il nostro amore è il vero affare!"

msgctxt "61\t274005\t16\tCHK"
msgid "You said the three of us would be a family!"
msgstr "Avevi detto che noi tre saremmo stati una famiglia!"

msgctxt "61\t274049\t17\tCHK"
msgid "Me, shack up with an old slut like you?"
msgstr "Io, vado a letto con una vecchia troia come te?"

msgctxt "61\t274089\t18\tCHK"
msgid "You outta your fucking mind!?"
msgstr "Sei fuori di testa, cazzo!?"

msgctxt "61\t274119\t19\tCHK"
msgid "You're not serious... right?"
msgstr "Non sei serio... vero?"

msgctxt "61\t274148\t20\tCHK"
msgid ""
"It was a joke, right!?\n"
"Say something!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "61\t274186\t21\tCHK"
msgid "Tell me this isn't happening!"
msgstr "Dimmi che non sta succedendo!"

msgctxt "61\t274216\t22\tCHK"
msgid "Get your... filthy hands... off of me!"
msgstr "Togli le tue... sporche mani... di dosso!"

msgctxt "61\t274255\t23\tCHK"
msgid "Shame. You could've used the facelift."
msgstr "Vergogna. Avresti potuto usare il lifting."

msgctxt "61\t274294\t24\tCHK"
msgid "Don't think I forgot about you."
msgstr "Non pensare che mi sia dimenticato di te."

msgctxt "61\t274326\t25\tCHK"
msgid "Once I kill you..."
msgstr "Una volta che ti avrò ucciso..."

msgctxt "61\t274345\t26\tCHK"
msgid "Nakahara's gonna get a nice package."
msgstr "Nakahara riceverà un bel pacco."

msgctxt "61\t274382\t27\tCHK"
msgid "Full of your fingers."
msgstr "Pieno delle tue dita."

msgctxt "61\t274404\t28\tCHK"
msgid "Well this is a disappointment."
msgstr "Beh, questa è una delusione."

msgctxt "61\t274435\t29\tCHK"
msgid "Oh?"
msgstr "Davvero?"

msgctxt "61\t274439\t30\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I'm not a fan of raising my fists\n"
"to lowlifes like you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "61\t274495\t31\tCHK"
msgid "Yeah, real fucking saint you are."
msgstr "Sì, sei proprio un santo, cazzo."

msgctxt "61\t274529\t32\tCHK"
msgid "But there's one thing I like even less."
msgstr "Ma c'è una cosa che mi piace ancora meno."

msgctxt "61\t274569\t33\tCHK"
msgid "The thought of letting you go."
msgstr "Il pensiero di lasciarti andare."

msgctxt "61\t274600\t34\tCHK"
msgid "Huh!?"
msgstr "Eh!?"

msgctxt "61\t274606\t35\tCHK"
msgid "Now come get some!"
msgstr "Adesso vieni a prenderne un po'!"

msgctxt "61\t274625\t36\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Nakahara's the only one who'd\n"
"lift a finger for this brat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "61\t274684\t37\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You think I'd let my one\n"
"bargaining chip walk that easy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "61\t274741\t38\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You don't know a damn thing, huh?\n"
"You're more naive than you look."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "61\t274808\t39\tCHK"
msgid "I got everything I need from you, hag."
msgstr "Ho avuto tutto ciò di cui avevo bisogno da te, strega."

msgctxt "62\t277800\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "62\t277801\t1\tCHK"
msgid "The hell..."
msgstr "Che diavolo...?"

msgctxt "62\t277813\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Is a guy like you..."
msgstr "È un ragazzo come te..."

msgctxt "62\t277834\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Doin' in Okinawa?"
msgstr "Stai facendo ad Okinawa?"

msgctxt "62\t277852\t4\tCHK"
msgid "You all right, Aniki?"
msgstr "Tutto bene, Aniki?"

msgctxt "62\t277874\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Saki!"
msgstr "Saki!"

msgctxt "62\t277880\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Saki..."
msgstr "Saki..."

msgctxt "62\t277888\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Nakahara-san here..."
msgstr "Tutto quello che voglio... è proteggere Morning Glory."

msgctxt "62\t277909\t8\tCHK"
msgid ""
"He's been worried sick\n"
"since you disappeared."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "62\t277955\t9\tCHK"
msgid "He was miserable."
msgstr "Era infelice."

msgctxt "62\t277973\t10\tCHK"
msgid "So now you have a choice, Saki."
msgstr "Quindi ora hai una scelta, Saki."

msgctxt "62\t278005\t11\tCHK"
msgid "Nakahara or your mom?"
msgstr "Nakahara o tua madre?"

msgctxt "62\t278027\t12\tCHK"
msgid "I don't want her."
msgstr "Non la voglio."

msgctxt "62\t278045\t13\tCHK"
msgid "Just like she doesn't want me."
msgstr "Proprio come lei non mi vuole."

msgctxt "62\t278076\t14\tCHK"
msgid "You're all a bunch of fucking morons!"
msgstr "Siete tutti un mucchio di fottuti idioti!"

msgctxt "62\t278114\t15\tCHK"
msgid "Don't you get it?"
msgstr "Non capisci?"

msgctxt "62\t278132\t16\tCHK"
msgid "This little bitch ruined my life!"
msgstr "Questa piccola stronzetta mi ha rovinato la vita!"

msgctxt "62\t278166\t17\tCHK"
msgid ""
"From the moment she was born,\n"
"everything was about her!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "62\t278222\t18\tCHK"
msgid ""
"How selfish do you have to be\n"
"to say that to your own kid!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "62\t278282\t19\tCHK"
msgid "I'll say what I want! Don't touch me!"
msgstr "Dirò quello che voglio! Non toccarmi!"

msgctxt "62\t278320\t20\tCHK"
msgid ""
"If you want her weighing you down that bad,\n"
"just fucking take her!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "62\t278387\t21\tCHK"
msgid "Some mother you are."
msgstr "Che mamma sei."

msgctxt "62\t278408\t22\tCHK"
msgid "Saying all that in front of your kid..."
msgstr "Dire tutto questo davanti a tuo figlio..."

msgctxt "62\t278448\t23\tCHK"
msgid "Saki's gonna have it rough with her."
msgstr "Saki avrà delle difficoltà con lei."

msgctxt "62\t278485\t24\tCHK"
msgid "Saki'll be just fine."
msgstr "Saki starà bene."

msgctxt "62\t278507\t25\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You've never looked in\n"
"her sketchbook, have you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "62\t278556\t26\tCHK"
msgid "No."
msgstr "NO."

msgctxt "62\t278560\t27\tCHK"
msgid "Then open it."
msgstr "Quindi aprilo."

msgctxt "62\t278574\t28\tCHK"
msgid "\"Thank you for protecting me.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "62\t278605\t29\tCHK"
msgid "Well? There's your answer."
msgstr "BENE? Ecco la tua risposta."

msgctxt "62\t278632\t30\tCHK"
msgid "She's your daughter now."
msgstr "Lei è tua figlia adesso."

msgctxt "62\t278657\t31\tCHK"
msgid "Isn't that right, Saki?"
msgstr "Non è vero, Saki?"

msgctxt "62\t278681\t32\tCHK"
msgid "Oh, Saki!"
msgstr "Oh, Saki!"

msgctxt "62\t278691\t33\tCHK"
msgid "Thank you... Thank you so much...!"
msgstr "Grazie... Grazie di cuore!"

msgctxt "62\t278726\t34\tCHK"
msgid "Saki... Saki!"
msgstr "Ero tutto io."

msgctxt "62\t278740\t35\tCHK"
msgid ""
"He was convinced you ran off\n"
"so you could live with your mom."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "63\t281192\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "63\t281193\t1\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I mean it! I can't thank you enough\n"
"for what you did for me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "63\t281254\t2\tCHK"
msgid "That's enough."
msgstr "Basta così."

msgctxt "63\t281269\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Oh, no! I'm not done yet!"
msgstr "Oh no! Non ho ancora finito!"

msgctxt "63\t281295\t4\tCHK"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "63\t281301\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Coming through."
msgstr "Sto arrivando."

msgctxt "63\t281317\t6\tCHK"
msgid "What are you guys up to?"
msgstr "Oi, ragazzi, che combinate?"

msgctxt "63\t281342\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Be my brother, Kiryu."
msgstr "Sii mio fratello, Kiryu."

msgctxt "63\t281364\t8\tCHK"
msgid "Please! I won't take no for an answer!"
msgstr "Per favore! Non accetterò un no come risposta!"

msgctxt "63\t281403\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Now let's swear this oath."
msgstr "Daigo."

msgctxt "63\t281430\t10\tCHK"
msgid "Hold on a second."
msgstr "Aspetta un secondo."

msgctxt "63\t281448\t11\tCHK"
msgid "I left the yakuza life behind."
msgstr "Mi sono lasciato alle spalle la vita della yakuza."

msgctxt "63\t281479\t12\tCHK"
msgid "Who gives a damn!"
msgstr "Chi se ne frega!"

msgctxt "63\t281497\t13\tCHK"
msgid "Kinda selfish, don't you think?"
msgstr "Un po' egoista, non credi?"

msgctxt "63\t281529\t14\tCHK"
msgid ""
"We don't have a witness or anything,\n"
"but this'll do. Now please!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "63\t281594\t15\tCHK"
msgid ""
"If it's a witness you need,\n"
"I'd be glad to oblige."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "63\t281645\t16\tCHK"
msgid "Daigo."
msgstr "Daigo."

msgctxt "63\t281652\t17\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I've been on this yakuza scene near 40 years now...\n"
"and never once have I met a man like you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "63\t281746\t18\tCHK"
msgid ""
"After what happened tonight,\n"
"I want you to be my sworn brother."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "63\t281810\t19\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I wanna do this as a show of respect.\n"
"That's all I need."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "64\t284680\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "64\t284681\t1\tCHK"
msgid ""
"In any case, I hope we can move on from\n"
"this matter both quickly and peaceably."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "64\t284761\t2\tCHK"
msgid "We should be going, Toma-kun."
msgstr "Dovremmo andare, Toma-kun."

msgctxt "64\t284791\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "64\t284796\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Daigo."
msgstr "Daigo."

msgctxt "64\t284803\t5\tCHK"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "E cioè?"

msgctxt "64\t284815\t6\tCHK"
msgid ""
"If the Tojo Clan ever does\n"
"decide to come for my land..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "64\t284872\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Just give me a heads up first, okay?"
msgstr "Prima avvisami, ok?"

msgctxt "64\t284909\t8\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Those kids depend on me\n"
"as they would their actual father."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "64\t284968\t9\tCHK"
msgid "I understand."
msgstr "Capisco..."

msgctxt "64\t284982\t10\tCHK"
msgid "But you needn't worry."
msgstr "Ma non devi preoccuparti."

msgctxt "64\t285005\t11\tCHK"
msgid ""
"As long as I'm chairman,\n"
"the Tojo will stay far away from Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "64\t285072\t12\tCHK"
msgid "You promise?"
msgstr "Lo prometti?"

msgctxt "64\t285085\t13\tCHK"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr "E di che."

msgctxt "64\t285096\t14\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I'm well aware of how\n"
"resilient you are, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "64\t285148\t15\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Incurring your wrath would\n"
"likely be the last thing I did."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "64\t285207\t16\tCHK"
msgid "Right, Toma-kun?"
msgstr "L'intero viaggio dura poco meno di un'ora."

msgctxt "64\t285224\t17\tCHK"
msgid "You'll be an old man by then, Kiryu-san."
msgstr "A quel punto sarai un vecchio, Kiryu-san."

msgctxt "64\t285265\t18\tCHK"
msgid "Maybe then things will be different."
msgstr "Forse allora le cose andranno diversamente."

msgctxt "64\t285302\t19\tCHK"
msgid "I still won't be a pushover."
msgstr "Non sarò comunque un pushover."

msgctxt "64\t285331\t20\tCHK"
msgid "I expect not."
msgstr "Mi aspetto di no."

msgctxt "64\t285345\t21\tCHK"
msgid "Until next time, Fourth Chairman."
msgstr "Alla prossima, Quarto Presidente."

msgctxt "64\t285379\t22\tCHK"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "64\t285385\t23\tCHK"
msgid "Mind if I ask you somethin'?"
msgstr "Ti spiace se ti chiedo una cosa?"

msgctxt "64\t285414\t24\tCHK"
msgid "Hm? What's up?"
msgstr "Mmh? Che c'è?"

msgctxt "64\t285429\t25\tCHK"
msgid ""
"By, uh... By Fourth Chairman...\n"
"He didn't mean of the Tojo Clan..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "64\t285496\t26\tCHK"
msgid "Did he?"
msgstr "L'ha fatto?"

msgctxt "64\t285504\t27\tCHK"
msgid "And if he did?"
msgstr "E se lo facesse?"

msgctxt "64\t285519\t28\tCHK"
msgid "The Dragon of Dojima, right?"
msgstr "Il Drago di Dojima, giusto?"

msgctxt "64\t285548\t29\tCHK"
msgid "Then you're... Kiryu!?"
msgstr "Allora sei... Kiryu!?"

msgctxt "64\t285571\t30\tCHK"
msgid "Next time you pick a fight..."
msgstr "La prossima volta che inizierai a litigare..."

msgctxt "64\t285601\t31\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You might wanna do a little\n"
"more research first, brother."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "64\t285659\t32\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Look at me, swearin' an oath with\n"
"the biggest fish in the yakuza sea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "64\t285729\t33\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Guess you never know\n"
"what life'll throw at you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "64\t285777\t34\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Toma-kun's dream for Okinawa can wait\n"
"until he himself becomes prime minister."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "64\t285856\t35\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And those children of yours will be\n"
"about the same age I am now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "64\t285921\t36\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You're shittin' me! Everyone who's anyone's\n"
"heard the legends of the Fourth Chairman!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "65\t287416\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "65\t287417\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Yes?"
msgstr "Sì?"

msgctxt "65\t287422\t2\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Kiryu. It's me.\n"
"Kashiwagi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "66\t288200\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "66\t288201\t1\tCHK"
msgid "What's going on, Aniki?"
msgstr "Che succede, Aniki?"

msgctxt "66\t288225\t2\tCHK"
msgid "From the sounds of it..."
msgstr "A quanto pare..."

msgctxt "66\t288250\t3\tCHK"
msgid "The Tojo Clan's Sixth Chairman has been shot."
msgstr "Il sesto presidente del clan Tojo è stato ucciso."

msgctxt "66\t288296\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Hold on a sec."
msgstr "Aspetta un attimo!"

msgctxt "66\t288311\t5\tCHK"
msgid ""
"When you and the boss\n"
"swore your oath a year ago..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "66\t288363\t6\tCHK"
msgid "The Sixth Chairman was the witness, right?"
msgstr "Il Sesto Presidente era il testimone, giusto?"

msgctxt "66\t288406\t7\tCHK"
msgid "And the one who shot Daigo..."
msgstr "E quello che ha sparato a Daigo..."

msgctxt "66\t288436\t8\tCHK"
msgid "It was him."
msgstr "Era lui."

msgctxt "66\t288448\t9\tCHK"
msgid "The man in the drawing."
msgstr "L'uomo nel disegno."

msgctxt "66\t288472\t10\tCHK"
msgid "Yup."
msgstr "Già."

msgctxt "66\t288477\t11\tCHK"
msgid "Looks like it was."
msgstr "Sembra che lo fosse."

msgctxt "67\t289128\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "67\t289129\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Where are the others?"
msgstr "Dove sono gli altri?"

msgctxt "67\t289151\t2\tCHK"
msgid "They all went to bed."
msgstr "Andarono tutti a letto."

msgctxt "68\t290072\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "68\t290073\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Aniki. I..."
msgstr "Aniki. IO..."

msgctxt "68\t290085\t2\tCHK"
msgid "I promise I won't get in your way or anythin'."
msgstr "Prometto che non ti ostacolerò o cose del genere."

msgctxt "68\t290132\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Just please..."
msgstr "Per favore..."

msgctxt "68\t290147\t4\tCHK"
msgid "I'm beggin' you."
msgstr "ti prego."

msgctxt "68\t290164\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Lemme tag along!"
msgstr "Lasciami unirti!"

msgctxt "68\t290181\t6\tCHK"
msgid "...All right."
msgstr "...Va bene."

msgctxt "68\t290195\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Aniki!"
msgstr "Capo"

msgctxt "68\t290202\t8\tCHK"
msgid "You won't regret it, I promise!"
msgstr "Non te ne pentirai, te lo prometto!"

msgctxt "68\t290234\t9\tCHK"
msgid "We leave Okinawa tomorrow night."
msgstr "Partiremo da Okinawa domani sera."

msgctxt "68\t290267\t10\tCHK"
msgid "Head back to the office and pack your things."
msgstr "Torna in ufficio e prepara le tue cose."

msgctxt "68\t290313\t11\tCHK"
msgid "Okay!"
msgstr "Va bene!"

msgctxt "68\t290319\t12\tCHK"
msgid "Haruka."
msgstr "Haruka."

msgctxt "68\t290327\t13\tCHK"
msgid "Take care of Rikiya for me."
msgstr "Prenditi cura di Rikiya per me."

msgctxt "68\t290355\t14\tCHK"
msgid "I can't take him, not now."
msgstr "Non posso prenderlo, non adesso."

msgctxt "68\t290382\t15\tCHK"
msgid "Kamurocho's too dangerous."
msgstr "Kamurocho è troppo pericoloso."

msgctxt "68\t290409\t16\tCHK"
msgid "This burden is mine alone to bear."
msgstr "Questo peso spetta solo a me sopportarlo."

msgctxt "68\t290444\t17\tCHK"
msgid "Uncle Kaz..."
msgstr "Zio Kaz..."

msgctxt "69\t292168\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "69\t292169\t1\tCHK"
msgid "What's up with those clothes, Uncle Kaz?"
msgstr "Che succede con quei vestiti, zio Kaz?"

msgctxt "69\t292210\t2\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I'm actually heading up to Tokyo.\n"
"For about a week."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "69\t292262\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Whoa, really!?"
msgstr "Wow, davvero?"

msgctxt "69\t292277\t4\tCHK"
msgid ""
"That's awesome!\n"
"I'm coming, too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "69\t292310\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Yeah! Take us with you!"
msgstr "Sì! Portaci con te!"

msgctxt "69\t292334\t6\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Sorry, kids.\n"
"It's not gonna be a vacation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "69\t292377\t7\tCHK"
msgid "This is Saki."
msgstr "Questo è Saki."

msgctxt "69\t292391\t8\tCHK"
msgid ""
"She's been through a lot,\n"
"so she has some trouble talking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "69\t292450\t9\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Her dad's hurt, too.\n"
"He's in the hospital right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "69\t292503\t10\tCHK"
msgid ""
"For the time being,\n"
"I told her she can stay here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "69\t292553\t11\tCHK"
msgid ""
"So what do you say?\n"
"Can you make her feel at home?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "69\t292604\t12\tCHK"
msgid "Darn right we can!"
msgstr "Lo dirò a tua madre!"

msgctxt "69\t292623\t13\tCHK"
msgid "Come on, Saki-chan!"
msgstr "Andiamo, Saki-chan!"

msgctxt "69\t292643\t14\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Your Uncle Kaz has some very\n"
"important business to take care of."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "69\t292708\t15\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But while I'm gone, a new friend\n"
"is gonna come live here with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "70\t294264\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "70\t294265\t1\tCHK"
msgid "It's open."
msgstr "E' aperto."

msgctxt "70\t294276\t2\tCHK"
msgid ""
"He wants to arrange a meeting\n"
"of the clan leadership."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "70\t294330\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Well all right then."
msgstr "Bene, allora."

msgctxt "70\t294351\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Cancel it."
msgstr "Annullalo."

msgctxt "70\t294362\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Understood, sir."
msgstr "Capito, signore."

msgctxt "70\t294379\t6\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Chairman. Regarding today's schedule...\n"
"We've received a call from Kashiwagi-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "70\t294461\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And your conference tonight with\n"
"those IT venture capitalists, Chairman?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "70\t294534\t8\tCHK"
msgid ""
"There's no turning your back\n"
"when headquarters comes knocking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "71\t297144\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "71\t297145\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Strange place, China."
msgstr "Posto strano, la Cina."

msgctxt "71\t297167\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Wouldn't you say?"
msgstr "Non diresti?"

msgctxt "71\t297185\t3\tCHK"
msgid "You people eat anything."
msgstr "Voi mangiate qualunque cosa."

msgctxt "71\t297210\t4\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Pigeons, frogs. Hell, even cats and dogs\n"
"end up on the dinner table."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "71\t297279\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Whatever it takes to keep yourselves alive."
msgstr "Qualunque cosa serva per mantenervi in ​​vita."

msgctxt "71\t297323\t6\tCHK"
msgid "But you know, man?"
msgstr "Ma lo sai, amico?"

msgctxt "71\t297342\t7\tCHK"
msgid "I have to hand it to you Chinese snakes."
msgstr "Devo ammetterlo, serpenti cinesi."

msgctxt "71\t297383\t8\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Laying down roots in someone else's\n"
"country takes serious balls."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "71\t297448\t9\tCHK"
msgid "That's a mafia-level move right there."
msgstr "Questa è una mossa di livello mafioso proprio lì."

msgctxt "71\t297487\t10\tCHK"
msgid "I not mafia!"
msgstr "Io non sono mafioso!"

msgctxt "71\t297500\t11\tCHK"
msgid "I just chef!"
msgstr "Sono solo chef!"

msgctxt "71\t297513\t12\tCHK"
msgid ""
"All your neighbors are on board.\n"
"They pay their dues."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "71\t297567\t13\tCHK"
msgid "A million a month."
msgstr "Un milione al mese."

msgctxt "71\t297586\t14\tCHK"
msgid "A million!?"
msgstr "Un milione!?"

msgctxt "71\t297598\t15\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But I'd gladly take the deed to this\n"
"little shithole if you can't pay up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "71\t297672\t16\tCHK"
msgid ""
"There's a job in one of our\n"
"restaurants with your name on it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "71\t297734\t17\tCHK"
msgid "No! It not possible!"
msgstr "Sette o otto minuti!"

msgctxt "71\t297755\t18\tCHK"
msgid "Sometimes I forget how sharp Chinese knives can be."
msgstr "A volte dimentico quanto possano essere affilati i coltelli cinesi."

msgctxt "71\t297807\t19\tCHK"
msgid "Could probably slice a man's head clean off."
msgstr "Probabilmente potrebbe tagliare di netto la testa di un uomo."

msgctxt "71\t297852\t20\tCHK"
msgid "How about we test it out?"
msgstr "Che ne dici di provarlo?"

msgctxt "71\t297878\t21\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Your food's got quite a reputation\n"
"around these parts, Chin-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "71\t297943\t22\tCHK"
msgid "They want to discuss the Sixth Chairman."
msgstr "Vogliono discutere del Sesto Presidente."

msgctxt "71\t297984\t23\tCHK"
msgid "Please, it not possible!"
msgstr "Per favore, non è possibile!"

msgctxt "71\t298009\t24\tCHK"
msgid "Oh yeah?"
msgstr "Ah sì?"

msgctxt "71\t298018\t25\tCHK"
msgid "Fair enough."
msgstr "Giusta osservazione."

msgctxt "71\t298031\t26\tCHK"
msgid "If you can't do it..."
msgstr "Se non puoi farlo..."

msgctxt "71\t298053\t27\tCHK"
msgid "You can't do it."
msgstr "Ce la puoi fare."

msgctxt "71\t298070\t28\tCHK"
msgid "All I wanted was to be partners, Chin-san."
msgstr "Tutto quello che volevo era essere partner, Chin-san."

msgctxt "71\t298113\t29\tCHK"
msgid "Let me know if you change your tune."
msgstr "Fammi sapere se cambi tono."

msgctxt "71\t298150\t30\tCHK"
msgid "Bye now."
msgstr "Ci vediamo."

msgctxt "71\t298159\t31\tCHK"
msgid "Let's be pals, Chin-san."
msgstr "Devo raggiungere la Millenium Tower."

msgctxt "71\t298184\t32\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Considering how long you've been yanking\n"
"our fucking chain... It's a pretty good deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "71\t298271\t33\tCHK"
msgid "Boss. We just received a call from HQ."
msgstr "Capo. Abbiamo appena ricevuto una chiamata dal quartier generale."

msgctxt "71\t298310\t34\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Sorry I had to go shaking\n"
"you up like this, Chin-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "71\t298364\t35\tCHK"
msgid ""
"This'll make it up to you.\n"
"Something to remember me by."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "71\t298420\t36\tCHK"
msgid "My bad if I came on too strong."
msgstr "Colpa mia se sono entrato troppo forte."

msgctxt "72\t301784\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "72\t301785\t1\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Eh, he's never really been\n"
"the discriminatin' type, y'know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "72\t301845\t2\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Anything goes so long as they\n"
"got meat on their bones."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "72\t301900\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Heyo, Nishikiyama Industries."
msgstr "Ehi, industrie Nishikiyama."

msgctxt "72\t301930\t4\tCHK"
msgid "My apologies, sir!"
msgstr "Le mie scuse, signore!"

msgctxt "72\t301949\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Yes. The boss is in at the moment, but..."
msgstr "SÌ. Il capo è qui in questo momento, ma..."

msgctxt "72\t301991\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Huh? A meeting?"
msgstr "Eh? Un incontro?"

msgctxt "72\t302007\t7\tCHK"
msgid "A job well done, sir!"
msgstr "Un lavoro ben fatto, signore!"

msgctxt "72\t302029\t8\tCHK"
msgid "So? What time's it at?"
msgstr "COSÌ? Che ore sono?"

msgctxt "72\t302052\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Eh?"

msgctxt "72\t302057\t10\tCHK"
msgid "The meetin', dipshit!"
msgstr "L'incontro, stronzo!"

msgctxt "72\t302079\t11\tCHK"
msgid "What? How did you...?"
msgstr "Che cosa? Come hai fatto...?"

msgctxt "72\t302101\t12\tCHK"
msgid "There ya go!"
msgstr "Eccoti!"

msgctxt "72\t302114\t13\tCHK"
msgid "That's                                     "
msgstr "Questo è"

msgctxt "72\t302158\t14\tCHK"
msgid "That's what                               "
msgstr "Ecco cosa"

msgctxt "72\t302201\t15\tCHK"
msgid "That's what I'm                          "
msgstr "Questo è quello che sono"

msgctxt "72\t302243\t16\tCHK"
msgid "That's what I'm fuckin'                 "
msgstr "è quello che sto dicendo, cazzo"

msgctxt "72\t302284\t17\tCHK"
msgid "That's what I'm fuckin' talking        "
msgstr "E' di questo che sto parlando, cazzo"

msgctxt "72\t302324\t18\tCHK"
msgid "That's what I'm fuckin' talking about!"
msgstr "E' di questo che sto parlando, cazzo!"

msgctxt "72\t302363\t19\tCHK"
msgid "Thank you very much, sir!"
msgstr "Grazie mille, signore!"

msgctxt "72\t302389\t20\tCHK"
msgid "I'm on top of the goddamn world!"
msgstr "Sono in cima a questo dannato mondo!"

msgctxt "72\t302422\t21\tCHK"
msgid "Nishino! Hirai!"
msgstr "Nishino! Hirai!"

msgctxt "72\t302438\t22\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Round up as many sorry\n"
"sons o' bitches as ya can! Tonight!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "72\t302497\t23\tCHK"
msgid "Miyauchi!"
msgstr "Miyauchi!"

msgctxt "72\t302507\t24\tCHK"
msgid "Horiguchi! Ishida!"
msgstr "Horiguchi! Ishida!"

msgctxt "72\t302526\t25\tCHK"
msgid ""
"It's here...\n"
"The war's finally startin'!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "72\t302567\t26\tCHK"
msgid ""
"No gettin' caught\n"
"with our pants down!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "72\t302606\t27\tCHK"
msgid "I dunno how the boss handles porkers like that."
msgstr "Non so come faccia il capo a trattare dei maiali del genere."

msgctxt "72\t302654\t28\tCHK"
msgid ""
"It's HQ.\n"
"Somethin' about an urgent meetin'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "72\t302698\t29\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Understood, sir.\n"
"I'll pass that along."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "72\t302737\t30\tCHK"
msgid ""
"HQ just rang you up, right!?\n"
"Might be horny as all hell, but I ain't deaf!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "72\t302812\t31\tCHK"
msgid ""
"My apologies, sir!\n"
"They said it's at seven!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "72\t302856\t32\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Give Hasebe a ring!\n"
"That club's gonna be ours once and for all!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "72\t302920\t33\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Phone Mine! Tell him to bring\n"
"a whole fuckin' billion! In cash!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "73\t305080\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "73\t305081\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Hm? Did you say a billion?"
msgstr "Ehm? Hai detto un miliardo?"

msgctxt "73\t305108\t2\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Ya heard me!\n"
"I want it, and I want it in cash!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "73\t305155\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Kanda-aniki. Just what are you planning?"
msgstr "Kanda-aniki. Cosa stai pianificando?"

msgctxt "73\t305196\t4\tCHK"
msgid "A fuckin' war!"
msgstr "Una guerra del cazzo!"

msgctxt "73\t305211\t5\tCHK"
msgid "War?"
msgstr "Guerra?"

msgctxt "73\t305216\t6\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The one that decides who's\n"
"takin' the Tojo reins!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "73\t305266\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Very well."
msgstr "Molto bene."

msgctxt "73\t305277\t8\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Aniki, the sixth chairman is very much alive.\n"
"This seems somehow premature."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "73\t305353\t9\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I'll show you premature!\n"
"Just shut it and bring me my money!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "73\t305414\t10\tCHK"
msgid "Hmph. Asshole."
msgstr "Hmph. Stronzo."

msgctxt "74\t306392\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "74\t306393\t1\tCHK"
msgid "No different than the day I left it."
msgstr "Non è diverso dal giorno in cui l'ho lasciato."

msgctxt "74\t306430\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Help us!"
msgstr "Aiutaci!"

msgctxt "74\t306439\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Owww! Lemme go!"
msgstr "Owww! Lasciami andare!"

msgctxt "74\t306455\t4\tCHK"
msgid "What's the big idea, huh!?"
msgstr "Qual è la grande idea, eh!?"

msgctxt "74\t306482\t5\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Can it! I told you we're booked!\n"
"Now get outta here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "74\t306535\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Ugh!"
msgstr "Uffa!"

msgctxt "74\t306540\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The heck was that!?\n"
"Someone call the cops!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "75\t308056\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "75\t308057\t1\tCHK"
msgid "You can take your cash and shove it!"
msgstr "Sono tutti davvero spaventati..."

msgctxt "75\t308094\t2\tCHK"
msgid "What's that dogshit attitude for, huh?"
msgstr "A cosa serve questo atteggiamento da merda, eh?"

msgctxt "75\t308133\t3\tCHK"
msgid "We're payin' customers!"
msgstr "Stiamo pagando i clienti!"

msgctxt "75\t308157\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Not ones we want."
msgstr "Non quelli che vogliamo."

msgctxt "75\t308175\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Ya host dicks lookin' down on us!?"
msgstr "I vostri padroni di casa ci guardano dall'alto in basso!?"

msgctxt "75\t308210\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Kiryu-san!"
msgstr "Kiryu-san!"

msgctxt "75\t308221\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Gonna have to respectfully ask ya to leave."
msgstr "Nessun riguardo per la posizione che ricopri."

msgctxt "75\t308265\t8\tCHK"
msgid "I can't do that."
msgstr "Non posso."

msgctxt "75\t308282\t9\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Not before I make you tell me\n"
"what you're up to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "75\t308331\t10\tCHK"
msgid "Sure. If that's how you want to take it."
msgstr "Sicuro. Se è così che vuoi prenderla."

msgctxt "75\t308372\t11\tCHK"
msgid "Tear these punks to shreds!"
msgstr "Fai a pezzi questi teppisti!"

msgctxt "75\t308400\t12\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Sorry 'bout this, Fourth Chairman-han.\n"
"Not a spare seat in the house tonight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "75\t308478\t13\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Well, well. That some kinda threat, Chairman-han?\n"
"Can't let that slide, y'know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "75\t308558\t14\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Hear that?\n"
"He's all yours, boys!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76\t309592\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76\t309593\t1\tCHK"
msgid "So..."
msgstr "Allora..."

msgctxt "76\t309599\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Kazuma Kiryu's a fuckin' beast."
msgstr "Kazuma Kiryu è una bestia del cazzo."

msgctxt "76\t309631\t3\tCHK"
msgid "No winnin' against that."
msgstr "Non si può vincere contro questo."

msgctxt "76\t309656\t4\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Now, I asked you a question.\n"
"What are you plotting?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76\t309708\t5\tCHK"
msgid "The wheels're in motion."
msgstr "Le ruote sono in movimento."

msgctxt "76\t309733\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Your boy Kashiwagi's gonna die."
msgstr "Il tuo ragazzo Kashiwagi morirà."

msgctxt "76\t309765\t7\tCHK"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr "Cosa!?"

msgctxt "76\t309772\t8\tCHK"
msgid "This war's... just gettin' started!"
msgstr "Questa guerra è... appena iniziata!"

msgctxt "77\t310904\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "77\t310905\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Been what, two years, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr "Sono passati quanto, due anni, Kiryu-san?"

msgctxt "77\t310938\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Yup."
msgstr "Già."

msgctxt "77\t310943\t3\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The drinks haven't tasted half as\n"
"good without you around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "77\t311002\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Please, take a load off."
msgstr "Per favore, togliti un carico."

msgctxt "77\t311027\t5\tCHK"
msgid "I'm not sure I have time for that."
msgstr "Non sono sicuro di avere tempo per quello."

msgctxt "77\t311062\t6\tCHK"
msgid "You mean because of what Hasebe said?"
msgstr "Intendi per quello che ha detto Hasebe?"

msgctxt "77\t311100\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Yeah. I'm worried about Kashiwagi-san."
msgstr "Sì. Sono preoccupato per Kashiwagi-san."

msgctxt "77\t311139\t8\tCHK"
msgid "I need to get to the Millenium Tower."
msgstr "E Tomà? Dov'è adesso?"

msgctxt "77\t311177\t9\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And this is just a simple dispute\n"
"between two of your hosts?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "77\t311238\t10\tCHK"
msgid "Yes. My apologies for the trouble, officer."
msgstr "SÌ. Mi scuso per il disturbo, agente."

msgctxt "77\t311282\t11\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Just give it a bit.\n"
"Kazuki'll be done with them soon enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "78\t314664\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "78\t314665\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Looks like I'm heading out."
msgstr "Aiutaci!"

msgctxt "78\t314693\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Going to see Kashiwagi-san, I assume?"
msgstr "Andrà a trovare Kashiwagi-san, immagino?"

msgctxt "78\t314731\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "78\t314737\t4\tCHK"
msgid "So? How does it look out there?"
msgstr "COSÌ? Come appare là fuori?"

msgctxt "78\t314769\t5\tCHK"
msgid "That's a problem."
msgstr "Questo è un problema."

msgctxt "78\t314787\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Guess I'll need a way around them."
msgstr "Immagino che avrò bisogno di un modo per aggirarli."

msgctxt "78\t314822\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Already have you covered,\n"
"though it's kinda a pain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "78\t314874\t8\tCHK"
msgid "Got it."
msgstr "Capito."

msgctxt "78\t314882\t9\tCHK"
msgid "I suggest you stay on your guard."
msgstr "Ti suggerisco di stare in guardia."

msgctxt "78\t314916\t10\tCHK"
msgid "What do they look like?"
msgstr "Che aspetto hanno?"

msgctxt "78\t314940\t11\tCHK"
msgid "Men in black suits sporting black sunglasses."
msgstr "Uomini in abiti neri con occhiali da sole neri."

msgctxt "78\t314986\t12\tCHK"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "78\t314992\t13\tCHK"
msgid "Probably to see if he's still alive."
msgstr "Probabilmente per vedere se è ancora vivo."

msgctxt "78\t315029\t14\tCHK"
msgid "I will. Thanks."
msgstr "Lo farò. Grazie."

msgctxt "78\t315045\t15\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Well the cops quit hanging around the club...\n"
"but now they're swarming the Millennium Tower."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "78\t315138\t16\tCHK"
msgid ""
"First head east toward Nakamichi Street, cross that\n"
"toward Pink Street, but head up before you reach it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "78\t315243\t17\tCHK"
msgid ""
"That'll get you into the Millennium Tower\n"
"without the cops ever even noticing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "78\t315322\t18\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san. Cops aside, there have been\n"
"some shady characters around town lately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "78\t315403\t19\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I hear they're foreigners...\n"
"Attempting to track down Daigo Dojima-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "78\t315475\t20\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I'm not sure of the specifics, but it may have\n"
"something to do with why Daigo-san was shot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "78\t315567\t21\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Someone has really been pulling out\n"
"all the stops to find him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "78\t315630\t22\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I don't really want to entertain this thought,\n"
"but if Daigo-san truly is gone..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "78\t315711\t23\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Anyone with hopes of becoming the next chairman\n"
"would be met with some very welcome news."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "78\t315801\t24\tCHK"
msgid ""
"In any case, they're no friends of yours,\n"
"Kiryu-san. Keep your guard up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "79\t317400\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "79\t317401\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Who are you guys?"
msgstr "Chi siete ragazzi?"

msgctxt "79\t317419\t2\tCHK"
msgid "What do you want?"
msgstr "Che vuoi?"

msgctxt "79\t317437\t3\tCHK"
msgid "...Guess you don't speak Japanese."
msgstr "...Immagino che tu non parli giapponese."

msgctxt "79\t317472\t4\tCHK"
msgid "I won't go down easy, though."
msgstr "Non mi arrenderò facilmente, però."

msgctxt "79\t317502\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Sorry..."
msgstr "Scusa..."

msgctxt "79\t317511\t6\tCHK"
msgid "But this might hurt a bit."
msgstr "Ma questo potrebbe far male un po'."

msgctxt "79\t317538\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I get it.\n"
"You're not here to chat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "80\t318200\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "80\t318201\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Let me guess, you're the ones looking for Daigo."
msgstr "Fammi indovinare, sei tu che cerchi Daigo."

msgctxt "80\t318250\t2\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Tell me...\n"
"Who hired you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "81\t318824\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "81\t318825\t1\tCHK"
msgid "It's good to see you, Kiryu."
msgstr "È bello vederti, Kiryu."

msgctxt "81\t318854\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Kashiwagi-san."
msgstr "Kashiwagi-san."

msgctxt "81\t318869\t3\tCHK"
msgid "There's not much time."
msgstr "Non c'è molto tempo!"

msgctxt "81\t318892\t4\tCHK"
msgid "But I need you to be aware of what's going on."
msgstr "Ma ho bisogno che tu sia consapevole di cosa sta succedendo."

msgctxt "81\t318939\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Right."
msgstr "Giusto."

msgctxt "81\t318946\t6\tCHK"
msgid "It concerns today's officers meeting."
msgstr "Riguarda la riunione degli ufficiali di oggi."

msgctxt "82\t324888\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "82\t324889\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Go on your wild ghost chase for Kazama-san..."
msgstr "Continua la tua selvaggia caccia ai fantasmi per Kazama-san..."

msgctxt "82\t324935\t2\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You want the Fourth Chairman\n"
"back in the fold!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "82\t324983\t3\tCHK"
msgid "That's correct."
msgstr "È corretto."

msgctxt "82\t324999\t4\tCHK"
msgid ""
"With the Sixth Chairman indisposed...\n"
"the Tojo Clan lacks an anchor to hold us steady."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "82\t325086\t5\tCHK"
msgid "The shit?"
msgstr "La merda?"

msgctxt "82\t325096\t6\tCHK"
msgid "I must agree."
msgstr "Devo essere d'accordo."

msgctxt "82\t325110\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Mine, you fuckin' dog!"
msgstr "È l'unica cosa che mi resta."

msgctxt "82\t325133\t8\tCHK"
msgid "Kanda-aniki."
msgstr "Kanda-aniki."

msgctxt "82\t325146\t9\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Asking Kiryu-san to step in\n"
"makes the most sense at present."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "82\t325207\t10\tCHK"
msgid "Bullshit it does!"
msgstr "È una stronzata!"

msgctxt "82\t325225\t11\tCHK"
msgid "Captain."
msgstr "Capitano."

msgctxt "82\t325234\t12\tCHK"
msgid "My oath was sworn to the Sixth Chairman."
msgstr "Il mio giuramento è stato prestato al Sesto Presidente."

msgctxt "82\t325275\t13\tCHK"
msgid ""
"In any other circumstance,\n"
"I'd suggest waiting for Daigo-san's return."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "82\t325346\t14\tCHK"
msgid "But the Omi Alliance is breathing down our necks."
msgstr "Ma l’Alleanza Omi ci sta col fiato sul collo."

msgctxt "82\t325396\t15\tCHK"
msgid "Agreed."
msgstr "Concordo."

msgctxt "82\t325404\t16\tCHK"
msgid "Bunch of fuckin' cowards!"
msgstr "Branco di fottuti codardi!"

msgctxt "82\t325430\t17\tCHK"
msgid ""
"This is about honor!\n"
"Not sittin' on your goddamn asses!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "82\t325486\t18\tCHK"
msgid ""
"All those stocks must've melted\n"
"your brain into mush, Mine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "82\t325546\t19\tCHK"
msgid "I'm with Kanda on this one."
msgstr "Sono con Kanda su questo."

msgctxt "82\t325574\t20\tCHK"
msgid "The only thing a yakuza should be thinking about..."
msgstr "L'unica cosa a cui uno yakuza dovrebbe pensare..."

msgctxt "82\t325626\t21\tCHK"
msgid "Is getting revenge for their maybe-dying chairman."
msgstr "Si sta vendicando del loro presidente forse morente."

msgctxt "82\t325677\t22\tCHK"
msgid "Hamazaki!"
msgstr "Hamazaki!"

msgctxt "82\t325687\t23\tCHK"
msgid ""
"If my sources are right,\n"
"the man who shot our sixth chairman..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "82\t325751\t24\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Was a dead ringer the late\n"
"Shintaro Kazama. Ring any bells?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "82\t325811\t25\tCHK"
msgid "Hamazaki... The shit're you gettin' at!?"
msgstr "Hamazaki... A che merda stai arrivando!?"

msgctxt "82\t325852\t26\tCHK"
msgid "The shit is he gettin' at!?"
msgstr "A che merda sta arrivando!?"

msgctxt "82\t325880\t27\tCHK"
msgid ""
"According to an aide to the sixth chairman,\n"
"when Daigo was shot..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "82\t325947\t28\tCHK"
msgid ""
"He was alone in his office with\n"
"a man who looked like Patriarch Kazama."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "82\t326019\t29\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Not like he rose from the grave\n"
"for this nonsense, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "82\t326078\t30\tCHK"
msgid "Someone else must've pulled the trigger."
msgstr "Qualcun altro deve aver premuto il grilletto."

msgctxt "82\t326119\t31\tCHK"
msgid "Captain. You don't know who it was, do you?"
msgstr "Capitano. Non sai chi era, vero?"

msgctxt "82\t326163\t32\tCHK"
msgid "No."
msgstr "NO."

msgctxt "82\t326167\t33\tCHK"
msgid "Not even the slightest idea."
msgstr "Neppure la minima idea."

msgctxt "82\t326196\t34\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You ask me, the best thing\n"
"for the Tojo right now..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "82\t326249\t35\tCHK"
msgid "You're wrong."
msgstr "Ti sbagli."

msgctxt "82\t326263\t36\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Solidifying the clan must be\n"
"our primary course of action."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "82\t326322\t37\tCHK"
msgid "Kiryu, Kiryu, Kiryu, Kiryu."
msgstr "Kiryu, Kiryu, Kiryu, Kiryu."

msgctxt "82\t326350\t38\tCHK"
msgid "You pricks in love with the guy!?"
msgstr "Tu coglione innamorato di quel ragazzo!?"

msgctxt "82\t326384\t39\tCHK"
msgid "If you're jonesin' for Kiryu that bad..."
msgstr "Contrattaccare quando circondato"

msgctxt "82\t326425\t40\tCHK"
msgid "...I'll bring you his goddamn head on a plate!"
msgstr "...Ti porterò la sua maledetta testa su un piatto!"

msgctxt "82\t326472\t41\tCHK"
msgid "Kanda!"
msgstr "Kanda!"

msgctxt "82\t326479\t42\tCHK"
msgid "And Cap. I got another truth bomb for ya."
msgstr "E Cap. Ho un'altra bomba della verità per te."

msgctxt "82\t326521\t43\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Pretty sure your \"hard stance\" had you locked up\n"
"for sex crimes while all that was going down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "82\t326616\t44\tCHK"
msgid "This ain't a damn joke!"
msgstr "Questo non è un dannato scherzo!"

msgctxt "82\t326640\t45\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The Nishikiyama Family's about ready to\n"
"slice that backstabbin' bitch in half!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "82\t326719\t46\tCHK"
msgid "Kiryu's an enemy of the Tojo Clan!"
msgstr "Kiryu è un nemico del clan Tojo!"

msgctxt "82\t326754\t47\tCHK"
msgid "I'm gonna tear him limb from limb!"
msgstr "Lo farò a pezzi pezzo per pezzo!"

msgctxt "82\t326789\t48\tCHK"
msgid "Afraid I can't let you do that."
msgstr "Temo di non potertelo permettere."

msgctxt "82\t326821\t49\tCHK"
msgid "Oh yeah!?"
msgstr "Ah sì?"

msgctxt "82\t326831\t50\tCHK"
msgid "By all means, get rid of Kiryu-san."
msgstr "Sicuramente sbarazzatevi di Kiryu-san."

msgctxt "82\t326867\t51\tCHK"
msgid "Right, Captain?"
msgstr "Giusto, Capitano?"

msgctxt "82\t326883\t52\tCHK"
msgid "Says the guy pining for Kiryu-san."
msgstr "Dice il ragazzo che si strugge per Kiryu-san."

msgctxt "82\t326918\t53\tCHK"
msgid "Neither Kanda nor I want him back, you know."
msgstr "Né Kanda né io lo rivogliamo indietro, lo sai."

msgctxt "82\t326963\t54\tCHK"
msgid "Can't let that slide. Right, Mine?"
msgstr "Non posso lasciarlo scivolare. Giusto, mio?"

msgctxt "82\t326998\t55\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Wonder what the mute mutt\n"
"thinks of all this, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "82\t327049\t56\tCHK"
msgid "Well, Majima-san?"
msgstr "Devo raggiungere la Millenium Tower."

msgctxt "82\t327067\t57\tCHK"
msgid "You're just as much a part of this as we are."
msgstr "Ne fai parte tanto quanto noi."

msgctxt "82\t327113\t58\tCHK"
msgid "Lay it on us."
msgstr "Affidatelo a noi."

msgctxt "82\t327127\t59\tCHK"
msgid "Morons."
msgstr "Coglioni."

msgctxt "82\t327135\t60\tCHK"
msgid "Do what ya wanna do."
msgstr "Fai quello che vuoi fare."

msgctxt "82\t327156\t61\tCHK"
msgid "Doesn't matter to me either way."
msgstr "Non mi importa in ogni caso."

msgctxt "82\t327189\t62\tCHK"
msgid "What're you playin' at!?"
msgstr "A cosa stai giocando!?"

msgctxt "82\t327214\t63\tCHK"
msgid "Or have Kiryu-chan bust your skulls open."
msgstr "Oppure chiedi a Kiryu-chan di spaccarti la testa."

msgctxt "82\t327256\t64\tCHK"
msgid "I just don't give a damn."
msgstr "Non me ne frega niente."

msgctxt "82\t327282\t65\tCHK"
msgid "Oh yeah. Before I split."
msgstr "O si. Prima che mi dividessi."

msgctxt "82\t327307\t66\tCHK"
msgid "You three can brawl if ya want."
msgstr "Voi tre potete litigare se volete."

msgctxt "82\t327339\t67\tCHK"
msgid "But if ya even think of goin' for my turf..."
msgstr "Ma se pensi anche solo di attaccare il mio territorio..."

msgctxt "82\t327384\t68\tCHK"
msgid "Kazama-san won't be the only ghost in town."
msgstr "Kazama-san non sarà l'unico fantasma in città."

msgctxt "82\t327428\t69\tCHK"
msgid "Majima..."
msgstr "Majima..."

msgctxt "82\t327438\t70\tCHK"
msgid "Peace."
msgstr "Pace."

msgctxt "82\t327445\t71\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-chan...\n"
"The storm's comin' for ya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "82\t327486\t72\tCHK"
msgid ""
"For now we must assume the worst, meaning the only\n"
"way forward... is finding a satisfactory replacement."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "82\t327591\t73\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Hence, I believe it prudent to find a stopgap.\n"
"At least until Daigo-san is well enough to rejoin us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "82\t327692\t74\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Is finding who filled our chairman with lead,\n"
"and figuring out who's gunning for us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "82\t327777\t75\tCHK"
msgid ""
"We can discuss whether Kiryu-san should\n"
"return after those are taken care of."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "82\t327855\t76\tCHK"
msgid ""
"If we fail to recruit Kiryu-san at this vital moment,\n"
"we risk the entire organization crumbling to pieces."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "82\t327962\t77\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Ain't a chance in hell the Nishikiyama Family's\n"
"takin' orders from that waste of life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "82\t328049\t78\tCHK"
msgid ""
"With what Kiryu did to the top boys before me...\n"
"the family's takin' a hard stance on this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "82\t328141\t79\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I got half a mind to just get it over with...\n"
"and become the next chairman myself!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "82\t328224\t80\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But letting you Nishikiyama brats run the clan?\n"
"Well that's just not gonna fly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "82\t328304\t81\tCHK"
msgid ""
"What are you talking about?\n"
"This is no time to discuss succession!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "82\t328371\t82\tCHK"
msgid ""
"If we ask Kiryu-san to do us a solid now,\n"
"he might just stick around, become Seventh Chairman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "83\t331976\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "83\t331977\t1\tCHK"
msgid "So that's what's going on..."
msgstr "Ah, allora è così che stanno le cose."

msgctxt "83\t332006\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Kanda in particular is one to watch for."
msgstr "Kanda in particolare è uno da tenere d'occhio."

msgctxt "83\t332047\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Right."
msgstr "Giusto."

msgctxt "83\t332054\t4\tCHK"
msgid ""
"For the time being, I expect\n"
"each family to pursue its own goals."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "83\t332120\t5\tCHK"
msgid "About that. Well..."
msgstr "A questo proposito. BENE..."

msgctxt "83\t332140\t6\tCHK"
msgid "What in the...!?"
msgstr "Cosa diavolo...!?"

msgctxt "83\t332157\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"It's safe to assume some are already\n"
"aware that you're back in Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "83\t332231\t8\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I'll do what I can to keep tabs on Kanda,\n"
"and hopefully track down the man who shot Daigo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "84\t333896\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "84\t333897\t1\tCHK"
msgid ""
"One thing, though. If this man really\n"
"shot both of them..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "84\t333956\t2\tCHK"
msgid ""
"How did he get from Okinawa\n"
"to Tokyo so quickly?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "84\t334005\t3\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Nakahara was attacked right\n"
"around four o'clock yesterday."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "84\t334064\t4\tCHK"
msgid "As for Daigo, it was about six thirty."
msgstr "Quanto a Daigo, erano circa le sei e mezza."

msgctxt "84\t334103\t5\tCHK"
msgid "That leaves a gap of two and a half hours."
msgstr "Ciò lascia un intervallo di due ore e mezza."

msgctxt "84\t334146\t6\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Which is about how long the flight\n"
"from Okinawa to Tokyo takes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "84\t334210\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"He wouldn't have had time to\n"
"get to Tojo HQ from the airport..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "84\t334274\t8\tCHK"
msgid "What the...?"
msgstr "Ma che..."

msgctxt "84\t334287\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Must be a blackout."
msgstr "Dev'essere un blackout."

msgctxt "84\t334307\t10\tCHK"
msgid "Kashiwagi-san!?"
msgstr "Kashiwagi-san!?"

msgctxt "84\t334323\t11\tCHK"
msgid "Kashiwagi-san!"
msgstr "Kashiwagi-san!"

msgctxt "84\t334338\t12\tCHK"
msgid "Kiryu..."
msgstr "Kiryu..."

msgctxt "84\t334347\t13\tCHK"
msgid "This man..."
msgstr "Quest'uomo..."

msgctxt "84\t334359\t14\tCHK"
msgid "Track down the one working with him."
msgstr "Rintraccia quello che lavora con lui."

msgctxt "84\t334396\t15\tCHK"
msgid "There's someone else?"
msgstr "C'è qualcun altro?"

msgctxt "84\t334418\t16\tCHK"
msgid "I'm almost certain."
msgstr "Ne sono quasi certo."

msgctxt "84\t334438\t17\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I think they're supporting the Okinawa deal...\n"
"Trying to push it through."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "84\t334512\t18\tCHK"
msgid "It's someone in the Tojo..."
msgstr "Eri davvero quello..."

msgctxt "84\t334540\t19\tCHK"
msgid "So this person betrayed the clan!?"
msgstr "Quindi questa persona ha tradito il clan!?"

msgctxt "84\t334575\t20\tCHK"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "84\t334580\t21\tCHK"
msgid "I need you... to find him."
msgstr "Ho bisogno che tu... lo trovi."

msgctxt "84\t334607\t22\tCHK"
msgid "Can you do that?"
msgstr "Puoi farlo?"

msgctxt "84\t334624\t23\tCHK"
msgid "Of course!"
msgstr "Ma certo!"

msgctxt "84\t334635\t24\tCHK"
msgid "Kashiwagi-san?"
msgstr "Kashiwagi-san?"

msgctxt "84\t334650\t25\tCHK"
msgid "Strange. The rest of Kamurocho seems unaffected."
msgstr "Strano. Il resto di Kamurocho sembra inalterato."

msgctxt "85\t335784\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "85\t335785\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Hey, you!"
msgstr "Ehi, tu!"

msgctxt "85\t335795\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Wait!"
msgstr "Aspetta!"

msgctxt "85\t335801\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Stop! I said stop!"
msgstr "Fermare! Ho detto basta!"

msgctxt "86\t336424\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "86\t336425\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Damn, where'd he go...?"
msgstr "Dannazione, dov'è andato...?"

msgctxt "86\t336449\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Let's try over there."
msgstr "Proviamo lì."

msgctxt "86\t336471\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Looking good."
msgstr "Stai bene."

msgctxt "86\t336485\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Who's there?"
msgstr "Chi c'è là?"

msgctxt "86\t336498\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Date-san!"
msgstr "Appuntamento-san!"

msgctxt "86\t336508\t6\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Should've known all this\n"
"was a Kazuma Kiryu special."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "86\t336561\t7\tCHK"
msgid "We need to talk."
msgstr "Dobbiamo parlare"

msgctxt "86\t336578\t8\tCHK"
msgid ""
"How about a drink?\n"
"For old time's sake."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "87\t340088\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "87\t340089\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Welcome!"
msgstr "Benvenuto!"

msgctxt "87\t340098\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Not tonight, Mama."
msgstr "Non stasera, mamma."

msgctxt "87\t340117\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Date-san, this is..."
msgstr "Date-san, questo è..."

msgctxt "87\t340138\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Yup, Serena's finally back in business."
msgstr "Sì, Serena è finalmente tornata in affari."

msgctxt "87\t340178\t5\tCHK"
msgid "New mama's really spruced the place up, though."
msgstr "La neomamma ha davvero abbellito il posto, però."

msgctxt "87\t340226\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Date-san. Will you be having the usual?"
msgstr "Data-san. Farai il solito?"

msgctxt "87\t340266\t7\tCHK"
msgid "She's pretty young to be owning a bar."
msgstr "È abbastanza giovane per possedere un bar."

msgctxt "87\t340305\t8\tCHK"
msgid "Yup."
msgstr "Già."

msgctxt "87\t340310\t9\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But she's got the guts\n"
"of a much older woman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "87\t340356\t10\tCHK"
msgid "Who are you calling old?"
msgstr "Chi stai chiamando vecchio?"

msgctxt "87\t340381\t11\tCHK"
msgid "Your drink."
msgstr "La tua bevanda."

msgctxt "87\t340393\t12\tCHK"
msgid "Didn't mean for you to hear that."
msgstr "Non volevo che tu lo sentissi."

msgctxt "87\t340427\t13\tCHK"
msgid "Kazuki filled me in."
msgstr "Un trionfo degno del prossimo primo ministro."

msgctxt "87\t340448\t14\tCHK"
msgid "About time."
msgstr "Era ora!"

msgctxt "87\t340460\t15\tCHK"
msgid "You got the stuff?"
msgstr "Hai la roba?"

msgctxt "87\t340479\t16\tCHK"
msgid "Here, your drink."
msgstr "Ecco, il tuo drink."

msgctxt "87\t340497\t17\tCHK"
msgid "Splash some water in there!"
msgstr "Spruzza un po' d'acqua lì dentro!"

msgctxt "87\t340525\t18\tCHK"
msgid "Coming right up."
msgstr "Arriva subito!"

msgctxt "87\t340542\t19\tCHK"
msgid "There it is. Nice work."
msgstr "Eccolo. Bel lavoro."

msgctxt "87\t340566\t20\tCHK"
msgid "Don't pretend you're my boss."
msgstr "Non fingere di essere il mio capo."

msgctxt "87\t340596\t21\tCHK"
msgid "And those are?"
msgstr "E quelli sono?"

msgctxt "87\t340611\t22\tCHK"
msgid "Oh. Just a few things for you to look at."
msgstr "OH. Solo alcune cose da guardare."

msgctxt "87\t340653\t23\tCHK"
msgid "These are the five current Tojo Clan officers."
msgstr "Questi sono gli attuali cinque ufficiali del clan Tojo."

msgctxt "87\t340700\t24\tCHK"
msgid "What are you getting at?"
msgstr "Dove vuoi arrivare?"

msgctxt "87\t340725\t25\tCHK"
msgid "Truth of it is, my title's changed a little."
msgstr "La verità è che il mio titolo è cambiato un po'."

msgctxt "87\t340770\t26\tCHK"
msgid "Date-san... You're working for a paper?"
msgstr "Date-san... Lavori per un giornale?"

msgctxt "87\t340810\t27\tCHK"
msgid "Kiryu. This garbage you're dealing with?"
msgstr "Kiryu. Questa spazzatura con cui hai a che fare?"

msgctxt "87\t340851\t28\tCHK"
msgid "It all ties back to a story I'm chasing."
msgstr "Tutto si ricollega a una storia che sto inseguendo."

msgctxt "87\t340892\t29\tCHK"
msgid "What story?"
msgstr "Quale storia?"

msgctxt "87\t340904\t30\tCHK"
msgid "This fire's getting hot."
msgstr "Questo fuoco sta diventando caldo."

msgctxt "87\t340929\t31\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Oh, Date-san.\n"
"Not drinking alone tonight?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "87\t340971\t32\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Sure. And the kid'll be in soon,\n"
"so fix one up for him, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "87\t341032\t33\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Mama, you mind stepping out for a bit?\n"
"My friend and I have some catching up to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "87\t341116\t34\tCHK"
msgid "Of course, take all the time you need."
msgstr "Naturalmente prenditi tutto il tempo che ti serve."

msgctxt "87\t341155\t35\tCHK"
msgid ""
"This place is practically a second home by now.\n"
"No chance we'll get found here, don't worry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "87\t341248\t36\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But Date-san...\n"
"How'd you know where I'd be?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "87\t341293\t37\tCHK"
msgid ""
"With your track record, I knew it wouldn't be long\n"
"'til you were the center of another mess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "87\t341386\t38\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Don't say it like that.\n"
"You make this sound like some kinda drug deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "87\t341457\t39\tCHK"
msgid ""
"This stuff's pure alcohol!\n"
"You trying to poison me, Mama?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "87\t341515\t40\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Look at me, taking orders from the new guy.\n"
"I'm a freaking senior editor!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "87\t341589\t41\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The link between the Tojo Clan and\n"
"the Okinawa resort Minister Suzuki's so keen on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "87\t341673\t42\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Let's take some time and go over the key players.\n"
"Don't want you getting burned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88\t344888\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88\t344889\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Kashiwagi-san told me something before he died."
msgstr "Kashiwagi-san mi ha detto qualcosa prima di morire."

msgctxt "88\t344937\t2\tCHK"
msgid ""
"He said someone's trying to push\n"
"the resort deal through. Someone in the Tojo Clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88\t345021\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Then he was right."
msgstr "Allora aveva ragione."

msgctxt "88\t345040\t4\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And the only four Tojo boys who could\n"
"pull it off... are right in front of you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88\t345120\t5\tCHK"
msgid "That wasn't the only thing Kashiwagi-san said."
msgstr "Questa non è stata l'unica cosa che ha detto Kashiwagi-san."

msgctxt "88\t345167\t6\tCHK"
msgid ""
"He told me the traitor is\n"
"working with the man who shot Daigo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88\t345230\t7\tCHK"
msgid "You know who pulled the trigger!?"
msgstr "Sai chi ha premuto il grilletto!?"

msgctxt "88\t345264\t8\tCHK"
msgid "Is this some kinda sick joke?"
msgstr "È una specie di scherzo malato?"

msgctxt "88\t345294\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Kazama-san's gone! How is this possible!?"
msgstr "Kazama-san se n'è andato! Com'è possibile!?"

msgctxt "88\t345336\t10\tCHK"
msgid "I'm not sure it's really him."
msgstr "Ci vediamo all'inferno."

msgctxt "88\t345366\t11\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But we have this man, who put bullets\n"
"in both Daigo and Nakahara."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88\t345432\t12\tCHK"
msgid "The foreigners in black suits."
msgstr "Gli stranieri in abito nero."

msgctxt "88\t345463\t13\tCHK"
msgid "And that helicopter attack."
msgstr "E quell'attacco con l'elicottero."

msgctxt "88\t345491\t14\tCHK"
msgid "Who are we up against here...?"
msgstr "Contro chi abbiamo a che fare qui...?"

msgctxt "88\t345522\t15\tCHK"
msgid "Agreed."
msgstr "Concordo."

msgctxt "88\t345530\t16\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I'll try digging up some dirt\n"
"on this guy in the sketch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88\t345587\t17\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You track down the one who probably\n"
"offed Kashiwagi... Kanda."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88\t345649\t18\tCHK"
msgid "Okay."
msgstr "Ok."

msgctxt "88\t345655\t19\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And it wasn't just Daigo. The man who owns the land\n"
"they want to build the resort on, Nakahara. They shot him, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88\t345771\t20\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Doesn't matter. All we can do now is\n"
"weed out the traitor in the Tojo Clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "89\t347448\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "89\t347449\t1\tCHK"
msgid "These're our stompin' grounds, asshole!"
msgstr "Questi sono i nostri terreni preferiti, stronzo!"

msgctxt "89\t347489\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Now step aside and hand us the girl!"
msgstr "Ora fatti da parte e passaci la ragazza!"

msgctxt "89\t347526\t3\tCHK"
msgid "We don't got time for your bullshit heroics."
msgstr "Non abbiamo tempo per le tue stronzate eroiche."

msgctxt "89\t347571\t4\tCHK"
msgid "The hell are you, huh?"
msgstr "Diavolo, eh?"

msgctxt "89\t347594\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Aniki!"
msgstr "Capo"

msgctxt "89\t347601\t6\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Sorry. I heard yelling,\n"
"so I had to come check it out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "89\t347656\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"This is the girl?\n"
"The one they were trying to take?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "89\t347708\t8\tCHK"
msgid "Yup. They wouldn't stop, even after she refused."
msgstr "Sì. Non si sarebbero fermati, anche dopo che lei si era rifiutata."

msgctxt "89\t347757\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Is that so?"
msgstr "È così?"

msgctxt "89\t347769\t10\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Who. Gives. A shit?\n"
"Nothin' you can do about it, anyway."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "89\t347826\t11\tCHK"
msgid "We're un-freakin'-stoppable!"
msgstr "Siamo inarrestabili!"

msgctxt "89\t347855\t12\tCHK"
msgid "What's that supposed to mean?"
msgstr "Che cosa vorresti dire?"

msgctxt "89\t347885\t13\tCHK"
msgid "It means, fix your eyes on this!"
msgstr "Vuol dire: fissa gli occhi su questo!"

msgctxt "89\t347918\t14\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Should've gone the other way, pal.\n"
"Now turn around before we make you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "90\t350312\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "90\t350313\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Hold your horses there!"
msgstr "Tieni lì i tuoi cavalli!"

msgctxt "90\t350337\t2\tCHK"
msgid "You know this isn't a normal hotel, right?"
msgstr "Sai che questo non è un hotel normale, vero?"

msgctxt "90\t350380\t3\tCHK"
msgid "It's couples only in here."
msgstr "Qui ci sono solo coppie."

msgctxt "90\t350407\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Huh!?"
msgstr "Eh!?"

msgctxt "90\t350413\t5\tCHK"
msgid "What is she talking about?"
msgstr "Di cosa stava parlando?"

msgctxt "90\t350440\t6\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You two aren't the most\n"
"reputable looking characters, y'know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "90\t350502\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Can't have some thugs up and\n"
"committing crimes in one of my rooms."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "90\t350569\t8\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I, uh... guess people only\n"
"come here for one thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "90\t350621\t9\tCHK"
msgid "'Scuse me, ma'am?"
msgstr "'Mi scusi, signora?"

msgctxt "90\t350639\t10\tCHK"
msgid "We've gotta be a couple to come in, right?"
msgstr "Dobbiamo essere una coppia per entrare, giusto?"

msgctxt "90\t350682\t11\tCHK"
msgid "No couple, no room."
msgstr "Nessuna coppia, nessuna stanza."

msgctxt "90\t350702\t12\tCHK"
msgid "Hold on...!"
msgstr "Aspettare...!"

msgctxt "90\t350714\t13\tCHK"
msgid "Ohhh! I had no idea!"
msgstr "Ohhh! Non ne avevo idea!"

msgctxt "90\t350735\t14\tCHK"
msgid "In that case, just a sec."
msgstr "In tal caso, solo un secondo."

msgctxt "90\t350761\t15\tCHK"
msgid "Appreciate it! ♪"
msgstr "Apprezzolo! ♪"

msgctxt "90\t350780\t16\tCHK"
msgid "The elevator's just in the back there."
msgstr "L'ascensore è proprio lì dietro."

msgctxt "90\t350819\t17\tCHK"
msgid "Enjoy!"
msgstr "Godere!"

msgctxt "90\t350826\t18\tCHK"
msgid "Kanda's on the fourth floor, too."
msgstr "Anche Kanda è al quarto piano."

msgctxt "90\t350860\t19\tCHK"
msgid "Yup."
msgstr "Già."

msgctxt "90\t350865\t20\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Kinda run-down place for\n"
"the patriarch of a major family, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "90\t350928\t21\tCHK"
msgid "Can you quit it with that already?"
msgstr "Un abito standard con finiture sexy."

msgctxt "90\t350963\t22\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Well, ain't a duo in town cuter\n"
"than me and my aniki here! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "90\t351026\t23\tCHK"
msgid ""
"We usually keep it under wraps,\n"
"but I just can't keep my hands off of him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "90\t351101\t24\tCHK"
msgid ""
"401's the only room open.\n"
"It's a tight squeeze, but no worry there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "90\t351169\t25\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I dunno. Maybe he's just not\n"
"too keen on spending his own money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "91\t353288\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "91\t353289\t1\tCHK"
msgid "This is the place."
msgstr "Questo è il posto giusto."

msgctxt "91\t353308\t2\tCHK"
msgid "What took ya so long, sweetheart?"
msgstr "Perché ci hai messo così tanto tempo, tesoro?"

msgctxt "91\t353342\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Who the shit're you!?"
msgstr "Chi cazzo sei!?"

msgctxt "91\t353364\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Who's askin'?"
msgstr "Chi lo chiede?"

msgctxt "91\t353378\t5\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The Tojo Clan Fourth Chairman.\n"
"Kazuma Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "91\t353423\t6\tCHK"
msgid "What the...!?"
msgstr "Ma che..."

msgctxt "91\t353437\t7\tCHK"
msgid "There's something we need to ask⑬"
msgstr "C'è qualcosa che dobbiamo chiederti⑬"

msgctxt "91\t353473\t8\tCHK"
msgid "Help! They're gonna skin me alive!"
msgstr "Aiuto! Mi scuoieranno vivo!"

msgctxt "91\t353508\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Will do."
msgstr "Ci penso io."

msgctxt "91\t353517\t10\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Think you can spare us a minute?\n"
"You don't seem too busy in here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "91\t353583\t11\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Good seein' ya, Fourth Chairman.\n"
"What brings ya 'round these parts?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "91\t353651\t12\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Dammit, Kanda...\n"
"Did he go up or down? "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "91\t353691\t13\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Aniki. I'll check downstairs after we\n"
"smack these guys around. You head up, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92\t355144\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92\t355145\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Why's the Fourth Chairman crashin' my shindig!?"
msgstr "Perché il Quarto Presidente sta rovinando la mia festa!?"

msgctxt "92\t355193\t2\tCHK"
msgid "What do you think you're doing?"
msgstr "Cosa pensi di fare?"

msgctxt "92\t355225\t3\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Well then. Looks like a friendly\n"
"chat's not on the table anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92\t355291\t4\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Fine. Guess I'll have to beat\n"
"the answers out of you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92\t355345\t5\tCHK"
msgid "I'm bringin' the heat, Fourth Chairman!"
msgstr "Sto portando il fuoco, Quarto Presidente!"

msgctxt "92\t355385\t6\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Like to ask ya the same thing!\n"
"I went all floppy 'cause of you, asshole!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92\t355458\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Try it! You're gonna regret\n"
"ever crossin' paths with me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "93\t359048\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "93\t359049\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Now then. Tell me what you know."
msgstr "Ora allora. Dimmi cosa sai"

msgctxt "93\t359082\t2\tCHK"
msgid "I don't got answers for ya!"
msgstr "Non ho risposte per te!"

msgctxt "93\t359110\t3\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Don't be ridiculous.\n"
"You can't expect me to fall for that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "93\t359169\t4\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You're the ones who murdered\n"
"Kashiwagi-san. Aren't you!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "93\t359226\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Ya got it wrong! Just hear me out!"
msgstr "Hai capito male! Ascoltami e basta!"

msgctxt "93\t359261\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Hamazaki?"
msgstr "Hamazaki?"

msgctxt "93\t359271\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Explain."
msgstr "Si spieghi."

msgctxt "93\t359280\t8\tCHK"
msgid "Aniki!"
msgstr "Capo"

msgctxt "93\t359287\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Everything okay with you?"
msgstr "Tutto bene per te?"

msgctxt "93\t359313\t10\tCHK"
msgid "More or less."
msgstr "Più o meno."

msgctxt "93\t359327\t11\tCHK"
msgid ""
"There were a lot of 'em,\n"
"so it kinda took a while..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "93\t359380\t12\tCHK"
msgid "I'm gonna run ya through!"
msgstr "Ti farò passare attraverso!"

msgctxt "93\t359406\t13\tCHK"
msgid "This... is Kanda?"
msgstr "Questo... è Kanda?"

msgctxt "93\t359424\t14\tCHK"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "93\t359430\t15\tCHK"
msgid "Hold up. What happened to askin' him stuff?"
msgstr "Sostenere. Cos'è successo al chiedergli delle cose?"

msgctxt "93\t359474\t16\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I got what I need. Besides, there's\n"
"no way he planned all this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "93\t359538\t17\tCHK"
msgid "Jeez. Tokyo's a scary place, huh?"
msgstr "Cavolo. Tokyo è un posto spaventoso, eh?"

msgctxt "93\t359572\t18\tCHK"
msgid "Rikiya..."
msgstr "Rikiya..."

msgctxt "93\t359582\t19\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I promise you.\n"
"I'll figure out who shot Nakahara."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "93\t359632\t20\tCHK"
msgid "Not happenin'!"
msgstr "Non succederà!"

msgctxt "93\t359647\t21\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I need to track down the guy\n"
"who attacked Patriarch Nakahara."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "93\t359709\t22\tCHK"
msgid "I need revenge!"
msgstr "Ho bisogno di vendetta!"

msgctxt "93\t359725\t23\tCHK"
msgid "I'm beggin' you!"
msgstr "Ti sto implorando!"

msgctxt "93\t359742\t24\tCHK"
msgid "All right."
msgstr "Va bene."

msgctxt "93\t359753\t25\tCHK"
msgid "But I have one condition."
msgstr "Ma ho una condizione."

msgctxt "93\t359779\t26\tCHK"
msgid "Can you promise me that?"
msgstr "Puoi promettermelo?"

msgctxt "93\t359804\t27\tCHK"
msgid "Good."
msgstr "Bene."

msgctxt "93\t359810\t28\tCHK"
msgid "Now, how about we grab a drink?"
msgstr "E' questo l'altro uomo che vuoi che salvi?"

msgctxt "93\t359842\t29\tCHK"
msgid "I can show you the sights."
msgstr "Posso mostrarti le attrazioni."

msgctxt "93\t359869\t30\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I'll prove this town's\n"
"not as scary as you think."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "93\t359919\t31\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Fuck no! What would I gain outta\n"
"bumpin' the captain off!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "93\t359978\t32\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You want to be the next Tojo chairman.\n"
"So you made a job opening."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "93\t360044\t33\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The... The guy who offed the captain...\n"
"It was Hamazaki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "93\t360101\t34\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Bingo! He's aimin' to control all of Kamurocho!\n"
"Guy had a motive for axing Kashiwagi!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "93\t360187\t35\tCHK"
msgid ""
"He's got a whole army holed up in Yokohama!\n"
"Just waitin' for a chance to strike!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "93\t360268\t36\tCHK"
msgid ""
"It's the truth! Chinese guy we nabbed in our\n"
"territory told us! Totally spilled the beans!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "93\t360359\t37\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I doubt he even knows why Daigo\n"
"got shot in the first place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "93\t360420\t38\tCHK"
msgid ""
"So do me a favor.\n"
"Go back to Okinawa and⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "93\t360464\t39\tCHK"
msgid ""
"So please, Aniki!\n"
"Let me stay in Tokyo!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "93\t360504\t40\tCHK"
msgid ""
"If you come across the man in the sketch,\n"
"don't go after him on your own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "94\t364008\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "94\t364009\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Oh yeah?"
msgstr "Ah sì?"

msgctxt "94\t364018\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Got it."
msgstr "Capito."

msgctxt "94\t364026\t3\tCHK"
msgid "You did good."
msgstr "Hai fatto bene."

msgctxt "94\t364040\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Whole family's gone up in flames."
msgstr "Tutta la famiglia è andata in fiamme."

msgctxt "94\t364074\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Impressive he did it all single-handedly."
msgstr "Impressionante che abbia fatto tutto da solo."

msgctxt "94\t364116\t6\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But I suppose the Dragon of Dojima's\n"
"still got some bite in him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "94\t364181\t7\tCHK"
msgid "...Majima-san."
msgstr "...Majima-san."

msgctxt "94\t364196\t8\tCHK"
msgid "I want Kamurocho all to myself."
msgstr "Voglio Kamurocho tutto per me."

msgctxt "94\t364228\t9\tCHK"
msgid "So. You know what has to be done."
msgstr "COSÌ. Sai cosa deve essere fatto."

msgctxt "94\t364262\t10\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You've got the most to lose if Kiryu-san\n"
"gets in our way, after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "94\t364331\t11\tCHK"
msgid "Doesn't matter how you do it."
msgstr "Non importa come lo fai."

msgctxt "94\t364361\t12\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Just do it.\n"
"Or your head's the one that'll roll."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "94\t364410\t13\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Sounds like Kanda got a nice little\n"
"visit from the fourth chairman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "94\t364478\t14\tCHK"
msgid ""
"It's safe to say Kiryu-san'll keep\n"
"poking around this Okinawa business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "94\t364550\t15\tCHK"
msgid ""
"By now the guy's probably long known\n"
"you're wrapped up in the whole shebang, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "94\t364632\t16\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Meaning the next place he'll show...\n"
"is right at your feet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "94\t364692\t17\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I brought you into this Okinawa deal.\n"
"So I guess it's my fault if he comes after you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "94\t364778\t18\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But it's worth it for you.\n"
"Building this resort'll net your family an easy 100 bil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "94\t364862\t19\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Just so happens that also makes you\n"
"the key suspect in the sixth chairman's shooting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "95\t367336\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "95\t367337\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Kiryu! We just caught wind of a big story!"
msgstr "Kiryu! Abbiamo appena saputo di una grande storia!"

msgctxt "95\t367380\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Showed up in the evening news."
msgstr "Apparso al telegiornale della sera."

msgctxt "95\t367411\t3\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Our politico team's been\n"
"working hard to crack this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "95\t367464\t4\tCHK"
msgid ""
"In other words, the military expansion\n"
"he's been pushing for is a done deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "95\t367541\t5\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But the base and the resort\n"
"are two halves of the same whole."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "95\t367603\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Oh, and Kiryu."
msgstr "Oh, e Kiryu."

msgctxt "95\t367618\t7\tCHK"
msgid "This tip found its way to our news desk."
msgstr "Questo suggerimento è arrivato alla nostra redazione."

msgctxt "95\t367659\t8\tCHK"
msgid "It's a photo, sent from an anonymous source."
msgstr "È una foto, inviata da una fonte anonima."

msgctxt "95\t367704\t9\tCHK"
msgid "No..."
msgstr "NO..."

msgctxt "95\t367710\t10\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Suzuki's moving ahead with\n"
"his resort one way or another."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "95\t367768\t11\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Tamiya from the Ministry of Defense finally agreed\n"
"to terms with the Okinawa Prefectural Assembly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "95\t367867\t12\tCHK"
msgid ""
"If one starts picking up steam,\n"
"the other's bound to come with it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "95\t367934\t13\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Guess that explains why the resort's\n"
"been back in the public eye all of a sudden."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "95\t368016\t14\tCHK"
msgid ""
"There's something you might wanna know\n"
"about the players in this resort deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "95\t368094\t15\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And the ones secretly tapped for construction?\n"
"None other than the Majima Family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "96\t369464\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "96\t369465\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Majima Family"
msgstr "Famiglia Majima"

msgctxt "96\t369479\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Majima-san."
msgstr "Majima-san."

msgctxt "96\t369491\t3\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Why the stern face, Kiryu-chan?\n"
"I didn't spook ya, did I?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "96\t369549\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Oh, just my chaperones."
msgstr "Oh, solo i miei accompagnatori."

msgctxt "96\t369573\t5\tCHK"
msgid ""
"World's so upside-down, it ain't even safe\n"
"keeping your office above ground anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "96\t369658\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Dial \"007\" for assistance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "96\t369685\t7\tCHK"
msgid "What is all this?"
msgstr "Cos'è tutto questo?"

msgctxt "97\t370312\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "97\t370313\t1\tCHK"
msgid "The memories are floodin' back, huh?"
msgstr "I ricordi stanno tornando indietro, eh?"

msgctxt "97\t370350\t2\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Only been two years since\n"
"I was takin' to the ring myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "98\t372584\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "98\t372585\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Kiryu-chan."
msgstr "Kiryu-chan."

msgctxt "98\t372597\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Ladies and gentlemen!"
msgstr "Signore e signori!"

msgctxt "98\t372619\t3\tCHK"
msgid "So this is how it is."
msgstr "Quindi è così che stanno le cose."

msgctxt "98\t372641\t4\tCHK"
msgid "If you want me spillin' my guts..."
msgstr "Se vuoi che spieghi le mie viscere..."

msgctxt "98\t372676\t5\tCHK"
msgid "...you're gonna have to beat 'em out of me!"
msgstr "... dovrai picchiarli fuori da me!"

msgctxt "98\t372720\t6\tCHK"
msgid "No surprise there."
msgstr "Nessuna sorpresa lì."

msgctxt "98\t372739\t7\tCHK"
msgid "That's how it always goes with us."
msgstr "Da noi va sempre così."

msgctxt "98\t372774\t8\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Ya ask me, there's nothin' better\n"
"than us two rumbling!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "98\t372830\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Yeah... I guess not."
msgstr "Sì... immagino di no."

msgctxt "98\t372851\t10\tCHK"
msgid "So, no holds barred."
msgstr "Quindi, niente esclusione di colpi."

msgctxt "98\t372872\t11\tCHK"
msgid "Now, the gong!"
msgstr "Ora, il gong!"

msgctxt "98\t372887\t12\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Doubt ya believe it, but I take\n"
"the yakuza code real serious."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "98\t372949\t13\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Even if someone's up and framed me,\n"
"I'm not gonna go spillin' the beans for free."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "98\t373031\t14\tCHK"
msgid "At long last, the legendary duo returns!\n"
msgstr "Finalmente, il leggendario duo ritorna!\n"

msgctxt "98\t373073\t15\tCHK"
msgid ""
"First is the King of the Ring,\n"
"the Dragon of Dojima... Kazuma Kiryu! Versus!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "98\t373150\t16\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The One-Eyed Demon, the Mad Dog of Shimano,\n"
"and the Patron Saint of Pain... Goro Majima!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "98\t373239\t17\tCHK"
msgid ""
"For the first time in two years, these titans\n"
"are back in action! Who will emerge victorious!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "98\t373334\t18\tCHK"
msgid ""
"That's my Kiryu-chan!\n"
"Wouldn't have it any other way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "98\t373388\t19\tCHK"
msgid "Hit me with all ya got, Kiryu-chan!"
msgstr "Colpiscimi con tutte le tue forze, Kiryu-chan!"

msgctxt "99\t374632\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "99\t374633\t1\tCHK"
msgid "The winner is... Kazuma Kiryu!"
msgstr "Il vincitore è... Kazuma Kiryu!"

msgctxt "99\t374664\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Well, a promise is a promise."
msgstr "Ebbene, una promessa è una promessa."

msgctxt "99\t374694\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Come back to my office and we'll chat."
msgstr "Torna nel mio ufficio e parliamo."

msgctxt "99\t374733\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "99\t374739\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Ya walloped me good, Kiryu-chan."
msgstr "Mi hai colpito bene, Kiryu-chan."

msgctxt "100\t375320\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100\t375321\t1\tCHK"
msgid "There's more to it than that."
msgstr "C'è di più."

msgctxt "100\t375351\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Been a while, Kiryu."
msgstr "Ne è passato un po', Kiryu."

msgctxt "100\t375372\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Florist."
msgstr "Davvero, possiamo!"

msgctxt "101\t376264\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "101\t376265\t1\tCHK"
msgid "What in the...?"
msgstr "Cosa diavolo...?"

msgctxt "101\t376281\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Fishy stuff. Too fishy."
msgstr "Perché non dovrei?"

msgctxt "101\t376305\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Just... who is he?"
msgstr "Solo...chi è lui?"

msgctxt "101\t376324\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Boss! Something's going down in Kamurocho!"
msgstr "Capo! Qualcosa sta succedendo a Kamurocho!"

msgctxt "101\t376367\t5\tCHK"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr "Cosa!?"

msgctxt "101\t376374\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Lau Ka Long..."
msgstr "Lau Ka Long..."

msgctxt "101\t376389\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Real shocker, huh? For you, at least.\n"
"It's like his ghost's come back to haunt you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "101\t376473\t8\tCHK"
msgid ""
"What's that you got there?\n"
"Why do you have a sketch of him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "102\t377688\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "102\t377689\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Kiryu, that's..."
msgstr "Kiryu, quello è..."

msgctxt "102\t377706\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Rikiya!"
msgstr "Rikiya!"

msgctxt "102\t377714\t3\tSUS"
msgid ""
"⑰\n"
"[You.]"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "102\t377725\t4\tJAP"
msgid ""
"有什⑱事呀？\n"
"[What is it, sir?]"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "102\t377763\t5\tJAP"
msgid ""
"把⑲个男的⑳我找回来\n"
"[I need you to find this man.]"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "102\t377825\t6\tJAP"
msgid ""
"是！\n"
"[Understood, sir!]"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "102\t377851\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Dunno why, but it looks like Lau's using\n"
"his Snake Flower cronies to hunt down your pal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "103\t379272\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "103\t379273\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Rikiya!"
msgstr "Rikiya!"

msgctxt "103\t379281\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Aniki!"
msgstr "Capo"

msgctxt "103\t379288\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Oh how I've missed you, Kazuma Kiryu."
msgstr "Oh quanto mi sei mancato, Kazuma Kiryu."

msgctxt "103\t379326\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Lau!"
msgstr "Lau!"

msgctxt "103\t379331\t5\tCHK"
msgid "I know what you're after."
msgstr "So cosa stai cercando."

msgctxt "103\t379357\t6\tCHK"
msgid "You fail to understand."
msgstr "Non riesci a capire."

msgctxt "103\t379381\t7\tCHK"
msgid "And that's why you got Rikiya involved."
msgstr "Ed è per questo che hai coinvolto Rikiya."

msgctxt "103\t379421\t8\tCHK"
msgid ""
"We're overdue for a little talk.\n"
"So I thought I'd lure you out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "103\t379485\t9\tCHK"
msgid ""
"He has nothing to do with this!\n"
"Let him go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "103\t379529\t10\tCHK"
msgid ""
"My alliance with Hamazaki was forged\n"
"for nothing more than revenge. On you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "103\t379605\t11\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Now, let us put an end to this\n"
"at last... Kazuma Kiryu!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104\t381000\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104\t381001\t1\tCHK"
msgid "We're not finished just yet."
msgstr "Non abbiamo ancora finito."

msgctxt "104\t381030\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Rikiya!"
msgstr "Rikiya!"

msgctxt "104\t381038\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Aniki!"
msgstr "Capo"

msgctxt "104\t381045\t4\tCHK"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "104\t381051\t5\tCHK"
msgid "But you're... supposed to be dead!"
msgstr "Ma tu... dovresti essere morto!"

msgctxt "104\t381086\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Kazama-san!"
msgstr "Ma ho bisogno che tu sia consapevole di cosa sta succedendo."

msgctxt "104\t381098\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Answer me."
msgstr "Rispondimi."

msgctxt "104\t381109\t8\tCHK"
msgid "Are you Shintaro Kazama or not!?"
msgstr "Perché non entra, zio Mikio?"

msgctxt "104\t381142\t9\tCHK"
msgid "That's not all."
msgstr "Non è tutto."

msgctxt "104\t381158\t10\tCHK"
msgid "So you're Kazuma Kiryu."
msgstr "Quindi tu sei Kazuma Kiryu."

msgctxt "104\t381182\t11\tCHK"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "104\t381188\t12\tCHK"
msgid "Beautiful eyes..."
msgstr "Bellissimi occhi..."

msgctxt "104\t381206\t13\tCHK"
msgid "Like I heard from my brother before."
msgstr "Come ho già sentito da mio fratello."

msgctxt "104\t381243\t14\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Now, watch close...\n"
"As your friends head is severed from his shoulders!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104\t381315\t15\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I need to know...\n"
"Why did you shoot Daigo and Nakahara!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "105\t383784\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "105\t383785\t1\tCHK"
msgid "That Kazama-lookin' guy really said all that?"
msgstr "Quel tizio dall'aspetto di Kazama ha detto davvero tutto questo?"

msgctxt "105\t383831\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "105\t383837\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Hm..."
msgstr "Mmm..."

msgctxt "105\t383843\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Can't help but wonder what he wants."
msgstr "Non posso fare a meno di chiedermi cosa vuole."

msgctxt "105\t383880\t5\tCHK"
msgid ""
"All we know for sure is that he's\n"
"wrapped up in this whole mess somehow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "105\t383953\t6\tCHK"
msgid "What's wrong? You still hurt?"
msgstr "Cosa c'è che non va? Stai ancora male?"

msgctxt "105\t383983\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Not really."
msgstr "Non proprio."

msgctxt "105\t383995\t8\tCHK"
msgid "Rikiya."
msgstr "Rikiya."

msgctxt "105\t384003\t9\tCHK"
msgid "I need you to head back to Okinawa."
msgstr "Ho bisogno che tu torni a Okinawa."

msgctxt "105\t384039\t10\tCHK"
msgid "I have some loose ends to tie up here."
msgstr "Ho alcune questioni in sospeso da sistemare qui."

msgctxt "105\t384078\t11\tCHK"
msgid "But you? There's nothing keeping you in this city."
msgstr "Ma tu? Non c'è niente che ti trattenga in questa città."

msgctxt "105\t384129\t12\tCHK"
msgid "But!"
msgstr "Ma!"

msgctxt "105\t384134\t13\tCHK"
msgid "Just hear me out, okay?"
msgstr "Ascoltami e basta, ok?"

msgctxt "105\t384158\t14\tCHK"
msgid "Can you do that?"
msgstr "Puoi farlo?"

msgctxt "105\t384175\t15\tCHK"
msgid "What's up?"
msgstr "Che c'è?"

msgctxt "105\t384186\t16\tCHK"
msgid "Hey, Kiryu."
msgstr "Ehi, Kiryu."

msgctxt "105\t384198\t17\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Aniki. I just... don't know\n"
"what to think of all this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "105\t384253\t18\tCHK"
msgid "Why'd that guy with the mustache save my life?"
msgstr "Perché quel ragazzo con i baffi mi ha salvato la vita?"

msgctxt "105\t384300\t19\tCHK"
msgid ""
"'Specially after he shot the boss.\n"
"...Why help me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "105\t384351\t20\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Right now, we don't know whether\n"
"the man in the sketch is a friend or foe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "105\t384426\t21\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Go home, be safe. Take care of Saki for me.\n"
"Watch after Morning Glory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "105\t384497\t22\tCHK"
msgid "What? The chairman of the Hakuho?"
msgstr "Che cosa? Il presidente della Hakuho?"

msgctxt "105\t384531\t23\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You know Mine, from the Hakuho Clan?\n"
"Sounds like he swung over here to see you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "106\t386280\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "106\t386281\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Well? You want to talk to me?"
msgstr "BENE? Vuoi parlare con me?"

msgctxt "106\t386311\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Yes, you must forgive me."
msgstr "Sì, devi perdonarmi."

msgctxt "106\t386337\t3\tCHK"
msgid "I'm here to hold myself accountable."
msgstr "Sono qui per ritenermi responsabile."

msgctxt "106\t386374\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Accountable...?"
msgstr "Responsabile...?"

msgctxt "106\t386390\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "106\t386395\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Kanda!?"
msgstr "Kanda!?"

msgctxt "106\t386403\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Mine... What is the meaning of this?"
msgstr "Il mio... Qual è il significato di questo?"

msgctxt "106\t386440\t8\tCHK"
msgid ""
"A gaudy place like this has been underneath\n"
"Kamurocho all this time? Who would have thought?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "106\t386533\t9\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid my organization is in part to blame\n"
"for all the trouble you've been facing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "107\t389960\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "107\t389961\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Kiryu, you dirty son of a bitch!"
msgstr "Kiryu, sporco figlio di puttana!"

msgctxt "107\t389994\t2\tCHK"
msgid "You're not gettin' away with this!"
msgstr "Non te la caverai così!"

msgctxt "107\t390029\t3\tCHK"
msgid "You can shove your respect!"
msgstr "Puoi dimostrare il tuo rispetto!"

msgctxt "107\t390057\t4\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Ya hear, Mine!?\n"
"Gimme your cash and your boys!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "107\t390104\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Kiryu ain't survivin' the night!"
msgstr "Kiryu non sopravviverà alla notte!"

msgctxt "107\t390137\t6\tCHK"
msgid "You truly are a fool, aren't you?"
msgstr "Sei davvero uno stupido, vero?"

msgctxt "107\t390171\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Like I give a rat's ass!"
msgstr "Come se non me ne fregasse niente!"

msgctxt "107\t390196\t8\tCHK"
msgid "You wipe your shitstains with that kinda cash!"
msgstr "Ti pulisci le macchie di merda con quei soldi!"

msgctxt "107\t390243\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Money isn't the issue here."
msgstr "Il denaro non è il problema qui."

msgctxt "107\t390271\t10\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You just can't seem to perceive worth.\n"
"Neither theirs nor yours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "107\t390336\t11\tCHK"
msgid "What was that!?"
msgstr "Cosa hai detto?"

msgctxt "107\t390352\t12\tCHK"
msgid "Perceive this, you little shit!"
msgstr "Capisci questo, piccola merda!"

msgctxt "107\t390384\t13\tCHK"
msgid "I realize I failed to mention this before."
msgstr "Mi rendo conto di non averlo menzionato prima."

msgctxt "107\t390427\t14\tCHK"
msgid "But the truth is, I'm much stronger than I look."
msgstr "Chi ha preso la vita di Oda-san?"

msgctxt "107\t390476\t15\tCHK"
msgid "Mine..."
msgstr "Mio..."

msgctxt "107\t390484\t16\tCHK"
msgid "You're useless to me now."
msgstr "Sei inutile per me adesso."

msgctxt "107\t390510\t17\tCHK"
msgid "Except perhaps as my apology to Kiryu-san."
msgstr "Tranne forse le mie scuse a Kiryu-san."

msgctxt "107\t390553\t18\tCHK"
msgid "Yes, sir."
msgstr "Sì, signore."

msgctxt "107\t390563\t19\tCHK"
msgid "Mine!"
msgstr "Mio!"

msgctxt "107\t390569\t20\tCHK"
msgid "The hell's the stoneface for? Huh, Mine!?"
msgstr "Che diavolo serve a Stoneface? Eh, il mio!?"

msgctxt "107\t390611\t21\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Don't just sit there twidlin' your thumbs!\n"
"Say something, jackoff!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "107\t390678\t22\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Aniki. This is my office.\n"
"I suggest you be a little more respectful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "107\t390747\t23\tCHK"
msgid ""
"If you weren't so damn chill about everythin',\n"
"I'd never have got my ass whooped by Kiryu!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "107\t390838\t24\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I told you in the officer's meeting.\n"
"I don't consider Kiryu-san my enemy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "107\t390912\t25\tCHK"
msgid ""
"This wouldn't have happened had you\n"
"not gone looking for a fight.."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "107\t390979\t26\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Now I'm gettin' lectured by some limp-dicked\n"
"coward, huh!? Well I don't wanna hear it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "107\t391066\t27\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And then I'm gonna be Seventh Chairman!\n"
"I'll even let ya be my captain!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "107\t391138\t28\tCHK"
msgid "The shit? I dare ya to say that again!"
msgstr "La merda? Ti sfido a dirlo di nuovo!"

msgctxt "107\t391177\t29\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The collection you just demolished...\n"
"was worth over one billion yen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "107\t391247\t30\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Don't do it here.\n"
"He's made a big enough mess as is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "107\t391300\t31\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Hey, hold on a sec... Mine!\n"
"Wait, Mine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108\t397112\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108\t397113\t1\tCHK"
msgid "As for Hamazaki, my Hakuho men are searching for him."
msgstr "Per quanto riguarda Hamazaki, i miei uomini della Hakuho lo stanno cercando."

msgctxt "108\t397167\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Though... I suspect he won't turn up."
msgstr "Anche se... sospetto che non si farà vivo."

msgctxt "108\t397205\t3\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Do you have some idea\n"
"where he might have gone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108\t397253\t4\tCHK"
msgid "I do. I imagine he's no longer in the country."
msgstr "Io faccio. Immagino che non sia più in campagna."

msgctxt "108\t397300\t5\tCHK"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "Cosa intendi?"

msgctxt "108\t397318\t6\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The head of the Japanese Snake Flower branch,\n"
"Lau Ka Long, is dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108\t397386\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Snake Flower headquarters\n"
"would never accept such failure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108\t397445\t8\tCHK"
msgid "That's the Snake Flower, all right."
msgstr "Quello è il Fiore del Serpente, va bene."

msgctxt "108\t397481\t9\tCHK"
msgid "That so?"
msgstr "Ah sì?"

msgctxt "108\t397490\t10\tCHK"
msgid "I suggest you take care of yourself."
msgstr "Ti suggerisco di prenderti cura di te."

msgctxt "108\t397527\t11\tCHK"
msgid "Farewell."
msgstr "Addio."

msgctxt "108\t397537\t12\tCHK"
msgid "Mine."
msgstr "Mio."

msgctxt "108\t397543\t13\tCHK"
msgid "Who told you to handle things like this?"
msgstr "Chi ti ha detto di gestire cose del genere?"

msgctxt "108\t397584\t14\tCHK"
msgid "I'm not sure I follow."
msgstr "Non sono sicuro di seguirlo."

msgctxt "108\t397607\t15\tCHK"
msgid "I doubt it."
msgstr "Ne dubito."

msgctxt "108\t397619\t16\tCHK"
msgid "Then why are you..."
msgstr "Allora perché sei..."

msgctxt "108\t397639\t17\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Well, Daigo is no longer\n"
"the one giving orders."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108\t397687\t18\tCHK"
msgid "This decision was mine, and mine alone."
msgstr "Questa decisione è stata mia, e soltanto mia."

msgctxt "108\t397727\t19\tCHK"
msgid "By the way, Kiryu-san."
msgstr "A proposito, Kiryu-san."

msgctxt "108\t397750\t20\tCHK"
msgid "You're a coward."
msgstr "Sei un codardo."

msgctxt "108\t397767\t21\tCHK"
msgid "No regard for the position you hold."
msgstr "Nessun riguardo per la posizione che ricopri."

msgctxt "108\t397804\t22\tCHK"
msgid "Mere hypocrisy."
msgstr "Pura ipocrisia."

msgctxt "108\t397820\t23\tCHK"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr "Cosa!?"

msgctxt "108\t397827\t24\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I intend on moving forward\n"
"in the way I see most fit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108\t397881\t25\tCHK"
msgid "Mine, you..."
msgstr "Il mio, tu..."

msgctxt "108\t397894\t26\tCHK"
msgid "A motive I'm sure Daigo-san would approve of."
msgstr "Un motivo che sono sicuro che Daigo-san approverebbe."

msgctxt "108\t397940\t27\tCHK"
msgid "Anyone that stands in my way will be eliminated."
msgstr "Chiunque mi ostacolerà verrà eliminato."

msgctxt "108\t397989\t28\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Even if that person...\n"
"is one of our own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108\t398031\t29\tCHK"
msgid "I'll never understand it."
msgstr "Non lo capirò mai."

msgctxt "108\t398057\t30\tCHK"
msgid "Excuse me?"
msgstr "Mi scusi?"

msgctxt "108\t398068\t31\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And someday...\n"
"I'll prove it to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108\t398105\t32\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I don't expect you will.\n"
"I have nothing to learn from you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108\t398164\t33\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I suppose it was my fault for allowing\n"
"Kanda to rise so far above his station."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108\t398243\t34\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You have my deepest apologies.\n"
"Can we consider this Nishikiyama Family incident resolved?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108\t398333\t35\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I plan to assemble the Tojo Clan families\n"
"without delay and attempt to restore order."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108\t398419\t36\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And given Hamazaki was Lau's partner,\n"
"they've surely kidnapped him in retaliation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108\t398502\t37\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The rest of his family was apparently\n"
"found floating in the Yokohama Bay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108\t398576\t38\tCHK"
msgid ""
"In any case, without us even having to\n"
"lift a finger... the Hamazaki Family is gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108\t398661\t39\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I plan to reach out to Snake Flower headquarters\n"
"to hopefully prevent any further bloodshed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108\t398754\t40\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san... The Tojo Clan is on a knife's edge.\n"
"We need you now more than ever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108\t398835\t41\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Then let me restate. Would Daigo have\n"
"done the same thing in your shoes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108\t398908\t42\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Some of the blame for all of this...\n"
"rests on your very shoulders."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108\t398975\t43\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Daigo-san told me everything.\n"
"About your orphanage in Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108\t399038\t44\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You may think you're turning over a new leaf.\n"
"But it's all meaningless."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108\t399110\t45\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Methods aside... I do see myself as\n"
"the successor to Daigo-san's legacy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108\t399183\t46\tCHK"
msgid ""
"In other words, every last thing I do\n"
"is done with the aim of aiding the Tojo Clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108\t399267\t47\tCHK"
msgid "What could Daigo-san see in a man like you?"
msgstr "Cosa poteva vedere Daigo-san in un uomo come te?"

msgctxt "108\t399311\t48\tCHK"
msgid "Mine. You've lost your way."
msgstr "Mio. Hai perso la strada."

msgctxt "109\t403208\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "109\t403209\t1\tCHK"
msgid "You're younger than I expected."
msgstr "Sei più giovane di quanto mi aspettassi."

msgctxt "109\t403241\t2\tCHK"
msgid "And that is?"
msgstr "E questo è?"

msgctxt "109\t403254\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Ah, the famous detective turned reporter."
msgstr "Il vincitore è... Kazuma Kiryu!"

msgctxt "109\t403296\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Can I offer you gentlemen a drink?"
msgstr "Signori, posso offrirvi da bere?"

msgctxt "109\t403331\t5\tCHK"
msgid "No thanks."
msgstr "No grazie."

msgctxt "109\t403342\t6\tCHK"
msgid "That's right."
msgstr "Esatto."

msgctxt "109\t403356\t7\tCHK"
msgid "What's your point?"
msgstr "Qual è il tuo punto?"

msgctxt "109\t403375\t8\tCHK"
msgid "Meaning what?"
msgstr "Significato cosa?"

msgctxt "109\t403389\t9\tCHK"
msgid "You want to put an end to the resort, yes?"
msgstr "Vuoi chiudere il resort, vero?"

msgctxt "109\t403432\t10\tCHK"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "109\t403438\t11\tCHK"
msgid "I, too, find that the most preferable outcome."
msgstr "Anch'io ritengo che questo sia il risultato più preferibile."

msgctxt "109\t403485\t12\tCHK"
msgid "It will, yes."
msgstr "Lo farà, sì."

msgctxt "109\t403499\t13\tCHK"
msgid "However. That doesn't matter now."
msgstr "Tuttavia. Non importa adesso."

msgctxt "109\t403533\t14\tCHK"
msgid ""
"It doesn't matter?\n"
"Why not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "109\t403561\t15\tCHK"
msgid "It's simple."
msgstr "È semplice."

msgctxt "109\t403574\t16\tCHK"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr "Cosa!?"

msgctxt "109\t403581\t17\tCHK"
msgid "Explain yourself, Tamiya."
msgstr "Spiegati, Tamiya."

msgctxt "109\t403607\t18\tCHK"
msgid "Your military expansion bill, the resort deal..."
msgstr "Il conto per l'espansione militare, l'accordo sul resort..."

msgctxt "109\t403656\t19\tCHK"
msgid "We want to know everything."
msgstr "Vogliamo sapere tutto."

msgctxt "109\t403684\t20\tCHK"
msgid ""
"As long as you don't forget\n"
"the favor I mentioned earlier."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "109\t403743\t21\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Name's Date, with the Keihin News.\n"
"I'm researching Suzuki's link with the Tojo Clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "109\t403828\t22\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I hear you're running an orphanage\n"
"on a piece of land earmarked for the resort."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "109\t403908\t23\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Rumor has it, that's why Daigo Dojima\n"
"backed out of the deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "109\t403970\t24\tCHK"
msgid ""
"My point is... our objectives\n"
"in all of this are aligned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "109\t404028\t25\tCHK"
msgid "Wait, what? What are you talking about!?"
msgstr "Aspetta, cosa? Di cosa stai parlando!?"

msgctxt "109\t404069\t26\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Without the resort, won't your\n"
"military expansion bill be doomed to fail?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "109\t404143\t27\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I had no intention of\n"
"passing that bill in the first place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "110\t409784\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "110\t409785\t1\tCHK"
msgid "It's all starting to make sense now."
msgstr "Tutto comincia ad avere un senso adesso."

msgctxt "110\t409822\t2\tCHK"
msgid "...I need you to stop Joji."
msgstr "...Ho bisogno che tu fermi Joji."

msgctxt "110\t409850\t3\tCHK"
msgid ""
"...Why's the CIA so keen on getting\n"
"rid of him in the first place, though?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "110\t409925\t4\tCHK"
msgid "He knows too much."
msgstr "Sa troppo."

msgctxt "110\t409944\t5\tCHK"
msgid "So the CIA are gonna shut him up."
msgstr "Quindi la CIA lo farà tacere."

msgctxt "110\t409978\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Indeed."
msgstr "Infatti."

msgctxt "110\t409986\t7\tCHK"
msgid "But I have no desire to see Toma killed."
msgstr "Ma non ho alcun desiderio di vedere ucciso Toma."

msgctxt "110\t410027\t8\tCHK"
msgid "I want to save both him and Joji."
msgstr "Voglio salvare sia lui che Joji."

msgctxt "110\t410061\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Hold on. Didn't Toma muck up your plans?"
msgstr "Aspettare. Toma non ha rovinato i tuoi piani?"

msgctxt "110\t410102\t10\tCHK"
msgid "Why save a guy who's standing against you?"
msgstr "Perché salvare un ragazzo che è contro di te?"

msgctxt "110\t410145\t11\tCHK"
msgid ""
"A man with strong enough convictions\n"
"will inevitably hold great ambition."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "110\t410219\t12\tCHK"
msgid "And, someday, make that ambition reality."
msgstr "E, un giorno, rendere questa ambizione realtà."

msgctxt "110\t410261\t13\tCHK"
msgid "That's what my mentor always told me."
msgstr "Questo è quello che mi ha sempre detto il mio mentore."

msgctxt "110\t410299\t14\tCHK"
msgid "Toma has a good heart."
msgstr "Toma ha un buon cuore."

msgctxt "110\t410322\t15\tCHK"
msgid "He'll be an extraordinary politician before long."
msgstr "Tra non molto sarà un politico straordinario."

msgctxt "110\t410372\t16\tCHK"
msgid "That's your reason?"
msgstr "E' questo il motivo?"

msgctxt "110\t410392\t17\tCHK"
msgid "It's more than that, Date-san."
msgstr "C'è di più, Date-san."

msgctxt "110\t410423\t18\tCHK"
msgid "It would go against everything he stands for."
msgstr "Andrebbe contro tutto ciò che rappresenta."

msgctxt "110\t410469\t19\tCHK"
msgid "Do we?"
msgstr "Lo facciamo?"

msgctxt "110\t410476\t20\tCHK"
msgid "Okay."
msgstr "Ok."

msgctxt "110\t410482\t21\tCHK"
msgid ""
"By stopping Toma now,\n"
"I'll put an end to the resort, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "110\t410540\t22\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And besides. Kazama-san's brother and I\n"
"have some unfinished business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "110\t410611\t23\tCHK"
msgid "So you'll do it?"
msgstr "Quindi lo farai?"

msgctxt "110\t410628\t24\tCHK"
msgid "Not because you asked me to."
msgstr "Non perché me lo hai chiesto tu."

msgctxt "110\t410657\t25\tCHK"
msgid "All I want... is to protect Morning Glory."
msgstr "Tutto quello che voglio... è proteggere Morning Glory."

msgctxt "110\t410700\t26\tCHK"
msgid "Fair enough."
msgstr "Giusta osservazione."

msgctxt "110\t410713\t27\tCHK"
msgid "I swear it."
msgstr "Lo giuro."

msgctxt "110\t410725\t28\tCHK"
msgid "And Toma? Where is he now?"
msgstr "E Tomà? Dov'è adesso?"

msgctxt "110\t410752\t29\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I thought yakuza like you only\n"
"existed in stories these days."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "110\t410814\t30\tCHK"
msgid "...It seems we have visitors."
msgstr "...Sembra che abbiamo visite."

msgctxt "110\t410844\t31\tCHK"
msgid "Something going on out there?"
msgstr "Sta succedendo qualcosa là fuori?"

msgctxt "110\t410874\t32\tCHK"
msgid "Suzuki's \"security.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "110\t410895\t33\tCHK"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "110\t410901\t34\tCHK"
msgid "Toma must have planned this from the get-go."
msgstr "Toma deve averlo pianificato fin dall'inizio."

msgctxt "110\t410946\t35\tCHK"
msgid "Well, Kiryu?"
msgstr "Ebbene, Kiryu?"

msgctxt "110\t410959\t36\tCHK"
msgid "We don't have much choice..."
msgstr "Non abbiamo molta scelta..."

msgctxt "110\t410988\t37\tCHK"
msgid "I'll assume the responsibility."
msgstr "Mi assumerò la responsabilità."

msgctxt "110\t411020\t38\tCHK"
msgid "One more thing."
msgstr "Ancora una cosa."

msgctxt "110\t411036\t39\tCHK"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "E cioè?"

msgctxt "110\t411048\t40\tCHK"
msgid "You said earlier that you're not interested..."
msgstr "Prima hai detto che non sei interessato..."

msgctxt "110\t411095\t41\tCHK"
msgid "Then allow me to flip the script, if you will."
msgstr "Allora permettimi di capovolgere la sceneggiatura, se vuoi."

msgctxt "110\t411142\t42\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Can a footsoldier become chairman\n"
"just by saying they want to?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "110\t411205\t43\tCHK"
msgid "Am I wrong?"
msgstr "Mi sbaglio?"

msgctxt "110\t411217\t44\tCHK"
msgid "Guess you have a point."
msgstr "Immagino tu abbia ragione."

msgctxt "110\t411241\t45\tCHK"
msgid "Well all right."
msgstr "Bene, va bene."

msgctxt "110\t411257\t46\tCHK"
msgid "We gotta move."
msgstr "Dobbiamo muoverci."

msgctxt "110\t411272\t47\tCHK"
msgid ""
"So Toma and Mine are pushing the Okinawa resort,\n"
"while you and the CIA try to corner Black Monday."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "110\t411371\t48\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Stop him?\n"
"You're asking us to interrupt a CIA mission?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "110\t411426\t49\tCHK"
msgid "Correct, if that's what it takes to protect Toma."
msgstr "Esatto, se è quello che serve per proteggere Toma."

msgctxt "110\t411476\t50\tCHK"
msgid ""
"He's aware of my ties to the CIA,\n"
"and the fact that my military bill is a fake."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "110\t411556\t51\tCHK"
msgid ""
"If I had to guess, I'd say Tamiya's not\n"
"the kind of guy who'd just abandon one of his men."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "110\t411647\t52\tCHK"
msgid ""
"If you keep Toma safe from Joji, I'll ensure\n"
"that resort never sees the light of day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "110\t411733\t53\tCHK"
msgid ""
"In Okinawa. Meeting with the Prefectural\n"
"Assembly, if my sources are correct."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "110\t411811\t54\tCHK"
msgid ""
"That's right.\n"
"There's only one route out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "110\t411853\t55\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And these security guys...\n"
"What should I do with them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "110\t411908\t56\tCHK"
msgid ""
"They're essentially Suzuki's personal soldiers.\n"
"Do whatever it takes to get through."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "110\t411993\t57\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But doesn't every politician dream\n"
"of becoming prime minister someday?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "110\t412064\t58\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Those who reach the top are lifted there by their actions, whether they will"
" it or not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "110\t412152\t59\tCHK"
msgid "Hot damn. That's a lot of guys."
msgstr "Che caldo. Sono tanti ragazzi."

msgctxt "110\t412184\t60\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Date-san. I'll mop up here.\n"
"You go sneak out the back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "110\t412239\t61\tCHK"
msgid "You're media, remember?"
msgstr "Mio."

msgctxt "110\t412263\t62\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Just show them your business card.\n"
"They should let you through no problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "110\t412338\t63\tCHK"
msgid "But then!"
msgstr "Ma allora!"

msgctxt "110\t412348\t64\tCHK"
msgid "If I don't come back..."
msgstr "Se non torno..."

msgctxt "110\t412372\t65\tCHK"
msgid "Tell Majima-san everything we just heard."
msgstr "Racconta a Majima-san tutto quello che abbiamo appena sentito."

msgctxt "110\t412414\t66\tCHK"
msgid "Kiryu..."
msgstr "Kiryu..."

msgctxt "110\t412423\t67\tCHK"
msgid "Now go!"
msgstr "Adesso vai!"

msgctxt "110\t412431\t68\tCHK"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "112\t416408\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112\t416409\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Dammit... There's no end to them."
msgstr "Dannazione... non hanno fine."

msgctxt "112\t416443\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Kiryu-chan! Where'd ya go!?"
msgstr "Kiryu-chan! Dove sei andato!?"

msgctxt "112\t416471\t3\tCHK"
msgid "I'm right here!"
msgstr "Sono proprio qui!"

msgctxt "112\t416487\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Now hurry up and hop in!"
msgstr "Ora sbrigati e salta dentro!"

msgctxt "112\t416512\t5\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Well thank the freakin' stars!\n"
"Thought I squished ya flat like a bug!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "113\t418632\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "113\t418633\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Yoshitaka!"
msgstr "Yoshitaka!"

msgctxt "113\t418644\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Dad!"
msgstr "Papà!"

msgctxt "113\t418649\t3\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Where have you been?\n"
"Do you know how late it is, young man!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "113\t418710\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Um..."
msgstr "Ehm..."

msgctxt "113\t418716\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Me and my friends were playing baseball!"
msgstr "Io e i miei amici stavamo giocando a baseball!"

msgctxt "113\t418757\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Guys! Let me play, too!"
msgstr "Ragazzi! Fammi giocare anch'io!"

msgctxt "113\t418781\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Yeah, right. You don't even have a bat and glove."
msgstr "Sì, giusto. Non hai nemmeno una mazza e un guanto."

msgctxt "113\t418831\t8\tCHK"
msgid "There's no room in our game for poor orphanage trash!"
msgstr "Nel nostro gioco non c'è spazio per la povera spazzatura dell'orfanotrofio!"

msgctxt "113\t418885\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Yoshitaka..."
msgstr "Yoshitaka..."

msgctxt "113\t418898\t10\tCHK"
msgid "Listen to me."
msgstr "Ascoltami."

msgctxt "113\t418912\t11\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I always knew...\n"
"you were the smart one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "113\t418953\t12\tCHK"
msgid "Don't put that brain to waste."
msgstr "Non sprecare quel cervello."

msgctxt "113\t418984\t13\tCHK"
msgid "...Make something of yourself."
msgstr "Non picchiarmi, colpisci il cane!"

msgctxt "113\t419015\t14\tCHK"
msgid "Dad..."
msgstr "Papà..."

msgctxt "113\t419022\t15\tCHK"
msgid "I'm so sorry..."
msgstr "Mi dispiace tanto..."

msgctxt "113\t419038\t16\tCHK"
msgid "I can't... be there for you..."
msgstr "Non posso... essere lì per te..."

msgctxt "113\t419069\t17\tCHK"
msgid "Who is it?"
msgstr "Chi è?"

msgctxt "113\t419080\t18\tCHK"
msgid "Katase, sir."
msgstr "Katase, signore."

msgctxt "113\t419093\t19\tCHK"
msgid "Come in."
msgstr "Entra pure."

msgctxt "113\t419102\t20\tCHK"
msgid "Apologies if I interrupted anything."
msgstr "Mi scuso se ho interrotto qualcosa."

msgctxt "113\t419139\t21\tCHK"
msgid "I've booked your flight to Okinawa."
msgstr "È una maledetta vipera!"

msgctxt "113\t419175\t22\tCHK"
msgid "It leaves from Haneda in an hour and a half."
msgstr "Parte da Haneda tra un'ora e mezza."

msgctxt "113\t419220\t23\tCHK"
msgid "Then let's go."
msgstr "E allora andiamo!"

msgctxt "113\t419235\t24\tCHK"
msgid "Chairman..."
msgstr "Presidente..."

msgctxt "113\t419247\t25\tCHK"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "E cioè?"

msgctxt "113\t419259\t26\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Never mind.\n"
"It's nothing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "113\t419285\t27\tCHK"
msgid "If something happened to you, I..."
msgstr "Se ti fosse successo qualcosa, io..."

msgctxt "113\t419320\t28\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Don't give me that look.\n"
"I'll be fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "113\t419359\t29\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Oh, that's all it was?\n"
"And here I was worrying you'd run away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "113\t419422\t30\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Hey, and listen to this! I got the best\n"
"grade in my class on our test today!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "113\t419499\t31\tCHK"
msgid "Wow. I always knew you were a bright kid."
msgstr "Oh. Ho sempre saputo che eri un ragazzo brillante."

msgctxt "113\t419541\t32\tCHK"
msgid "Get up, please!"
msgstr "Alzati, per favore!"

msgctxt "113\t419557\t33\tCHK"
msgid ""
"It's just... you've been working\n"
"yourself awfully hard lately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "114\t421528\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "114\t421529\t1\tCHK"
msgid ""
"\"After investigating the incident which\n"
"took place yesterday at the National Diet Building...\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "114\t421624\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Mind turning that off?"
msgstr "Sì. Ho fatto una promessa a Rikiya."

msgctxt "114\t421647\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr "E di che."

msgctxt "114\t421658\t4\tCHK"
msgid ""
"\"Authorities are convinced it came about at the hands\n"
"of a group opposing the Okinawa military expansion bill.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "114\t421770\t5\tCHK"
msgid ""
"\"As we speak, patrols are on high alert in search of those behind the "
"incident.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "115\t422408\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "115\t422409\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr "Zio Kaz!"

msgctxt "115\t422420\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Nakahara!"
msgstr "Nakahara!"

msgctxt "115\t422430\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Are you sure you should be out of bed?"
msgstr "Sei sicuro che dovresti alzarti dal letto?"

msgctxt "115\t422469\t4\tCHK"
msgid "I've kept you waitin' long enough, brother."
msgstr "Ti ho fatto aspettare abbastanza, fratello."

msgctxt "116\t425336\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116\t425337\t1\tCHK"
msgid "I'm the freaking savior of Okinawa, baby!"
msgstr "Sono il dannato salvatore di Okinawa, tesoro!"

msgctxt "116\t425379\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Wow!"
msgstr "Oh!"

msgctxt "116\t425384\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Well? Aren't I the best?"
msgstr "BENE? Non sono il migliore?"

msgctxt "116\t425409\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Course I am!"
msgstr "Certo che lo sono!"

msgctxt "116\t425422\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Now come on, bottoms up!"
msgstr "Adesso forza, vai dal basso!"

msgctxt "116\t425447\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Don't do it!"
msgstr "Non farlo!"

msgctxt "116\t425460\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Tamiya told me everything."
msgstr "Tamiya mi ha detto tutto."

msgctxt "116\t425487\t8\tCHK"
msgid "Why you shot Nakahara and Daigo."
msgstr "Perché hai sparato a Nakahara e Daigo."

msgctxt "116\t425520\t9\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Why you're about to put\n"
"a bullet between Toma eyes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116\t425572\t10\tCHK"
msgid "He's gonna... kill me!?"
msgstr "Mi... ucciderà!?"

msgctxt "116\t425596\t11\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Tamiya sent me.\n"
"To stop you from making this mistake."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116\t425650\t12\tCHK"
msgid "The CIA?"
msgstr "La CIA?"

msgctxt "116\t425659\t13\tCHK"
msgid "Then that means..."
msgstr "Allora questo significa..."

msgctxt "116\t425678\t14\tCHK"
msgid "Minister Tamiya's gonna have me killed!"
msgstr "Il ministro Tamiya mi farà uccidere!"

msgctxt "116\t425718\t15\tCHK"
msgid "Not another step."
msgstr "Non un altro passo."

msgctxt "116\t425736\t16\tCHK"
msgid "Joji."
msgstr "Joji."

msgctxt "116\t425742\t17\tCHK"
msgid "Are you really going to kill Toma?"
msgstr "Ucciderai davvero Toma?"

msgctxt "116\t425777\t18\tCHK"
msgid "Kazuma Kiryu, yes?"
msgstr "Sei Kazuma Kiryu-san, vero?"

msgctxt "116\t425796\t19\tCHK"
msgid "You of all people should know."
msgstr "Tu più di tutti dovresti saperlo."

msgctxt "116\t425827\t20\tCHK"
msgid ""
"When your chairman tells you to do something,\n"
"you damn well do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116\t425894\t21\tCHK"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "116\t425900\t22\tCHK"
msgid "And the CIA is my \"chairman.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116\t425930\t23\tCHK"
msgid "I'll see you in hell."
msgstr "Ci vediamo all'inferno."

msgctxt "116\t425952\t24\tCHK"
msgid "Go!"
msgstr "Andare!"

msgctxt "116\t425956\t25\tCHK"
msgid "What do you think you're doing?"
msgstr "Cosa pensi di fare?"

msgctxt "116\t425988\t26\tCHK"
msgid "I saved Toma... and now it's your turn."
msgstr "Ho salvato Toma... e ora tocca a te."

msgctxt "116\t426028\t27\tCHK"
msgid "That's the promise I made Tamiya."
msgstr "Questa è la promessa che ho fatto a Tamiya."

msgctxt "116\t426062\t28\tCHK"
msgid "I'm merely following orders."
msgstr "Sto semplicemente eseguendo gli ordini."

msgctxt "116\t426091\t29\tCHK"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "116\t426097\t30\tCHK"
msgid "I see why my brother took a shine to you."
msgstr "Capisco perché mio fratello ti ha preso in simpatia."

msgctxt "116\t426139\t31\tCHK"
msgid "You're brighter than you look."
msgstr "Sei più luminoso di quanto sembri."

msgctxt "116\t426170\t32\tCHK"
msgid "But his blood flows through my veins."
msgstr "Ma il suo sangue scorre nelle mie vene."

msgctxt "116\t426208\t33\tCHK"
msgid "Can you truly fight me?"
msgstr "Puoi davvero combattermi?"

msgctxt "116\t426232\t34\tCHK"
msgid "Let's find out."
msgstr "Scopriamolo."

msgctxt "116\t426248\t35\tCHK"
msgid "Blood isn't what matters, though."
msgstr "Il sangue non è ciò che conta, però."

msgctxt "116\t426282\t36\tCHK"
msgid "Me and Kazama-san..."
msgstr "Cerchiamo di essere amici, Chin-san."

msgctxt "116\t426303\t37\tCHK"
msgid "Our bond was far stronger than that."
msgstr "Il nostro legame era molto più forte di così."

msgctxt "116\t426340\t38\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Show me, then.\n"
"Just how strong it was."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116\t426379\t39\tCHK"
msgid "Now, Kazuma Kiryu."
msgstr "Ora, Kazuma Kiryu."

msgctxt "116\t426398\t40\tCHK"
msgid "We fight!"
msgstr "Combattiamo!"

msgctxt "116\t426408\t41\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The island's future is brighter than ever!\n"
"Everyone's gonna remember the legend of Toma!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116\t426497\t42\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I don't care if it came from the top of the CIA.\n"
"This can't be what you want."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116\t426575\t43\tCHK"
msgid ""
"They say I need to kill someone, no matter\n"
"the target... I'm going to kill them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116\t426656\t44\tCHK"
msgid "Tamiya, huh? He was always so naive."
msgstr "Tamiya, eh? È sempre stato così ingenuo."

msgctxt "116\t426693\t45\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You're not killing anyone else.\n"
"I'm gonna make sure of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116\t426752\t46\tCHK"
msgid ""
"If you want to stop me...\n"
"you know what comes next."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116\t426804\t47\tCHK"
msgid ""
"There's only one way to solve this.\n"
"With our fists."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "117\t429736\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "117\t429737\t1\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I've grown too old for this.\n"
"Fighting's a young man's game."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "117\t429797\t2\tCHK"
msgid "But you did win."
msgstr "Ma hai vinto."

msgctxt "117\t429814\t3\tCHK"
msgid ""
"So just like Tamiya asked...\n"
"I'll stay away from the kid. I promise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "117\t429883\t4\tCHK"
msgid "The kid?"
msgstr "Quel tizio dall'aspetto di Kazama ha detto davvero tutto questo?"

msgctxt "117\t429892\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Toma!"
msgstr "Tomà!"

msgctxt "117\t429898\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Kiryu-san."
msgstr "Kiryu-san."

msgctxt "117\t429909\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Did Minister Tamiya really ask you to come here?"
msgstr "Accentua la tua naturale dolcezza."

msgctxt "117\t429958\t8\tCHK"
msgid "He does."
msgstr "Lo fa."

msgctxt "117\t429967\t9\tCHK"
msgid "But why?"
msgstr "Ma perché?"

msgctxt "117\t429976\t10\tCHK"
msgid "Tamiya cares about you."
msgstr "Tamiya si prende cura di te."

msgctxt "117\t430000\t11\tCHK"
msgid "He does?"
msgstr "Davvero?"

msgctxt "117\t430009\t12\tCHK"
msgid "But... why?"
msgstr "Ma... perché?"

msgctxt "117\t430021\t13\tCHK"
msgid "I betrayed him, left for Mine!"
msgstr "L'ho tradito, sono partito per il Mio!"

msgctxt "117\t430052\t14\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Tamiya would never lose faith in you\n"
"over something like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "117\t430115\t15\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And not only that. He thinks you'll\n"
"flourish into a great politician someday."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "117\t430193\t16\tCHK"
msgid "Minister..."
msgstr "Ministro..."

msgctxt "117\t430205\t17\tCHK"
msgid "Minister Tamiya..."
msgstr "Ministro Tamiya..."

msgctxt "117\t430224\t18\tCHK"
msgid "I'm sorry."
msgstr "Mi dispiace."

msgctxt "117\t430235\t19\tCHK"
msgid "I'm so sorry!"
msgstr "Mi dispiace tanto!"

msgctxt "117\t430249\t20\tCHK"
msgid ""
"If you were any younger...\n"
"I'm not so sure I would've won."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "117\t430308\t21\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Why would he put you through so much...\n"
"just to save me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "117\t430365\t22\tCHK"
msgid ""
"He admires just how devoted you are\n"
"to Okinawa. He told me as much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "118\t431784\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "118\t431785\t1\tCHK"
msgid "How long was I out for?"
msgstr "Per quanto tempo sono stato fuori?"

msgctxt "118\t431809\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Oh, just an hour or so."
msgstr "Oh, solo un'ora o giù di lì."

msgctxt "118\t431833\t3\tCHK"
msgid "And the boy?"
msgstr "E il ragazzo?"

msgctxt "118\t431846\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Good."
msgstr "Bene."

msgctxt "118\t431852\t5\tCHK"
msgid ""
"He and Tamiya are pretty similar.\n"
"Two men driven by emotion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "118\t431913\t6\tCHK"
msgid "I see now why Tamiya took a shine to him."
msgstr "Adesso capisco perché Tamiya si è preso una cotta per lui."

msgctxt "118\t431955\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Taking the last flight back to Tokyo.\n"
"He said he wants to apologize to Tamiya in person."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "119\t433544\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "119\t433545\t1\tCHK"
msgid "So. Where's Daigo?"
msgstr "COSÌ. Dov'è Daigo?"

msgctxt "119\t433564\t2\tCHK"
msgid "In Tokyo."
msgstr "A Tokio."

msgctxt "119\t433574\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Rehabbing at Touto Hospital."
msgstr "Riabilitazione all'ospedale di Touto."

msgctxt "119\t433603\t4\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Yes. CIA headquarters\n"
"has only known for a few hours now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "119\t433661\t5\tCHK"
msgid "And I just found out myself."
msgstr "E l'ho appena scoperto io stesso."

msgctxt "119\t433690\t6\tCHK"
msgid "I assume you're going?"
msgstr "Immagino che andrai?"

msgctxt "119\t433713\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Yeah. If I hurry, I should be able\n"
"to catch the last flight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "119\t433774\t8\tCHK"
msgid "Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr "Zio Kaz!"

msgctxt "119\t433785\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Taichi! What are you doing here!?"
msgstr "Taichi! Cosa ci fai qui!?"

msgctxt "119\t433819\t10\tCHK"
msgid "It's Morning Glory!"
msgstr "È la gloria del mattino!"

msgctxt "119\t433839\t11\tCHK"
msgid "They...!"
msgstr "Essi...!"

msgctxt "119\t433848\t12\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Touto? But that's practically\n"
"on Kamurocho's doorstep."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "119\t433903\t13\tCHK"
msgid ""
"If Mine has managed to find out as well,\n"
"we may already be too late."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "119\t433972\t14\tCHK"
msgid "Uncle Kaz! Uncle Kiryu!"
msgstr "Zio Kaz! Zio Kiryu!"

msgctxt "119\t433996\t15\tCHK"
msgid ""
"This is bad\n"
"This is real bad, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "119\t434037\t16\tCHK"
msgid "What is it? What happened!?"
msgstr "Che cos'è? Quello che è successo!?"

msgctxt "120\t437192\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120\t437193\t1\tCHK"
msgid "The hell?"
msgstr "Che diavolo?"

msgctxt "120\t437203\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Rikiya! Mikio!"
msgstr "Rikiya! Mikio!"

msgctxt "120\t437218\t3\tCHK"
msgid "You like it here, huh?"
msgstr "Ti piace qui, eh?"

msgctxt "120\t437241\t4\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Funny. Seeing you kids leeching\n"
"off an adult's generosity..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120\t437302\t5\tCHK"
msgid "It makes me sick to my stomach."
msgstr "Mi fa venire la nausea."

msgctxt "120\t437334\t6\tCHK"
msgid "I'd rather see you all put down."
msgstr "Preferirei vedervi tutti soppressi."

msgctxt "120\t437367\t7\tCHK"
msgid "In a way..."
msgstr "In un certo senso."

msgctxt "120\t437379\t8\tCHK"
msgid "You're all his victims."
msgstr "Siete tutte le sue vittime."

msgctxt "120\t437403\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Smash it."
msgstr "Distruggilo."

msgctxt "120\t437413\t10\tCHK"
msgid "No!"
msgstr "NO!"

msgctxt "120\t437417\t11\tCHK"
msgid "Outta the way!"
msgstr "Impressionante che abbia fatto tutto da solo."

msgctxt "120\t437432\t12\tCHK"
msgid "No! Don't do it!"
msgstr "NO! Non farlo!"

msgctxt "120\t437449\t13\tCHK"
msgid "Izumi!"
msgstr "Izumi!"

msgctxt "120\t437456\t14\tCHK"
msgid "Stop!"
msgstr "Fermo!"

msgctxt "120\t437462\t15\tCHK"
msgid "Please!"
msgstr "Ti prego!"

msgctxt "120\t437470\t16\tCHK"
msgid "Shut it, you fuckin' brat!"
msgstr "Sta' zitto, monello del cazzo!"

msgctxt "120\t437497\t17\tCHK"
msgid "Please! Stop!"
msgstr "Per favore, fermati!"

msgctxt "120\t437511\t18\tCHK"
msgid "Uncle Mikio!"
msgstr "Zio Mikio!"

msgctxt "120\t437524\t19\tCHK"
msgid "Mikio!"
msgstr "Mikio!"

msgctxt "120\t437531\t20\tCHK"
msgid "The hell're you doin', man?"
msgstr "Che diavolo stai facendo, amico?"

msgctxt "120\t437559\t21\tCHK"
msgid "I'm not..."
msgstr "io non sono..."

msgctxt "120\t437570\t22\tCHK"
msgid "Letting you do this."
msgstr "Lasciarti fare questo."

msgctxt "120\t437591\t23\tCHK"
msgid "What're you waiting for, coward!?"
msgstr "Cosa stai aspettando, codardo!?"

msgctxt "120\t437625\t24\tCHK"
msgid "Just crush 'em both!"
msgstr "Basta schiacciarli entrambi!"

msgctxt "120\t437646\t25\tCHK"
msgid "Yes, sir!"
msgstr "Sì, signore!"

msgctxt "120\t437656\t26\tCHK"
msgid "Mikio! That's enough!"
msgstr "Mikio! Questo è abbastanza!"

msgctxt "120\t437678\t27\tCHK"
msgid "Dammit..."
msgstr "Merda..."

msgctxt "120\t437688\t28\tCHK"
msgid "Sorry... I wasn't stronger..."
msgstr "Scusa... non ero più forte..."

msgctxt "120\t437718\t29\tCHK"
msgid "Not so fast."
msgstr "Fermo lì."

msgctxt "120\t437731\t30\tCHK"
msgid "We got some unfinished business."
msgstr "Abbiamo degli affari in sospeso."

msgctxt "120\t437764\t31\tCHK"
msgid "Tamashiro!"
msgstr "Tamashiro!"

msgctxt "120\t437775\t32\tCHK"
msgid "Tamashiro..."
msgstr "Tamashiro..."

msgctxt "120\t437788\t33\tCHK"
msgid ""
"If it's me you're after...\n"
"Just end it already."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120\t437836\t34\tCHK"
msgid "I'm beggin' you!"
msgstr "Ti sto implorando!"

msgctxt "120\t437853\t35\tCHK"
msgid "Oh, but that's not good enough."
msgstr "Oh, ma non è abbastanza buono."

msgctxt "120\t437885\t36\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I still haven't forgotten\n"
"what you did to me last year."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120\t437941\t37\tCHK"
msgid "You old fuck!"
msgstr "Vecchio stronzo!"

msgctxt "120\t437955\t38\tCHK"
msgid "Boss!"
msgstr "Capo!"

msgctxt "120\t437961\t39\tCHK"
msgid "We're gonna have a nice long talk later, you and me."
msgstr "Faremo una bella e lunga chiacchierata più tardi, io e te."

msgctxt "120\t438014\t40\tCHK"
msgid "After we tear this place to the ground, that is."
msgstr "Dopo che avremo raso al suolo questo posto, ovviamente."

msgctxt "120\t438063\t41\tCHK"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr "Cosa!?"

msgctxt "120\t438070\t42\tCHK"
msgid "C'mon. Bring it in!"
msgstr "Andiamo. Portalo dentro!"

msgctxt "120\t438090\t43\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Get outta here! The Tamashiro got\n"
"nothin' to do with this place!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120\t438155\t44\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You're stray pups, sure. But that alone\n"
"doesn't mean you deserve protection."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120\t438232\t45\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Well, I suppose all of this\n"
"is that hypocrite Kiryu-san's fault."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120\t438297\t46\tCHK"
msgid "Uncle Mikio! Uncle Mikio!"
msgstr "Zio Mikio! Zio Mikio!"

msgctxt "120\t438323\t47\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Could've sworn you croaked, old man.\n"
"Guess you're tougher than you look."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120\t438396\t48\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But the kids have nothing to do with this!\n"
"Spare them! Spare this orphanage, please!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "121\t440504\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "121\t440505\t1\tCHK"
msgid "All right."
msgstr "Va bene."

msgctxt "121\t440516\t2\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Things are real bad!\n"
"You gotta go back right now, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "122\t441608\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "122\t441609\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Uncle Kaz."
msgstr "Zio Kaz."

msgctxt "122\t441620\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr "Zio Kaz!"

msgctxt "122\t441631\t3\tCHK"
msgid "It was so scary!"
msgstr "Che spavento!"

msgctxt "122\t441648\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Give me a minute here."
msgstr "Dammi un minuto qui."

msgctxt "122\t441671\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Aniki..."
msgstr "Aniki..."

msgctxt "122\t441680\t6\tCHK"
msgid "How's Mikio?"
msgstr "Come sta Mikio?"

msgctxt "122\t441693\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Mikio."
msgstr "Mikio."

msgctxt "122\t441700\t8\tCHK"
msgid "Mikio!"
msgstr "Mikio!"

msgctxt "122\t441707\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Mikio?"
msgstr "Mikio?"

msgctxt "122\t441714\t10\tCHK"
msgid "Sir..."
msgstr "Signore..."

msgctxt "122\t441721\t11\tCHK"
msgid "It was all me."
msgstr "Ero tutto io."

msgctxt "122\t441736\t12\tCHK"
msgid "I couldn't stop 'em..."
msgstr "Non potevo fermarli..."

msgctxt "122\t441759\t13\tCHK"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "E cioè?"

msgctxt "122\t441771\t14\tCHK"
msgid "Please..."
msgstr "Ti prego..."

msgctxt "122\t441781\t15\tCHK"
msgid "Save the boss for me."
msgstr "Salva il capo per me."

msgctxt "122\t441803\t16\tCHK"
msgid "I will."
msgstr "Certo."

msgctxt "122\t441811\t17\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I'll bring Nakahara back.\n"
"I promise!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "122\t441848\t18\tCHK"
msgid "Glad to... hear it."
msgstr "Mi fa piacere."

msgctxt "122\t441868\t19\tCHK"
msgid "Answer me, Mikio!"
msgstr "Rispondimi, Mikio!"

msgctxt "122\t441886\t20\tCHK"
msgid "Dammit...!"
msgstr "Dannazione...!"

msgctxt "122\t441897\t21\tCHK"
msgid ""
"It's not your fault. Not at all!\n"
"Don't talk like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "122\t441952\t22\tCHK"
msgid "No! Uncle Mikio!"
msgstr "NO! Zio Mikio!"

msgctxt "123\t444600\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "123\t444601\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Hello?"
msgstr "Salve?"

msgctxt "123\t444608\t2\tCHK"
msgid "You mean it!?"
msgstr "Dici sul serio?"

msgctxt "123\t444622\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Yeah, uh-huh."
msgstr "Sì, eh."

msgctxt "123\t444636\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Right. I see!"
msgstr "Giusto. Vedo!"

msgctxt "123\t444650\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Thanks a bunch!"
msgstr "Grazie mille!"

msgctxt "123\t444666\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Later."
msgstr "A dopo."

msgctxt "123\t444673\t7\tCHK"
msgid "It's Mikio."
msgstr "E' Mikio."

msgctxt "123\t444685\t8\tCHK"
msgid "He's gonna pull through."
msgstr "A cosa serve questo atteggiamento da merda, eh?"

msgctxt "123\t444710\t9\tCHK"
msgid "That's incredible."
msgstr "È incredibile."

msgctxt "123\t444729\t10\tCHK"
msgid "What a relief!"
msgstr "Che sollievo."

msgctxt "123\t444744\t11\tCHK"
msgid "Well. It's about time I get going."
msgstr "BENE. Era ora che andassi."

msgctxt "123\t444779\t12\tCHK"
msgid "To bring the boss home?"
msgstr "Per riportare a casa il capo?"

msgctxt "123\t444803\t13\tCHK"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "123\t444809\t14\tCHK"
msgid ""
"They'll be at the bullring\n"
"right outside downtown Ryukyu, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "123\t444874\t15\tCHK"
msgid "Got it."
msgstr "Capito."

msgctxt "123\t444882\t16\tCHK"
msgid "Aniki. I'm coming with. Please."
msgstr "Aniki. Vengo con. Per favore."

msgctxt "123\t444914\t17\tCHK"
msgid "No."
msgstr "NO."

msgctxt "123\t444918\t18\tCHK"
msgid "But Aniki!"
msgstr "Ma Aniki!?"

msgctxt "123\t444929\t19\tCHK"
msgid "I said no!"
msgstr "Ho detto di no!"

msgctxt "123\t444940\t20\tCHK"
msgid ""
"If you come with me now,\n"
"you'll die a pointless death."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "123\t444995\t21\tCHK"
msgid "Aniki..."
msgstr "Aniki..."

msgctxt "123\t445004\t22\tCHK"
msgid "This isn't like when you followed me to Kamurocho."
msgstr "Non è come quando mi hai seguito a Kamurocho."

msgctxt "123\t445055\t23\tCHK"
msgid "This time, I have to go alone."
msgstr "Questa volta devo andare da solo."

msgctxt "123\t445086\t24\tCHK"
msgid "But I'm the captain of the Ryudo Family!"
msgstr "Ma io sono il capitano della Famiglia Ryudo!"

msgctxt "123\t445127\t25\tCHK"
msgid "Please. I need this."
msgstr "Per favore. Ne ho bisogno."

msgctxt "123\t445148\t26\tCHK"
msgid "I need to prove to myself I'm a real man!"
msgstr "Devo dimostrare a me stesso che sono un vero uomo!"

msgctxt "123\t445190\t27\tCHK"
msgid "I get what you're going through, but..."
msgstr "Capisco quello che stai passando, ma..."

msgctxt "123\t445230\t28\tCHK"
msgid "Now's not the time for that."
msgstr "(Non è il momento per questo...)"

msgctxt "123\t445259\t29\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Just wait, Rikiya.\n"
"Your time will come, I promise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "123\t445310\t30\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And when it does,\n"
"you can go out guns blazing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "123\t445357\t31\tCHK"
msgid "For now... just trust me."
msgstr "Per ora... fidati di me."

msgctxt "123\t445383\t32\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Yup. Tamashiro's been usin' it\n"
"as a hideout for a year or so now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "123\t445449\t33\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You've been shot.\n"
"You need to see a doctor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "123\t445493\t34\tCHK"
msgid ""
"My patriarch's been taken, my pride broken...\n"
"And you want me to just do nothing!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "123\t445576\t35\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Throwing your life away for no reason\n"
"won't make you a man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124\t450408\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124\t450409\t1\tCHK"
msgid "You again?"
msgstr "Ancora tu!?"

msgctxt "124\t450420\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Just the guy I wanted to see!"
msgstr "Proprio il ragazzo che volevo vedere!"

msgctxt "124\t450450\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Where's Nakahara!?"
msgstr "Dov'è Nakahara!?"

msgctxt "124\t450469\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Easy, boy. Don't get antsy."
msgstr "Facile, ragazzo. Non agitarti."

msgctxt "124\t450497\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Lemme enjoy this reunion a bit first."
msgstr "In tal caso, solo un secondo."

msgctxt "124\t450535\t6\tCHK"
msgid "And Mine?"
msgstr "E il mio?"

msgctxt "124\t450545\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Where is he?"
msgstr "Dov'è?"

msgctxt "124\t450558\t8\tCHK"
msgid ""
"My only job was wrecking that\n"
"shithole of an orphanage you run."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124\t450622\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Oh, and keeping you pinned down here."
msgstr "Oh, e tenerti bloccato qui."

msgctxt "124\t450660\t10\tCHK"
msgid ""
"If you die here, the Hakuho'll\n"
"make me a billionaire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124\t450714\t11\tCHK"
msgid "Bastard..."
msgstr "Bastardo..."

msgctxt "124\t450725\t12\tCHK"
msgid "Now, we got all the time in the world."
msgstr "Ora abbiamo tutto il tempo del mondo."

msgctxt "124\t450764\t13\tCHK"
msgid "Let's have a little fun, huh?"
msgstr "Divertiamoci un po', eh?"

msgctxt "124\t450794\t14\tCHK"
msgid "Nakahara!"
msgstr "Nakahara!"

msgctxt "124\t450804\t15\tCHK"
msgid "Kiryu!"
msgstr "Kiryu!"

msgctxt "124\t450811\t16\tCHK"
msgid "Pretty picture, ain't it?"
msgstr "Bella immagine, vero?"

msgctxt "124\t450837\t17\tCHK"
msgid "An old bullshitter taking on some old bulls!"
msgstr "Un vecchio stronzo che affronta dei vecchi tori!"

msgctxt "124\t450882\t18\tCHK"
msgid "The irony's killing me."
msgstr "L'ironia mi sta uccidendo."

msgctxt "124\t450906\t19\tCHK"
msgid "Tamashiro!"
msgstr "Tamashiro!"

msgctxt "124\t450917\t20\tCHK"
msgid "Not so fast!"
msgstr "Non così in fretta!"

msgctxt "124\t450930\t21\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You might not know, but bulls are\n"
"real sensitive to the sound of gunfire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124\t451004\t22\tCHK"
msgid "So whaddya say?"
msgstr "Allora, che ne dici?"

msgctxt "124\t451020\t23\tCHK"
msgid "Let's just forget about Nakahara for now."
msgstr "Dimentichiamoci di Nakahara per ora."

msgctxt "124\t451062\t24\tCHK"
msgid "Not happenin'!"
msgstr "Non succederà!"

msgctxt "124\t451077\t25\tCHK"
msgid "Who's there?"
msgstr "Chi c'è là?"

msgctxt "124\t451090\t26\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Sorry 'bout this, Aniki!\n"
"Don't get mad!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124\t451130\t27\tCHK"
msgid "The little lady..."
msgstr "La piccola signora..."

msgctxt "124\t451149\t28\tCHK"
msgid "I caught her sneakin' here all on her own!"
msgstr "L'ho sorpresa mentre sgattaiolava qui da sola!"

msgctxt "124\t451192\t29\tCHK"
msgid "Rikiya!"
msgstr "Rikiya!"

msgctxt "124\t451200\t30\tCHK"
msgid "Saki!"
msgstr "Saki!"

msgctxt "124\t451206\t31\tCHK"
msgid "Tamashiro! The cops're on their way!"
msgstr "E il mio?"

msgctxt "124\t451243\t32\tCHK"
msgid ""
"In ten minutes they'll have every last\n"
"corner of this place covered!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124\t451312\t33\tCHK"
msgid "The fuck?"
msgstr "Che cazzo!?"

msgctxt "124\t451322\t34\tCHK"
msgid "You little shit."
msgstr "Brutto stronzo!"

msgctxt "124\t451339\t35\tCHK"
msgid "I get it now."
msgstr "Ora capisco."

msgctxt "124\t451353\t36\tCHK"
msgid "Fine. If you want it that bad..."
msgstr "Bene. Se lo vuoi così tanto..."

msgctxt "124\t451386\t37\tCHK"
msgid "I'd be glad to oblige!"
msgstr "Sarei felice di accontentarti!"

msgctxt "124\t451409\t38\tCHK"
msgid "Boss!"
msgstr "Capo!"

msgctxt "124\t451415\t39\tCHK"
msgid "Dad!"
msgstr "Papà!"

msgctxt "124\t451420\t40\tCHK"
msgid "Dad, look out!"
msgstr "Papà, attento!"

msgctxt "124\t451435\t41\tCHK"
msgid "Tamashiro! I haven't felt this good in years!"
msgstr "Tamashiro! Non mi sentivo così bene da anni!"

msgctxt "124\t451481\t42\tCHK"
msgid ""
"It's like I'm a kid again,\n"
"rulin' this town!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124\t451526\t43\tCHK"
msgid "Kiryu... I'll be fine!"
msgstr "Kiryu... starò bene!"

msgctxt "124\t451549\t44\tCHK"
msgid "Handle him for me, will ya?"
msgstr "Gestiscilo per me, ok?"

msgctxt "124\t451577\t45\tCHK"
msgid "Got it!"
msgstr "Capito!"

msgctxt "124\t451585\t46\tCHK"
msgid "Right!"
msgstr "Giusto!"

msgctxt "124\t451592\t47\tCHK"
msgid "How long until the cops show up?"
msgstr "Quanto ci vorrà prima che arrivino i poliziotti?"

msgctxt "124\t451625\t48\tCHK"
msgid "Seven or eight minutes!"
msgstr "Nessun riguardo per la posizione che ricopri."

msgctxt "124\t451649\t49\tCHK"
msgid "Great."
msgstr "Ottimo."

msgctxt "124\t451656\t50\tCHK"
msgid ""
"That should be just enough time\n"
"to take out the trash here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124\t451716\t51\tCHK"
msgid "We'll need to make this quick."
msgstr "Dovremo fare in fretta."

msgctxt "124\t451747\t52\tCHK"
msgid "Works for me."
msgstr "Per me va bene."

msgctxt "124\t451761\t53\tCHK"
msgid "Go on, men! Fuck 'em up!"
msgstr "Avanti, uomini! Fanculo!"

msgctxt "124\t451786\t54\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You know, when Mine told me we'd be meeting again...\n"
"I got goosebumps from head to toe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124\t451874\t55\tCHK"
msgid "Long gone by now. To Tokyo."
msgstr "Ormai è passato da tempo. A Tokio."

msgctxt "124\t451902\t56\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And if I wipe out the Ryudo too,\n"
"Okinawa'll be mine and mine alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124\t451970\t57\tCHK"
msgid ""
"One little \"pop\" from this thing,\n"
"and they'll tear your buddy Nakahara to bits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124\t452050\t58\tCHK"
msgid ""
"He'll have plenty of playtime with his new pals\n"
"once you're out of the picture."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124\t452130\t59\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The hell you want,\n"
"another bullet in the leg!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124\t452177\t60\tCHK"
msgid ""
"A two-bit thug like you... You'll never\n"
"compete with Nakahara or Kiryu-aniki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124\t452255\t61\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You must reeeally wanna watch\n"
"your beloved patriarch bite the dust."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124\t452323\t62\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Nakahara! It's the end of the line\n"
"for you and your chickenshit Ryudo boys!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124\t452399\t63\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But only just.\n"
"There's no time to waste."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "125\t456456\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "125\t456457\t1\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Glad I'm not the only gassed one here.\n"
"Guess we're both over the hill."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "125\t456528\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Speak for yourself."
msgstr "Parla per te."

msgctxt "125\t456548\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Saki."
msgstr "Saki."

msgctxt "125\t456554\t4\tCHK"
msgid "I'm... so proud of you."
msgstr "Perché mi sento così in pace?"

msgctxt "125\t456578\t5\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And I'm sorry.\n"
"For making you worry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "125\t456615\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Rikiya!"
msgstr "Rikiya!"

msgctxt "125\t456623\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Turning your back on an enemy?\n"
"Amateur move."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "125\t456668\t8\tCHK"
msgid "And now..."
msgstr "E ora..."

msgctxt "125\t456679\t9\tCHK"
msgid "I'm finally gonna end you!"
msgstr "Finalmente ti finirò!"

msgctxt "125\t456706\t10\tCHK"
msgid "Looks like I was too late."
msgstr "Sembra che fosse troppo tardi."

msgctxt "125\t456733\t11\tCHK"
msgid "I think... he got me."
msgstr "Penso... che mi abbia preso."

msgctxt "125\t456755\t12\tCHK"
msgid "Ani...ki..."
msgstr "Ani...ki..."

msgctxt "125\t456767\t13\tCHK"
msgid "You'll be fine! Just fine!"
msgstr "Starai bene! Proprio bene!"

msgctxt "125\t456794\t14\tCHK"
msgid "It's just a scratch!"
msgstr "È solo un graffio!"

msgctxt "125\t456815\t15\tCHK"
msgid "Does this count... as..."
msgstr "Questo conta... come..."

msgctxt "125\t456840\t16\tCHK"
msgid "Throwing my life away... for no reason?"
msgstr "Buttare via la mia vita... senza motivo?"

msgctxt "125\t456880\t17\tCHK"
msgid "I... saved you."
msgstr "Io... ti ho salvato."

msgctxt "125\t456896\t18\tCHK"
msgid "Didn't I?"
msgstr "Non è vero?"

msgctxt "125\t456906\t19\tCHK"
msgid "Then..."
msgstr "Allora..."

msgctxt "125\t456914\t20\tCHK"
msgid "I..."
msgstr "Io..."

msgctxt "125\t456919\t21\tCHK"
msgid "That's all I need."
msgstr "Questo è tutto ciò di cui ho bisogno."

msgctxt "125\t456938\t22\tCHK"
msgid "Rikiya, please."
msgstr "Rikiya, per favore."

msgctxt "125\t456954\t23\tCHK"
msgid "Aniki."
msgstr "Capo"

msgctxt "125\t456961\t24\tCHK"
msgid "We had some good times."
msgstr "Abbiamo passato dei bei momenti."

msgctxt "125\t456985\t25\tCHK"
msgid "But I guess this is it."
msgstr "Ma immagino che sia tutto."

msgctxt "125\t457009\t26\tCHK"
msgid "Hey, Rikiya."
msgstr "Ehi, Rikiya."

msgctxt "125\t457022\t27\tCHK"
msgid "Don't talk like that!"
msgstr "Non parlare così!"

msgctxt "125\t457044\t28\tCHK"
msgid "Looks like... I'm..."
msgstr "Sembra che... io..."

msgctxt "125\t457065\t29\tCHK"
msgid "A real man... now, huh?"
msgstr "Un vero uomo... adesso, eh?"

msgctxt "125\t457089\t30\tCHK"
msgid "You're..."
msgstr "Tu sei..."

msgctxt "125\t457099\t31\tCHK"
msgid "A great man."
msgstr "Un grande uomo."

msgctxt "125\t457112\t32\tCHK"
msgid "The best I've ever known."
msgstr "Il migliore che abbia mai conosciuto."

msgctxt "125\t457138\t33\tCHK"
msgid "Rikiya."
msgstr "Rikiya."

msgctxt "125\t457146\t34\tCHK"
msgid "Just... promise me..."
msgstr "Solo... promettimelo..."

msgctxt "125\t457168\t35\tCHK"
msgid "Mine. You..."
msgstr "Mio. Voi..."

msgctxt "125\t457181\t36\tCHK"
msgid "Mine?"
msgstr "Mio?"

msgctxt "125\t457187\t37\tCHK"
msgid "What about him!?"
msgstr "E lui?"

msgctxt "125\t457204\t38\tCHK"
msgid "Don't let him win."
msgstr "Non lasciarlo vincere."

msgctxt "125\t457223\t39\tCHK"
msgid "I won't!"
msgstr "Non lo farò!"

msgctxt "125\t457232\t40\tCHK"
msgid "Just don't go!"
msgstr "Basta, non andare!"

msgctxt "125\t457247\t41\tCHK"
msgid "Please, Rikiya!"
msgstr "Per favore, Rikiya!"

msgctxt "125\t457263\t42\tCHK"
msgid "I'm... sorry..."
msgstr "Mi... dispiace."

msgctxt "125\t457279\t43\tCHK"
msgid "Please! Rikiya!"
msgstr "Per favore! Rikiya!"

msgctxt "125\t457295\t44\tCHK"
msgid "Come on!"
msgstr "Fatti sotto!"

msgctxt "125\t457304\t45\tCHK"
msgid "You can't die on me, Rikiya!"
msgstr "Non puoi morire per me, Rikiya!"

msgctxt "125\t457333\t46\tCHK"
msgid "Just get up, Rikiya!"
msgstr "Alzati e basta, Rikiya!"

msgctxt "125\t457354\t47\tCHK"
msgid "How's it.. look?"
msgstr "Come va... guarda?"

msgctxt "125\t457371\t48\tCHK"
msgid "Hey! Stay with me! Please!"
msgstr "EHI! Resta con me! Per favore!"

msgctxt "125\t457398\t49\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I won't let you!\n"
"You hear me, Rikiya!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "126\t460840\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "126\t460841\t1\tCHK"
msgid "We will be arriving in approximately 10 minutes."
msgstr "Arriveremo tra circa 10 minuti."

msgctxt "126\t460890\t2\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Please remain seated with your seatbelt\n"
"fastened until we have safely landed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "126\t460968\t3\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Man. I'd give anything to see\n"
"the look on Kiryu's face right about now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "126\t461040\t4\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Bet he realizes he should never\n"
"have messed with the Hakuho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "126\t461101\t5\tCHK"
msgid ""
"We've waited so long...\n"
"but it's finally Chairman Mine's time to shine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "126\t461173\t6\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I think we've earned ourselves\n"
"a little party once we're back in Tokyo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "126\t461245\t7\tCHK"
msgid "What for?"
msgstr "E per cosa?"

msgctxt "126\t461255\t8\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Mine's a lock for the seventh\n"
"chairmanship at this point."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "126\t461313\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Guess you're right."
msgstr "Immagino tu abbia ragione."

msgctxt "126\t461333\t10\tCHK"
msgid "The boss'll be happy, too."
msgstr "Anche il capo sarà felice."

msgctxt "126\t461360\t11\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But you know, the sixth chairman\n"
"let his guard down way too easy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "126\t461426\t12\tCHK"
msgid "No wonder he got a bullet in his chest."
msgstr "Non c'è da stupirsi che abbia avuto una pallottola nel petto."

msgctxt "126\t461466\t13\tCHK"
msgid "Not too long since he was in diapers, you know."
msgstr "Non è passato molto tempo dall'ultima volta che ha indossato i pannolini, sai."

msgctxt "126\t461514\t14\tCHK"
msgid "But I guess he's good as dead now."
msgstr "Metterò fine alla cosa con i Miei."

msgctxt "126\t461549\t15\tCHK"
msgid "Hell yeah he is."
msgstr "Diavolo sì, lo è."

msgctxt "126\t461566\t16\tCHK"
msgid "What was that?"
msgstr "Cosa hai detto?"

msgctxt "126\t461581\t17\tCHK"
msgid "Why, did something good happen?"
msgstr "Ti è successo qualcosa di bello?"

msgctxt "126\t461613\t18\tCHK"
msgid "Oh yeah, it's⑬"
msgstr "Oh sì, lo è⑬"

msgctxt "126\t461630\t19\tCHK"
msgid "What happened, huh!?"
msgstr "Cos'è successo, eh!?"

msgctxt "126\t461651\t20\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You think the sixth chairman's death\n"
"is something to celebrate!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "126\t461716\t21\tCHK"
msgid "Is it!?"
msgstr "Lo è!?"

msgctxt "126\t461724\t22\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Not only is our Kiryu problem snuffed out for good,\n"
"but we're gonna be top of the pack."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "126\t461812\t23\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Got that right. Kid like him had no business\n"
"leading the clan in the first place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "126\t461894\t24\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Oh, Chairman. He was just suggesting\n"
"we throw ourselves a party."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "127\t463960\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "127\t463961\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Bingo."
msgstr "Bingo."

msgctxt "127\t463968\t2\tCHK"
msgid "The entire trip clocks in just under an hour."
msgstr "L'intero viaggio dura poco meno di un'ora."

msgctxt "127\t464014\t3\tCHK"
msgid "You sure you're ready to go?"
msgstr "Sei sicuro di essere pronto per partire?"

msgctxt "127\t464043\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Yeah. I made Rikiya a promise."
msgstr "Sì. Ho fatto una promessa a Rikiya."

msgctxt "127\t464074\t5\tCHK"
msgid "I'm going to end things with Mine."
msgstr "Metterò fine alla cosa con i Miei."

msgctxt "127\t464109\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Thanks for everything."
msgstr "Grazie di tutto."

msgctxt "127\t464132\t7\tCHK"
msgid "What are you doing?"
msgstr "Che vuoi fare?"

msgctxt "127\t464152\t8\tCHK"
msgid "This isn't over yet."
msgstr "Non è ancora finita."

msgctxt "127\t464173\t9\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Once you stop Mine,\n"
"and once I capture Richardson..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "127\t464226\t10\tCHK"
msgid "Then, and only then, I'll shake your hand."
msgstr "Allora, e solo allora, ti stringerò la mano."

msgctxt "127\t464269\t11\tCHK"
msgid "Now go."
msgstr "Ora vai."

msgctxt "127\t464277\t12\tCHK"
msgid "It's just the two of you?"
msgstr "Siete solo voi due?"

msgctxt "127\t464303\t13\tCHK"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "127\t464309\t14\tCHK"
msgid "You're coming, right, Haruka?"
msgstr "Verrai, vero, Haruka?"

msgctxt "127\t464339\t15\tCHK"
msgid "Mhm!"
msgstr "Mhm!"

msgctxt "127\t464344\t16\tCHK"
msgid "I won't be far behind."
msgstr "Non sarò molto indietro."

msgctxt "127\t464367\t17\tCHK"
msgid ""
"After you find Daigo,\n"
"head up to the hospital roof."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "127\t464419\t18\tCHK"
msgid "I'll send a rescue helicopter you way."
msgstr "Ti manderò un elicottero di salvataggio."

msgctxt "127\t464458\t19\tCHK"
msgid "Got it."
msgstr "Capito."

msgctxt "127\t464466\t20\tCHK"
msgid "And be careful, you hear?"
msgstr "E stai attento, capito?"

msgctxt "127\t464492\t21\tCHK"
msgid "I'll see you on the roof."
msgstr "Ci vediamo sul tetto."

msgctxt "127\t464518\t22\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I get it now. This is how you got\n"
"between Okinawa and Tokyo so fast."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128\t466200\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128\t466201\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Sixth Chairman."
msgstr "Sesto Presidente."

msgctxt "128\t466217\t2\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Sir.\n"
"It's Mr. Richardson."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128\t466243\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Kiryu-san has left Okinawa."
msgstr "Kiryu-san ha lasciato Okinawa."

msgctxt "128\t466271\t4\tCHK"
msgid "He'll be joining us here soon enough."
msgstr "Si unirà a noi qui abbastanza presto."

msgctxt "128\t466309\t5\tCHK"
msgid "How should we respond?"
msgstr "Come dovremmo rispondere?"

msgctxt "128\t466332\t6\tCHK"
msgid "We shouldn't."
msgstr "Non dovremmo."

msgctxt "128\t466346\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Once \"they\" arrive...\n"
"it'll all be over."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128\t466387\t8\tCHK"
msgid "Hello?"
msgstr "Salve?"

msgctxt "128\t466394\t9\tCHK"
msgid "No."
msgstr "NO."

msgctxt "128\t466398\t10\tCHK"
msgid "There's no change in the plan."
msgstr "Non c'è nessun cambiamento nel piano."

msgctxt "128\t466429\t11\tCHK"
msgid "Bye."
msgstr "Ciao."

msgctxt "128\t466434\t12\tCHK"
msgid "Okay, got it."
msgstr "Okay, capito."

msgctxt "129\t468024\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "129\t468025\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Hey, Uncle Kaz?"
msgstr "Ehi, zio Kaz!"

msgctxt "129\t468041\t2\tCHK"
msgid "What's up?"
msgstr "Che c'è?"

msgctxt "129\t468052\t3\tCHK"
msgid "You're here to save Daigo-san, aren't you?"
msgstr "Sei qui per salvare Daigo-san, vero?"

msgctxt "129\t468095\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Why'd you ask me to come with you?"
msgstr "Perché mi hai chiesto di venire con te?"

msgctxt "129\t468130\t5\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You usually make me stay home,\n"
"even when I beg to go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "129\t468184\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Uncle Kaz."
msgstr "Zio Kaz."

msgctxt "129\t468195\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Are you gonna die up here!?"
msgstr "Morirai qui!?"

msgctxt "129\t468223\t8\tCHK"
msgid "I'm sorry, Haruka."
msgstr "Mi dispiace, Haruka."

msgctxt "129\t468242\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Eh?"

msgctxt "129\t468247\t10\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I just wanted to see Kamurocho\n"
"with you one last time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "129\t468302\t11\tCHK"
msgid "Uncle Kaz..."
msgstr "Zio Kaz..."

msgctxt "129\t468315\t12\tCHK"
msgid "I'm sorry."
msgstr "Mi dispiace."

msgctxt "129\t468326\t13\tCHK"
msgid "It was selfish of me to bring you."
msgstr "È stato egoista da parte mia portarti."

msgctxt "129\t468361\t14\tCHK"
msgid "I should have have just left you⑬"
msgstr "Avrei dovuto lasciarti⑬"

msgctxt "129\t468397\t15\tCHK"
msgid "It's okay."
msgstr "Non fa niente..."

msgctxt "129\t468408\t16\tCHK"
msgid "I'm happy I'm here."
msgstr "Sono felice di essere qui."

msgctxt "129\t468428\t17\tCHK"
msgid "Haruka."
msgstr "Haruka."

msgctxt "129\t468436\t18\tCHK"
msgid "I really am."
msgstr "E perché ha dovuto perderli?"

msgctxt "129\t468449\t19\tCHK"
msgid "Thank you, Uncle Kaz."
msgstr "Grazie, zio Kaz."

msgctxt "129\t468471\t20\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Is that why you brought me with you?\n"
"Because you know this is the end!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "130\t469608\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "130\t469609\t1\tCHK"
msgid "So you're the Hakuho, huh?"
msgstr "Quindi tu sei l'Hakuho, eh?"

msgctxt "130\t469636\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Fine then."
msgstr "Bene, allora."

msgctxt "130\t469647\t3\tCHK"
msgid ""
"If it's a fight you want,\n"
"that's what you'll get!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "130\t469697\t4\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I'm in a hurry here.\n"
"Out of the way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "131\t471592\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "131\t471593\t1\tCHK"
msgid "It's you."
msgstr "Sei tu..."

msgctxt "131\t471603\t2\tCHK"
msgid "What are you doing here?"
msgstr "Che ci fai qui?"

msgctxt "131\t471628\t3\tCHK"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "131\t471634\t4\tCHK"
msgid "The roof, huh?"
msgstr "Il tetto, eh?"

msgctxt "131\t471649\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Looks like you're a little late."
msgstr "Sembra che tu sia un po' in ritardo."

msgctxt "131\t471682\t6\tCHK"
msgid "You just missed him."
msgstr "Ti è mancato proprio."

msgctxt "131\t471703\t7\tCHK"
msgid "I'd have killed you when we first met."
msgstr "Ti avrei ucciso la prima volta che ci siamo incontrati."

msgctxt "131\t471742\t8\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Where's Daigo?\n"
"What did you do with him!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "131\t471784\t9\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And let me guess. If I want to get up there,\n"
"I'll need to go through you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "131\t471858\t10\tCHK"
msgid "You're welcome to try."
msgstr "Puoi provare."

msgctxt "131\t471881\t11\tCHK"
msgid "If I'd known it would have come to this..."
msgstr "Se l'avessi saputo saremmo arrivati ​​a questo..."

msgctxt "131\t471924\t12\tCHK"
msgid ""
"If you're looking for Daigo, \n"
"Mine's taken him up to the roof."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "131\t471987\t13\tCHK"
msgid ""
"This is the end of the line\n"
"for you, Kazuma Kiryu!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t483176\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t483177\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Mine!"
msgstr "Mio!"

msgctxt "132\t483183\t2\tCHK"
msgid "I'm glad to see you, Kiryu-san."
msgstr "Sono felice di vederti, Kiryu-san."

msgctxt "132\t483215\t3\tCHK"
msgid "An interesting theory."
msgstr "Una teoria interessante"

msgctxt "132\t483238\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Kiryu-san."
msgstr "Kiryu-san."

msgctxt "132\t483249\t5\tCHK"
msgid "I've been very worried about him."
msgstr "Usa una goccia di tigre Komaki!"

msgctxt "132\t483283\t6\tCHK"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr "Cosa!?"

msgctxt "132\t483290\t7\tCHK"
msgid "My entire life, nobody believed in me."
msgstr "Per tutta la mia vita nessuno ha creduto in me."

msgctxt "132\t483329\t8\tCHK"
msgid "Not until the sixth chairman came along, that is."
msgstr "Almeno finché non arrivò il sesto presidente."

msgctxt "132\t483379\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "132\t483385\t10\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Well, what if I told you\n"
"I bribed him to let me in?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t483437\t11\tCHK"
msgid "Why stoop that low just to join the yakuza?"
msgstr "Perché abbassarsi così in basso solo per unirsi alla yakuza?"

msgctxt "132\t483481\t12\tCHK"
msgid "You see, just like you..."
msgstr "Vedi, proprio come te..."

msgctxt "132\t483507\t13\tCHK"
msgid "I, too, was an orphan."
msgstr "Anch'io ero orfano."

msgctxt "132\t483530\t14\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Alone in this world\n"
"from the moment I was born."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t483578\t15\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The only childhood memories I have...\n"
"are ones of struggle for survival."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t483651\t16\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I was like one of those children\n"
"scavenging the ruins of post-war Tokyo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t483724\t17\tCHK"
msgid ""
"It's hard to believe such poverty\n"
"still exists nowadays."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t483781\t18\tCHK"
msgid "You know what I went through."
msgstr "Cerchiamo di essere amici, Chin-san."

msgctxt "132\t483811\t19\tCHK"
msgid "I needed to make something of myself."
msgstr "Il suo nome era Jingu Kyohei."

msgctxt "132\t483849\t20\tCHK"
msgid "I worked myself to the bone."
msgstr "Non picchiarmi, colpisci il cane!"

msgctxt "132\t483878\t21\tCHK"
msgid "I made countless sacrifices."
msgstr "Ho fatto innumerevoli sacrifici."

msgctxt "132\t483907\t22\tCHK"
msgid "And do you know why?"
msgstr "E sai perché?"

msgctxt "132\t483928\t23\tCHK"
msgid "It was all about money."
msgstr "Era tutta una questione di soldi."

msgctxt "132\t483952\t24\tCHK"
msgid "Until at last, I could buy anything I wanted."
msgstr "Finché alla fine ho potuto comprare tutto ciò che volevo."

msgctxt "132\t483998\t25\tCHK"
msgid "Have any woman I wanted."
msgstr "Avere qualunque donna desiderassi."

msgctxt "132\t484023\t26\tCHK"
msgid ""
"My employees would gladly\n"
"follow any order I gave them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t484079\t27\tCHK"
msgid "But I came to a realization."
msgstr "Ma sono arrivato a una realizzazione."

msgctxt "132\t484108\t28\tCHK"
msgid "All of that... was a lie."
msgstr "Tutto ciò... era una bugia."

msgctxt "132\t484134\t29\tCHK"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "Cosa intendi?"

msgctxt "132\t484152\t30\tCHK"
msgid "Living through that reality made me wonder."
msgstr "Vivere quella realtà mi ha fatto riflettere."

msgctxt "132\t484196\t31\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Does friendship truly exist?\n"
"Is loyalty just an unreachable ideal?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t484263\t32\tCHK"
msgid "In other words... the yakuza."
msgstr "In altre parole... la yakuza."

msgctxt "132\t484293\t33\tCHK"
msgid "That's where I met..."
msgstr "È lì che ho incontrato..."

msgctxt "132\t484315\t34\tCHK"
msgid "Daigo-san here."
msgstr "Daigo-san qui."

msgctxt "132\t484331\t35\tCHK"
msgid "He welcomed me with open arms."
msgstr "Sai... Il mio mi ha insegnato qualcosa."

msgctxt "132\t484362\t36\tCHK"
msgid "He wasn't much older than me."
msgstr "Non era molto più vecchio di me."

msgctxt "132\t484392\t37\tCHK"
msgid "Then why? Why are you doing this?"
msgstr "Non posso proprio..."

msgctxt "132\t484426\t38\tCHK"
msgid "The truth is, Kiryu-san."
msgstr "La verità è, Kiryu-san."

msgctxt "132\t484451\t39\tCHK"
msgid "Daigo-san is as good as dead."
msgstr "Daigo-san è praticamente morto."

msgctxt "132\t484481\t40\tCHK"
msgid "And this is what I settled on."
msgstr "E questo è ciò su cui ho deciso."

msgctxt "132\t484512\t41\tCHK"
msgid "So you started working with Black Monday."
msgstr "Quindi hai iniziato a lavorare con Black Monday."

msgctxt "132\t484554\t42\tCHK"
msgid "Correct."
msgstr "Esatto."

msgctxt "132\t484563\t43\tCHK"
msgid "He's nothing more than a tangle of tubes now."
msgstr "Adesso non è altro che un groviglio di tubi."

msgctxt "132\t484609\t44\tCHK"
msgid "That's not a life worth living."
msgstr "Non è una vita degna di essere vissuta."

msgctxt "132\t484641\t45\tCHK"
msgid "Don't do it, Mine!"
msgstr "Non farlo, mio!"

msgctxt "132\t484660\t46\tCHK"
msgid ""
"This isn't Daigo-san I once knew.\n"
"That man has been long dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t484723\t47\tCHK"
msgid "Mine."
msgstr "Mio."

msgctxt "132\t484729\t48\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Listen.\n"
"You have it all wrong."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t484760\t49\tCHK"
msgid "Don't you get it?"
msgstr "Non capisci?"

msgctxt "132\t484778\t50\tCHK"
msgid "I knew you'd say something like that."
msgstr "Sapevo che avresti detto una cosa del genere."

msgctxt "132\t484816\t51\tCHK"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "132\t484822\t52\tCHK"
msgid "Why do you do it!?"
msgstr "Perché lo fai!?"

msgctxt "132\t484841\t53\tCHK"
msgid "You were an orphan, just like I was!"
msgstr "Eri un orfano, proprio come lo ero io!"

msgctxt "132\t484878\t54\tCHK"
msgid "How can you keep playing these games!?"
msgstr "Come puoi continuare a giocare a questi giochi!?"

msgctxt "132\t484917\t55\tCHK"
msgid "There are two things left for me to do."
msgstr "Mi restano due cose da fare."

msgctxt "132\t484957\t56\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The first is finally ending Daigo-san's\n"
"pathetic wreck of an existence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t485029\t57\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The second murdering you.\n"
"The man he respected so much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t485085\t58\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Then, once the Tojo is finally mine...\n"
"my life will have meaning⑬."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t485154\t59\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You're wrong.\n"
"That won't give you meaning."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t485197\t60\tCHK"
msgid "You don't understand a damn thing."
msgstr "Non capisci un bel niente."

msgctxt "132\t485232\t61\tCHK"
msgid "Don't act like you know me!"
msgstr "Non comportarti come se mi conoscessi!"

msgctxt "132\t485260\t62\tCHK"
msgid ""
"What about the people who left?\n"
"Do you still resent them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t485318\t63\tCHK"
msgid "I'd slit their throats if they were here now!"
msgstr "Gli taglierei la gola se fossero qui adesso!"

msgctxt "132\t485364\t64\tCHK"
msgid "Have a problem with that!?"
msgstr "Hai un problema con quello!?"

msgctxt "132\t485391\t65\tCHK"
msgid "You're just like them."
msgstr "Sei proprio come loro."

msgctxt "132\t485414\t66\tCHK"
msgid "That's why you've always been alone."
msgstr "Ecco perché sei sempre stato solo."

msgctxt "132\t485451\t67\tCHK"
msgid "Not another word!"
msgstr "Non un'altra parola!"

msgctxt "132\t485469\t68\tCHK"
msgid "But when you finally started trusting him⑬"
msgstr "Completamento stimato della struttura del resort"

msgctxt "132\t485514\t69\tCHK"
msgid "What do you think you're doing!?"
msgstr "Cosa pensi di fare!?"

msgctxt "132\t485547\t70\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I can stand here talking all night.\n"
"But nothing I say will ever get through."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t485624\t71\tCHK"
msgid "So I'll just have to teach you what I mean..."
msgstr "Quindi dovrò solo insegnarti cosa intendo..."

msgctxt "132\t485670\t72\tCHK"
msgid "The only way I know how."
msgstr "L'unico modo che conosco."

msgctxt "132\t485695\t73\tCHK"
msgid "Fine then."
msgstr "Bene, allora."

msgctxt "132\t485706\t74\tCHK"
msgid "But fair warning."
msgstr "Ma giusto avvertimento."

msgctxt "132\t485724\t75\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I won't go down easy.\n"
"Not even to a legend like you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t485777\t76\tCHK"
msgid ""
"So you've come.\n"
"I knew you would."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t485811\t77\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Spare me the small talk!\n"
"Mine. What are you going to do with Daigo!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t485880\t78\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You want to kill him, don't you?\n"
"So you can take control of the Tojo Clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t485955\t79\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But I couldn't care less about that.\n"
"This isn't how it was meant to be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t486027\t80\tCHK"
msgid ""
"What do you mean?\n"
"Explain yourself!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t486063\t81\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The truth is, Daigo-san⑬\n"
"The sixth chairman, I mean."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t486118\t82\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You're aware that Kanda is the one who\n"
"brought me into the yakuza world, yes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t486196\t83\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I needed a fool recently out of prison,\n"
"and Kanda fit the bill. Almost to a T."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t486275\t84\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Loved by no one. Needed by no one.\n"
"No companion but your own loneliness."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t486348\t85\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Becoming successful. Making money.\n"
"That was all I cared about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t486411\t86\tCHK"
msgid ""
"From the minute I made wealth my goal, every moment...\n"
"every breath I took was taken toward achieving that goal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t486524\t87\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Don't you see?\n"
"Humans by nature are selfish liars."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t486575\t88\tCHK"
msgid ""
"No matter how many claim loyalty to the cause,\n"
"they'll all abandon ship sooner or later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t486664\t89\tCHK"
msgid ""
"It was then that I learned of a system in which\n"
"the bonds between men ruled supreme."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t486749\t90\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Correct. So I decided, I needed to see\n"
"for myself if these bonds really existed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t486830\t91\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Bribing Kanda was simple.\n"
"Just like that, I was in the Tojo Clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t486896\t92\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Daigo-san, despite my lack of yakuza experience...\n"
"despite my lack of human experience..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t486986\t93\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But he had the charisma of a true leader.\n"
"It was incredible to see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t487054\t94\tCHK"
msgid ""
"He was the first person I had ever\n"
"admired with every fiber of my being."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t487127\t95\tCHK"
msgid ""
"If Daigo-san were still alive right now,\n"
"I never would have gotten involved."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t487204\t96\tCHK"
msgid "What? Explain."
msgstr "Che cosa? Spiegare."

msgctxt "132\t487219\t97\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I was devastated. Robbed of the one man I ever loved,\n"
"I needed to find a new reason to live."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t487312\t98\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Meaningless as it may be,\n"
"I craved the power to do what I wanted."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t487378\t99\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I don't understand.\n"
"Daigo's right there, still breathing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t487436\t100\tCHK"
msgid "I can't bear to see him like this anymore."
msgstr "Non posso più sopportare di vederlo così."

msgctxt "132\t487479\t101\tCHK"
msgid ""
"As long as a person is clinging to life,\n"
"there's value in their existence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t487554\t102\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Daigo is fighting tooth and nail just to hold on...\n"
"And you're just going to senselessly kill him anyway?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t487660\t103\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I suppose that's one of the reasons\n"
"Daigo-san liked you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t487717\t104\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But me? People like you who stop at nothing\n"
"to help others make my fucking blood boil!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t487804\t105\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I think I see why everyone deserted you.\n"
"It's plain as day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t487864\t106\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Of course I do! Money's all\n"
"those heartless bastards live for! All they crave!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t487943\t107\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You and them... You both let money control your lives.\n"
"Never stopped to face those around you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t488038\t108\tCHK"
msgid ""
"All you've ever cared about is you.\n"
"You refused to trust a single soul but yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t488123\t109\tCHK"
msgid "Even so, Daigo always viewed you as his equal."
msgstr "Anche così, Daigo ti ha sempre considerato un suo pari."

msgctxt "132\t488170\t110\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Even when your whole world's at stake,\n"
"you still refuse to change your ways."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132\t488247\t111\tCHK"
msgid ""
"If you really think you can change my mind,\n"
"after all I've said... you're welcome to try."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "133\t498568\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "133\t498569\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Looks like... I..."
msgstr "Sembra che... io..."

msgctxt "133\t498588\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Lost."
msgstr "Perduto."

msgctxt "133\t498594\t3\tCHK"
msgid "This is Katase."
msgstr "Questo è Katase."

msgctxt "133\t498610\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Uh-huh."
msgstr "Già."

msgctxt "133\t498618\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Sir? Are you hurt?"
msgstr "Signore? Sei ferito?"

msgctxt "133\t498637\t6\tCHK"
msgid "I'm fine."
msgstr "Sto bene."

msgctxt "133\t498647\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Chairman, I've been so worried about⑬"
msgstr "Presidente, ero così preoccupato per⑬"

msgctxt "133\t498687\t8\tCHK"
msgid "You know... Katase."
msgstr "Sai... Katase."

msgctxt "133\t498707\t9\tCHK"
msgid "You're the only one..."
msgstr "Sei l'unico..."

msgctxt "133\t498730\t10\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I need your advice, sir.\n"
"Please."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "133\t498763\t11\tCHK"
msgid "It's the only thing I have left."
msgstr "È l'unica cosa che mi resta."

msgctxt "133\t498796\t12\tCHK"
msgid "All this time, I've been vain."
msgstr "Per tutto questo tempo sono stato vanitoso."

msgctxt "133\t498827\t13\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Never relied on anyone.\n"
"Never trusted anyone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "133\t498873\t14\tCHK"
msgid "Only the power of money."
msgstr "Solo il potere del denaro."

msgctxt "133\t498898\t15\tCHK"
msgid "Chairman, this deal could bring you billions!"
msgstr "Presidente, questo accordo potrebbe fruttarle miliardi!"

msgctxt "133\t498944\t16\tCHK"
msgid "Please, you need to make a decision."
msgstr "Cos'ha da dire Kiryu-aniki?"

msgctxt "133\t498981\t17\tCHK"
msgid "And to be trusted in return."
msgstr "E di cui fidarsi in cambio."

msgctxt "133\t499010\t18\tCHK"
msgid "Maybe that's all anyone really needs."
msgstr "Forse è tutto ciò di cui qualcuno ha veramente bisogno."

msgctxt "133\t499048\t19\tCHK"
msgid "Hey, Kiryu."
msgstr "Ehi, Kiryu."

msgctxt "133\t499060\t20\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Please, sir! Answer me!\n"
"Chairma⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "133\t499095\t21\tCHK"
msgid "Why is it..."
msgstr "Perché è..."

msgctxt "133\t499108\t22\tCHK"
msgid "Why is it I feel so at peace?"
msgstr "Perché mi sento così in pace?"

msgctxt "133\t499138\t23\tCHK"
msgid "Is this how it feels..."
msgstr "È così che ci si sente..."

msgctxt "133\t499162\t24\tCHK"
msgid "When your world comes crashing down?"
msgstr "Quando il tuo mondo crollerà?"

msgctxt "133\t499199\t25\tCHK"
msgid "Mine."
msgstr "Mio."

msgctxt "133\t499205\t26\tCHK"
msgid ""
"As long as you live,\n"
"you can always rebuild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "133\t499250\t27\tCHK"
msgid "It's never too late to change."
msgstr "Non è mai troppo tardi per cambiare."

msgctxt "133\t499281\t28\tCHK"
msgid "So they've come."
msgstr "Quindi sono arrivati."

msgctxt "133\t499298\t29\tCHK"
msgid ""
"What the...\n"
"What are the CIA doing here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "133\t499339\t30\tCHK"
msgid "They're not CIA."
msgstr "Non sono la CIA."

msgctxt "133\t499356\t31\tCHK"
msgid "It's merely a cover."
msgstr "E' semplicemente una copertura."

msgctxt "133\t499377\t32\tCHK"
msgid "They're all Black Monday leadership."
msgstr "Sono tutti leader del Black Monday."

msgctxt "133\t499414\t33\tCHK"
msgid "Then, that man is..."
msgstr "Allora quell'uomo è..."

msgctxt "133\t499435\t34\tCHK"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "133\t499440\t35\tCHK"
msgid "Andre Richardson."
msgstr "André Richardson."

msgctxt "133\t499458\t36\tCHK"
msgid "So it's him."
msgstr "Qui! Dai un'occhiata a questo!"

msgctxt "133\t499471\t37\tCHK"
msgid "In other words..."
msgstr "In altre parole..."

msgctxt "133\t499489\t38\tCHK"
msgid "I've outlived my usefulness to them."
msgstr "Ho esaurito la mia utilità per loro."

msgctxt "133\t499526\t39\tCHK"
msgid "Daigo!"
msgstr "Daigo!"

msgctxt "133\t499533\t40\tCHK"
msgid "Daigo."
msgstr "Daigo."

msgctxt "133\t499540\t41\tCHK"
msgid "Kiryu-san!"
msgstr "Kiryu-san!"

msgctxt "133\t499551\t42\tCHK"
msgid "Are you hurt!?"
msgstr "Sei ferito!?"

msgctxt "133\t499566\t43\tCHK"
msgid "I... could ask you the same thing."
msgstr "Io... potrei chiederti la stessa cosa."

msgctxt "133\t499601\t44\tCHK"
msgid "What... happened here?"
msgstr "Che è successo qui?"

msgctxt "133\t499624\t45\tCHK"
msgid "Mine?"
msgstr "Mio?"

msgctxt "133\t499630\t46\tCHK"
msgid "Chairman..."
msgstr "Presidente..."

msgctxt "133\t499642\t47\tCHK"
msgid "Damn. He's tougher than I thought!"
msgstr "Dannazione. È più duro di quanto pensassi!"

msgctxt "133\t499677\t48\tCHK"
msgid "Chairman. I'm sorry."
msgstr "Presidente. Mi dispiace."

msgctxt "133\t499698\t49\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Sorry, but the truth of it is...\n"
"I don't deserve to live."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "133\t499756\t50\tCHK"
msgid "Mine!"
msgstr "Mio!"

msgctxt "133\t499762\t51\tCHK"
msgid "I might be a sorry excuse for a yakuza..."
msgstr "Potrei essere una scusa scusa per uno yakuza..."

msgctxt "133\t499804\t52\tCHK"
msgid "But I still know how to uphold my code of honor."
msgstr "Ma so ancora come rispettare il mio codice d'onore."

msgctxt "133\t499853\t53\tCHK"
msgid "Mine...!"
msgstr "Mio...!"

msgctxt "133\t499862\t54\tCHK"
msgid "Maybe in my next life..."
msgstr "Forse nella mia prossima vita..."

msgctxt "133\t499887\t55\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I'll have what it takes\n"
"to earn your respect."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "133\t499933\t56\tCHK"
msgid "Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr "Zio Kaz!"

msgctxt "133\t499944\t57\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Tell me the truth.\n"
"The traitor to the Tojo..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "133\t499990\t58\tCHK"
msgid "Was it Mine?"
msgstr "Era mio?"

msgctxt "133\t500003\t59\tCHK"
msgid "No. Not a chance."
msgstr "No. Nemmeno una possibilità."

msgctxt "133\t500021\t60\tCHK"
msgid ""
"We've received an offer on the Dubai stock deal.\n"
"10 times the original market value."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "133\t500106\t61\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Our European creditors have requested a meeting\n"
"with you after hearing the news, and..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "133\t500194\t62\tCHK"
msgid "Money, huh? No surprise there."
msgstr "Soldi, eh? Nessuna sorpresa lì."

msgctxt "133\t500225\t63\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But I suppose...\n"
"people yearn to trust others."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "133\t500272\t64\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Chairman! If we don't respond soon,\n"
"who knows how they may respond!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "133\t500340\t65\tCHK"
msgid ""
"That's right. He's the one who told me\n"
"you were on your way here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "133\t500406\t66\tCHK"
msgid ""
"They knew everything the CIA\n"
"and that fool Kazama were trying to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "133\t500475\t67\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid your role in all of this\n"
"has come to an end."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "133\t500531\t68\tCHK"
msgid "Dammit. What are they gonna do?"
msgstr "Maledizione. Cosa faranno?"

msgctxt "133\t500563\t69\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Kill us and search for someone else\n"
"who can get the military expansion bill passed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "133\t500647\t70\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You both know far too much\n"
"for me to let either of you live."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "133\t500708\t71\tCHK"
msgid "Die."
msgstr "Morire."

msgctxt "133\t500713\t72\tCHK"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr "Cosa!?"

msgctxt "133\t500720\t73\tCHK"
msgid "What the fuck!?"
msgstr "Che cazzo!?"

msgctxt "133\t500736\t74\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I'm not... ready to die yet!\n"
"You hear me!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "133\t500779\t75\tCHK"
msgid "Dammit!"
msgstr "Dannazione!"

msgctxt "133\t500787\t76\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Mine. What are you doing here?\n"
"Are you hurt?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "133\t500832\t77\tCHK"
msgid ""
"That was a close one, huh?\n"
"But... it's all okay now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "133\t500885\t78\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I won't let it end like this.\n"
"I'll kill you all!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "133\t500934\t79\tCHK"
msgid "Stop! Stop!"
msgstr "Fermare! Fermare!"

msgctxt "133\t500946\t80\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Mine! You don't need to do this!\n"
"You hear me!? Get back here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "133\t501008\t81\tCHK"
msgid "Stop it! Are you nuts!?"
msgstr "Smettila! Sei pazzo!?"

msgctxt "133\t501032\t82\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san. I wish we could have met sooner.\n"
"I really do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "133\t501089\t83\tCHK"
msgid "No! Don't do this, Mine!"
msgstr "NO! Non farlo, mio!"

msgctxt "133\t501114\t84\tCHK"
msgid "He.... would never have betrayed you."
msgstr "Lui....non ti avrebbe mai tradito."

msgctxt "133\t501152\t85\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Oh, there are plenty of people\n"
"who could replace you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "133\t501206\t86\tCHK"
msgid "And unfortunately..."
msgstr "E sfortunatamente..."

msgctxt "133\t501227\t87\tCHK"
msgid "Die, god damn you! Die!"
msgstr "Muori, maledetto! Morire!"

msgctxt "133\t501251\t88\tCHK"
msgid "Kiryu-san."
msgstr "Kiryu-san."

msgctxt "134\t506584\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "134\t506585\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Understood."
msgstr "Ricevuto."

msgctxt "134\t506597\t2\tCHK"
msgid "I assume you'll be going tonight, then."
msgstr "Ma allora!"

msgctxt "134\t506637\t3\tCHK"
msgid "I do."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "134\t506643\t4\tCHK"
msgid "City's gonna be lonely without you."
msgstr "La città sarà sola senza di te."

msgctxt "134\t506679\t5\tCHK"
msgid "I look forward to it."
msgstr "Non vedo l'ora."

msgctxt "134\t506701\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Haruka-chan's here for you."
msgstr "Haruka-chan è qui per te."

msgctxt "134\t506729\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Guess that's my cue."
msgstr "Immagino che sia il mio segnale."

msgctxt "134\t506750\t8\tCHK"
msgid "Farewell."
msgstr "Addio."

msgctxt "134\t506760\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Hold up, Kiryu."
msgstr "Dimentichiamoci di Nakahara per ora."

msgctxt "134\t506776\t10\tCHK"
msgid "Wait..."
msgstr "Aspettare..."

msgctxt "134\t506784\t11\tCHK"
msgid "Hamazaki?"
msgstr "Hamazaki?"

msgctxt "134\t506794\t12\tCHK"
msgid "I got nothing left."
msgstr "Non mi è rimasto niente."

msgctxt "134\t506814\t13\tCHK"
msgid "And it's all 'cause of you."
msgstr "Ed è tutto a causa tua."

msgctxt "134\t506842\t14\tCHK"
msgid "My life's in tatters."
msgstr "La mia vita è a brandelli."

msgctxt "134\t506864\t15\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But I'd rather put a noose 'round my neck\n"
"than rot behind bars."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "134\t506928\t16\tCHK"
msgid "How can you say that?"
msgstr "Come puoi dirlo?"

msgctxt "134\t506950\t17\tCHK"
msgid "Why not try to redeem yourself instead?"
msgstr "Perché invece non provare a riscattarti?"

msgctxt "134\t506990\t18\tCHK"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "134\t506996\t19\tCHK"
msgid ""
"If you're really ready to die,\n"
"you have nothing to lose by living."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "134\t507063\t20\tCHK"
msgid "I'd gladly lend you a hand."
msgstr "Ti darei volentieri una mano."

msgctxt "134\t507091\t21\tCHK"
msgid "You expect me to believe that shit?"
msgstr "Ti aspetti che io creda a quella merda?"

msgctxt "134\t507127\t22\tCHK"
msgid "Fair enough."
msgstr "Giusta osservazione."

msgctxt "134\t507140\t23\tCHK"
msgid "Maybe I could buy into it."
msgstr "Forse potrei crederci."

msgctxt "134\t507167\t24\tCHK"
msgid "You really think I got nothing to lose, huh!?"
msgstr "Pensi davvero che non abbia niente da perdere, eh!?"

msgctxt "134\t507213\t25\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Believing in stuff!?\n"
"Starting fresh!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "134\t507251\t26\tCHK"
msgid "Don't patronize me with that shit!"
msgstr "Non trattarmi con condiscendenza con quella merda!"

msgctxt "134\t507286\t27\tCHK"
msgid "You're gonna see, asshole!"
msgstr "Lo vedrai, stronzo!"

msgctxt "134\t507313\t28\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Nothing matters anymore\n"
"when you're six fucking feet under!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "134\t507373\t29\tCHK"
msgid "Don't you get it!?"
msgstr "Non capisci!?"

msgctxt "134\t507392\t30\tCHK"
msgid "Answer me, dipshit!"
msgstr "Rispondimi, stronzo!"

msgctxt "134\t507412\t31\tCHK"
msgid "No... You're wrong."
msgstr "No... ti sbagli."

msgctxt "134\t507432\t32\tCHK"
msgid "Hey! The hell're you doing!?"
msgstr "EHI! Che diavolo stai facendo!?"

msgctxt "134\t507461\t33\tCHK"
msgid "Kiryu-san!"
msgstr "Kiryu-san!"

msgctxt "134\t507472\t34\tCHK"
msgid "Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr "Zio Kaz!"

msgctxt "134\t507483\t35\tCHK"
msgid "Uncle Kaz! Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr "Zio Kaz! Zio Kaz!"

msgctxt "134\t507505\t36\tCHK"
msgid "Hold on, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr "Aspetta, zio Kaz!"

msgctxt "134\t507525\t37\tCHK"
msgid "You know... Mine taught me something."
msgstr "Sai... Il mio mi ha insegnato qualcosa."

msgctxt "134\t507563\t38\tCHK"
msgid "Even in your final moments..."
msgstr "Anche nei tuoi ultimi momenti..."

msgctxt "134\t507593\t39\tCHK"
msgid "You can still learn to believe in someone!"
msgstr "Puoi ancora imparare a credere in qualcuno!"

msgctxt "134\t507636\t40\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Don't worry, Yuya.\n"
"We'll come visit every now and then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "134\t507692\t41\tCHK"
msgid ""
"As long as you believe in something,\n"
"and have the will to start fresh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "134\t507765\t42\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Once you're dead and gone, nobody's gonna\n"
"fucking care if you believed in them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "134\t507845\t43\tCHK"
msgid "Please! Don't leave me, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr "Per favore! Non lasciarmi, zio Kaz!"

msgctxt "135\t509976\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "135\t509977\t1\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Look, Mame!\n"
"We built you a new house!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "135\t510015\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Maybe he's nervous or somethin'?"
msgstr "Forse è nervoso o qualcosa del genere?"

msgctxt "135\t510048\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Here it comes!"
msgstr "Eccola!"

msgctxt "135\t510063\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Can't touch me!"
msgstr "Non mi prendi!"

msgctxt "135\t510079\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Take this!"
msgstr "Prendi questo!"

msgctxt "135\t510090\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Hop and a skip!"
msgstr "Salta e salta!"

msgctxt "135\t510106\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Whoops, I messed up!"
msgstr "Lotta professionista 3"

msgctxt "135\t510127\t8\tCHK"
msgid "Oh, it's nothing."
msgstr "Oh, non è niente."

msgctxt "135\t510145\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Hey! Come look, Haruka-chan!"
msgstr "EHI! Vieni a vedere, Haruka-chan!"

msgctxt "135\t510174\t10\tCHK"
msgid "Why won't he go in, Uncle Mikio?"
msgstr "Perché non entra, zio Mikio?"

msgctxt "135\t510207\t11\tCHK"
msgid "Wow! You're so good at drawing, Saki-chan!"
msgstr "Oh! Sei così brava a disegnare, Saki-chan!"

msgctxt "136\t511480\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136\t511481\t1\tCHK"
msgid "See ya 'round."
msgstr "Ci vediamo in giro."

msgctxt "136\t511496\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Mama..."
msgstr "Mamma..."

msgctxt "136\t511504\t3\tCHK"
msgid "I bought something for you."
msgstr "Ho comprato qualcosa per te."

msgctxt "136\t511532\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Mama?"
msgstr "Mamma?"

msgctxt "136\t511538\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Oh... Date-san, you almost had me there!"
msgstr "Oh... Date-san, mi avevo quasi preso!"

msgctxt "136\t511579\t6\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Isn't this the ring you were buying\n"
"for Saya-chan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136\t511630\t7\tCHK"
msgid "You're serious?"
msgstr "Sei serio?"

msgctxt "136\t511646\t8\tCHK"
msgid "Yeah. 'Course I am."
msgstr "Sì. Certo che lo sono."

msgctxt "136\t511666\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Mama, I've always been⑬"
msgstr "Mamma, lo sono sempre stato⑬"

msgctxt "136\t511692\t10\tCHK"
msgid "You should go."
msgstr "Dovresti andare."

msgctxt "136\t511707\t11\tCHK"
msgid "And I mean right now."
msgstr "E intendo proprio adesso."

msgctxt "136\t511729\t12\tCHK"
msgid "I've decided... to close up shop for the day."
msgstr "Ho deciso... di chiudere i battenti per oggi."

msgctxt "136\t511775\t13\tCHK"
msgid "So, you're saying..."
msgstr "Quindi stai dicendo..."

msgctxt "136\t511796\t14\tCHK"
msgid "Date-san."
msgstr "Data-san."

msgctxt "136\t511806\t15\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I appreciate you looking after me\n"
"all this time..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136\t511857\t16\tCHK"
msgid "But I never want to see you here again."
msgstr "Ma non voglio vederti mai più qui."

msgctxt "136\t511897\t17\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I made that part up.\n"
"It was always for you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "137\t513912\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "137\t513913\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Date!"
msgstr "Data!"

msgctxt "137\t513919\t2\tCHK"
msgid ""
"What're you doing!?\n"
"Let her go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "137\t513951\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Don't move!"
msgstr "Non muoverti!"

msgctxt "137\t513963\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Or she gets it."
msgstr "Oppure lo capisce."

msgctxt "137\t513979\t5\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Ironic, ain't it? Bumping off a cop and\n"
"his superior officer in the very same spot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "137\t514063\t6\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I admit I botched things up back then,\n"
"but you won't be so lucky this time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "137\t514139\t7\tCHK"
msgid "I'll put bullets in every single one of you."
msgstr "Pianterò proiettili in ognuno di voi."

msgctxt "137\t514184\t8\tCHK"
msgid "So, who wants to go first?"
msgstr "Allora, chi vuole andare per primo?"

msgctxt "137\t514211\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Tsukishima."
msgstr "Tsukishima."

msgctxt "137\t514223\t10\tCHK"
msgid "I won't let you pull the same trick twice."
msgstr "Non ti lascerò fare lo stesso trucco due volte."

msgctxt "137\t514266\t11\tCHK"
msgid "Excuse me?"
msgstr "Mi scusi?"

msgctxt "137\t514277\t12\tCHK"
msgid "Listen, Mama."
msgstr "Ascolta, mamma."

msgctxt "137\t514291\t13\tCHK"
msgid "I don't mean to speak ill of the dead..."
msgstr "Non intendo parlare male dei morti..."

msgctxt "137\t514332\t14\tCHK"
msgid "But Keisuke shouldn't have hesitated."
msgstr "Ma Keisuke non avrebbe dovuto esitare."

msgctxt "137\t514370\t15\tCHK"
msgid ""
"If there's someone that's really\n"
"precious to you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "137\t514422\t16\tCHK"
msgid "Date-san..."
msgstr "Data-san..."

msgctxt "137\t514434\t17\tCHK"
msgid "You've always been precious to me."
msgstr "Sei sempre stato prezioso per me."

msgctxt "137\t514469\t18\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And I protect what's precious to me,\n"
"no matter what I have to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "137\t514535\t19\tCHK"
msgid "I've always prided myself on that!"
msgstr "Ne sono sempre stato orgoglioso!"

msgctxt "137\t514570\t20\tCHK"
msgid "So... That's how I'm gonna end this situation!"
msgstr "Credo che tu abbia già incontrato alcuni degli altri."

msgctxt "137\t514617\t21\tCHK"
msgid "I'll end you first, Date!"
msgstr "I'll end you first, Date!"

msgctxt "137\t514643\t22\tCHK"
msgid "Mama..."
msgstr "Mamma..."

msgctxt "137\t514651\t23\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Feeling a little nostalgic?\n"
"Or perhaps a bit of deja vu?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "137\t514708\t24\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Then you have to do whatever it takes\n"
"to protect them. There's no running from that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "137\t514793\t25\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Otherwise, all you'll end up doing is leaving\n"
"behind regrets. For yourself and your loved ones."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "138\t516792\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "138\t516793\t1\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I no longer have the right to\n"
"tell you what to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "138\t516844\t2\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I can see it in you. You'd give your life\n"
"for these people if it came down to it, yes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "138\t516931\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "138\t516937\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Then I'm convinced."
msgstr "Allora mi convinco."

msgctxt "138\t516957\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Pops..."
msgstr "Pop..."

msgctxt "138\t516965\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "Grazie."

msgctxt "138\t516976\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But if you'll allow me, I think you should\n"
"treat the Ryudo Family as your home from now on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "138\t517068\t8\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Go forward with the Ryudo Family and don't\\look back. You have my blessing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "138\t517144\t9\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Mikio. Nakahara's a good man.\n"
"I know he'll raise you up right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "138\t517207\t10\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Besides, I'm not letting you back in the house,\n"
"anyway. Not till you've become who you want to be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "139\t518584\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "139\t518585\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "Grazie."

msgctxt "139\t518596\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Isn't that pendant...?"
msgstr "Non è quel ciondolo...?"

msgctxt "139\t518619\t3\tCHK"
msgid "That's just..."
msgstr "E' proprio..."

msgctxt "139\t518634\t4\tCHK"
msgid "This is a hibiscus pendant."
msgstr "Questo è un ciondolo di ibisco."

msgctxt "139\t518662\t5\tCHK"
msgid "I knew it, you really are Natsumi Uesato!"
msgstr "Mio. Voi..."

msgctxt "139\t518704\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Here! Take a look at this!"
msgstr "Qui! Dai un'occhiata a questo!"

msgctxt "139\t518731\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"She gave me this as a birthday present\n"
"all those years ago!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "139\t518791\t8\tCHK"
msgid "No. This is just something I found in a shop."
msgstr "No. Questo è solo qualcosa che ho trovato in un negozio."

msgctxt "139\t518837\t9\tCHK"
msgid "That can't be true."
msgstr "Non può essere vero."

msgctxt "139\t518857\t10\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You made these as a pair.\n"
"One for me and one for you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "139\t518911\t11\tCHK"
msgid "Why won't you just admit it?"
msgstr "Perché non lo ammetti e basta?"

msgctxt "139\t518940\t12\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I've held onto my hibiscus pendant\n"
"all this time, too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140\t520360\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140\t520361\t1\tCHK"
msgid "I..."
msgstr "Io..."

msgctxt "140\t520366\t2\tCHK"
msgid "I really am Natsumi."
msgstr "Sono davvero Natsumi."

msgctxt "140\t520387\t3\tCHK"
msgid "I never actually had... a sister."
msgstr "In realtà non ho mai avuto... una sorella."

msgctxt "140\t520421\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Yeah. I knew that from the start."
msgstr "Sì. Lo sapevo fin dall'inizio."

msgctxt "140\t520455\t5\tCHK"
msgid "There's no way I'd ever forget your face."
msgstr "Non potrò mai dimenticare il tuo viso."

msgctxt "140\t520497\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Rikiya!"
msgstr "Rikiya!"

msgctxt "140\t520505\t7\tCHK"
msgid "I'm sorry! I'm so sorry!"
msgstr "Mi dispiace! Mi dispiace tanto!"

msgctxt "140\t520530\t8\tCHK"
msgid "So come back to Okinawa with me."
msgstr "Quindi torna ad Okinawa con me."

msgctxt "140\t520563\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Mhm. Okay."
msgstr "Mhm. Va bene."

msgctxt "140\t520574\t10\tCHK"
msgid "Natsumi."
msgstr "Natsumi."

msgctxt "140\t520583\t11\tCHK"
msgid "I'll take care of everything from here on out."
msgstr "Mi occuperò io di tutto da qui in poi."

msgctxt "140\t520630\t12\tCHK"
msgid "Let's just go back to Okinawa, okay?"
msgstr "Torniamo a Okinawa, ok?"

msgctxt "140\t520667\t13\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Now, I do have some unfinished business\n"
"with Kiryu-aniki here..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140\t520732\t14\tCHK"
msgid "But I'll come get you when I'm done."
msgstr "Ma verrò a prenderti quando avrò finito."

msgctxt "140\t520769\t15\tCHK"
msgid ""
"It's all right.\n"
"Tokyo doesn't suit you much anyway."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140\t520821\t16\tCHK"
msgid "I hope... you can forgive me, Rikiya."
msgstr "Spero... che tu possa perdonarmi, Rikiya."

msgctxt "141\t522024\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "141\t522025\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Oho."
msgstr "Oho."

msgctxt "141\t522030\t2\tCHK"
msgid "What do you think? A work of art, ain't it?"
msgstr "Cosa ne pensi? Un'opera d'arte, non è vero?"

msgctxt "141\t522074\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Just look at this detail!"
msgstr "Basta guardare questo dettaglio!"

msgctxt "141\t522100\t4\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I've yet to meet a tattooist good enough to take\n"
"on my viper. Maybe you're like all the rest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "141\t522194\t5\tCHK"
msgid "The color! The pattern! Amazing, right?"
msgstr "Il colore! Il modello! Incredibile, vero?"

msgctxt "142\t523304\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "142\t523305\t1\tCHK"
msgid "\"Love\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "142\t523312\t2\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Let's go, Aniki. This numbnuts ain't worth\n"
"the time it'd take to deal with 'em."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "142\t523392\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Yeah. You're right."
msgstr "Ah, sì. Hai ragione."

msgctxt "142\t523412\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Now wait just a minute, assholes!"
msgstr "Adesso aspettate solo un attimo, stronzi!"

msgctxt "142\t523446\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Who gave ya permission to walk away!?"
msgstr "Chi ti ha dato il permesso di andartene!?"

msgctxt "142\t523484\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Give it a rest."
msgstr "Dacci una calmata."

msgctxt "142\t523500\t7\tCHK"
msgid "What!? Kid?! You're younger than me, junior!"
msgstr "Che cosa!? Ragazzo?! Sei più giovane di me, junior!"

msgctxt "142\t523545\t8\tCHK"
msgid "So!? Quakin' in your boots, huh!?"
msgstr "COSÌ!? Trema negli stivali, eh!?"

msgctxt "142\t523579\t9\tCHK"
msgid "You're not doin' yourself any favors, kid."
msgstr "Non ti stai facendo alcun favore, ragazzo."

msgctxt "143\t525048\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "143\t525049\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Quit squirming."
msgstr "Smettila di dimenarti."

msgctxt "143\t525065\t2\tCHK"
msgid "My ink can change people's fates."
msgstr "Il mio inchiostro può cambiare il destino delle persone."

msgctxt "143\t525099\t3\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I hope it won't be too heavy a burden\n"
"for you to carry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "143\t525155\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Well spoken."
msgstr "Ben detto."

msgctxt "143\t525168\t5\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Maybe you have what it takes to avoid getting\n"
"swallowed up yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "143\t525237\t6\tCHK"
msgid "All right. It's complete."
msgstr "Va bene. È completo."

msgctxt "143\t525263\t7\tCHK"
msgid "How is it, Boss?"
msgstr "Come va, capo?"

msgctxt "143\t525280\t8\tCHK"
msgid "So you and I have the same ink in our skins."
msgstr "Quindi tu ed io abbiamo lo stesso inchiostro sulla pelle."

msgctxt "143\t525325\t9\tCHK"
msgid "I suppose that makes us brothers, doesn't it?"
msgstr "Immagino che questo ci renda fratelli, non è vero?"

msgctxt "143\t525371\t10\tCHK"
msgid "I guess so."
msgstr "Immagino di sì."

msgctxt "143\t525383\t11\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I'm breathing life into your viper.\n"
"Don't move."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "143\t525431\t12\tCHK"
msgid "I've got the soul of Okinawa on my back."
msgstr "Ho l'anima di Okinawa sulle mie spalle."

msgctxt "143\t525472\t13\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The viper can swallow anything that comes its\n"
"way. Nothing'll get the best of me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "143\t525554\t14\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Your work is always magnificent.\n"
"It's a masterpiece."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144\t526536\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144\t526537\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Heeey!"
msgstr "Eeehi!"

msgctxt "144\t526544\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Akimoto-kun!"
msgstr "Akimoto-kun!"

msgctxt "144\t526557\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Mizuki-chan!"
msgstr "Mizuki-chan!"

msgctxt "144\t526570\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Oh, yeah?"
msgstr "Ah, sì?"

msgctxt "144\t526580\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Hey, Akimoto-kun!"
msgstr "Ehi, Akimoto-kun!"

msgctxt "144\t526598\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Take this! And this!"
msgstr "Prendi questo! E questo!"

msgctxt "145\t527944\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "145\t527945\t1\tCHK"
msgid "It's not what you think, Akimoto-kun!"
msgstr "Non è quello che pensi, Akimoto-kun!"

msgctxt "145\t527983\t2\tCHK"
msgid "No, I should call you..."
msgstr "No, dovrei chiamarti..."

msgctxt "145\t528008\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Big brother!"
msgstr "Grande fratello!"

msgctxt "145\t528021\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Big brother?"
msgstr "Grande fratello?"

msgctxt "145\t528034\t5\tCHK"
msgid "You and I..."
msgstr "Io e te..."

msgctxt "145\t528047\t6\tCHK"
msgid "We're actually long-lost siblings!"
msgstr "In realtà siamo fratelli perduti da tempo!"

msgctxt "145\t528082\t7\tCHK"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr "Cosa!?"

msgctxt "145\t528089\t8\tCHK"
msgid "I love you, Akimoto-kun."
msgstr "Ti amo, Akimoto-kun."

msgctxt "145\t528114\t9\tCHK"
msgid "I can't believe it..."
msgstr "Non ci posso credere..."

msgctxt "145\t528136\t10\tCHK"
msgid "Mizuki-chan is actually my little sister!"
msgstr "Mizuki-chan è in realtà la mia sorellina!"

msgctxt "145\t528178\t11\tCHK"
msgid "Wait."
msgstr "Aspetta."

msgctxt "145\t528184\t12\tCHK"
msgid "If you were my little sister all along..."
msgstr "Se tu fossi sempre stata la mia sorellina..."

msgctxt "145\t528226\t13\tCHK"
msgid "Yeah! All right!"
msgstr "Sì! Va bene!"

msgctxt "145\t528243\t14\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But because we're siblings...\n"
"we can never be together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "145\t528299\t15\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Then... you can never marry\n"
"into my family?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "145\t528343\t16\tCHK"
msgid ""
"That means we're family already!\n"
"Woo-hoo!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "146\t529528\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "146\t529529\t1\tCHK"
msgid "You're such an idiot, Akimoto-kun!"
msgstr "Sei un tale idiota, Akimoto-kun!"

msgctxt "146\t529564\t2\tCHK"
msgid "I-I'm gonna fall!"
msgstr "Le rovine della gloria mattutina"

msgctxt "146\t529582\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Oh, no!"
msgstr "Oh no!"

msgctxt "146\t529590\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Mizuki-chan!?"
msgstr "Mizuki-chan!?"

msgctxt "146\t529604\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Ow!"
msgstr "Ahi!"

msgctxt "146\t529608\t6\tCHK"
msgid "That was close!"
msgstr "Per un soffio!"

msgctxt "146\t529624\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"If I'd died there, I wouldn't have been\n"
"able to kill myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "147\t530888\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "147\t530889\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Do I deserve to live?"
msgstr "Merito di vivere?"

msgctxt "147\t530911\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Of course you do!"
msgstr "Certo che lo fai!"

msgctxt "147\t530929\t3\tCHK"
msgid "If you died, I..."
msgstr "Se sei morto, io..."

msgctxt "147\t530947\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Mizuki-chan."
msgstr "Mizuki-chan."

msgctxt "147\t530960\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Can we start over??"
msgstr "Nessun riguardo per la posizione che ricopri."

msgctxt "147\t530980\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Can we start from the very beginning..."
msgstr "Possiamo iniziare dall'inizio..."

msgctxt "147\t531020\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And relive those early days\n"
"we spent together?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "147\t531067\t8\tCHK"
msgid "You still want to be with me?"
msgstr "Vuoi ancora stare con me?"

msgctxt "147\t531097\t9\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Only if you still want to be\n"
"with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "147\t531135\t10\tCHK"
msgid "Akimoto-kun!"
msgstr "Akimoto-kun!"

msgctxt "147\t531148\t11\tCHK"
msgid "Mizuki-chan!"
msgstr "Mizuki-chan!"

msgctxt "147\t531161\t12\tCHK"
msgid "I'm sorry."
msgstr "Mi dispiace."

msgctxt "147\t531172\t13\tCHK"
msgid ""
"We'll be together forever,\n"
"from this moment on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "147\t531220\t14\tCHK"
msgid "We should go, Uncle Kaz."
msgstr "Dovremmo andare, zio Kaz."

msgctxt "147\t531245\t15\tCHK"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "147\t531251\t16\tCHK"
msgid "I love you, Mizuki-chan."
msgstr "Ti amo, Mizuki-chan."

msgctxt "147\t531276\t17\tCHK"
msgid "I love you, too."
msgstr "Anch'io ti amo."

msgctxt "147\t531293\t18\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Please, don't ever say that you want \n"
"to die!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148\t532280\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148\t532281\t1\tCHK"
msgid "I was told to come up to this room."
msgstr "Mi è stato detto di salire in questa stanza."

msgctxt "148\t532317\t2\tCHK"
msgid "I take it you're Aoi-san?"
msgstr "Immagino che tu sia Aoi-san?"

msgctxt "148\t532343\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Y-Yes! Please come on in!"
msgstr "S-Sì! Per favore, entra!"

msgctxt "149\t533592\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "149\t533593\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Hey, Kiryu-san."
msgstr "Ehi, Kiryu-san?"

msgctxt "149\t533609\t2\tCHK"
msgid "I just can't..."
msgstr "Non posso proprio..."

msgctxt "149\t533625\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Take it anymore!"
msgstr "Prendilo più!"

msgctxt "149\t533642\t4\tCHK"
msgid "So."
msgstr "Va bene."

msgctxt "149\t533646\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Teach me how to do it like a pro?"
msgstr "Insegnami come farlo come un professionista?"

msgctxt "149\t533680\t6\tCHK"
msgid ""
"My boyfriend's such an amateur,\n"
"you know..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "149\t533724\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Hey...!"
msgstr "Ehi..."

msgctxt "149\t533732\t8\tCHK"
msgid "What kind of game are you playing?"
msgstr "A che tipo di gioco stai giocando?"

msgctxt "149\t533767\t9\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Hey, I don't see what the problem is.\n"
"I've already paid the money, so it's fine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "149\t533848\t10\tCHK"
msgid ""
"So let me indulge myself...\n"
"by indulging in a man like you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "149\t533908\t11\tCHK"
msgid "You think I'm a escort?"
msgstr "Pensi che io sia una escort?"

msgctxt "149\t533932\t12\tCHK"
msgid "Why wouldn't I?"
msgstr "Perché non dovrei?"

msgctxt "149\t533948\t13\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I mean, Kiryu-san, isn't that\n"
"why you're here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "149\t533995\t14\tCHK"
msgid "Wait, so you're just gonna get up and go!?"
msgstr "Aspetta, quindi ti alzi e vai!?"

msgctxt "149\t534038\t15\tCHK"
msgid "What the heck?"
msgstr "Che diavolo?"

msgctxt "149\t534053\t16\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Wait.\n"
"You paid money for me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "149\t534082\t17\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I already paid Tomoko!\n"
"Enough for the finest escort in town!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "149\t534149\t18\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Not at all.\n"
"But I will escort myself out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "150\t535512\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "150\t535513\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Kiryu-san."
msgstr "Kiryu-san."

msgctxt "150\t535524\t2\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I think it's high time\n"
"we all learned the truth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "150\t535573\t3\tCHK"
msgid "You want to know the real killer?"
msgstr "Vuoi conoscere il vero assassino?"

msgctxt "150\t535607\t4\tCHK"
msgid "It's her!"
msgstr "È lei!"

msgctxt "150\t535617\t5\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Six years ago, Akechi-san was blamed for\n"
"Oda-san's murder. But that's not right, is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "150\t535705\t6\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Yuko Kinoshita. You're the one who\n"
"orchestrated Oda-san's death."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "151\t536472\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "151\t536473\t1\tCHK"
msgid "So. Are you done coming up with excuses?"
msgstr "COSÌ. Hai finito di inventare scuse?"

msgctxt "151\t536514\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Yuko-san."
msgstr "Yuko-san."

msgctxt "151\t536524\t3\tCHK"
msgid "I'm going to ask you once more."
msgstr "Te lo chiederò ancora una volta."

msgctxt "151\t536556\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Were you really the one..."
msgstr "Eri davvero quello..."

msgctxt "151\t536583\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Who took Oda-san's life?"
msgstr "Chi ha preso la vita di Oda-san?"

msgctxt "151\t536608\t6\tCHK"
msgid "That's right."
msgstr "Esatto."

msgctxt "151\t536622\t7\tCHK"
msgid "It was me all along."
msgstr "Sono sempre stato io."

msgctxt "152\t537976\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152\t537977\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Nice work out there!"
msgstr "Bel lavoro là fuori!"

msgctxt "152\t537998\t2\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-chan, you were shining like a\n"
"star back there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152\t538051\t3\tCHK"
msgid ""
"It's as if your eyes have seen death itself,\n"
"and the scars of war were written on your back!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152\t538144\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Right? Doesn't he have that vibe?"
msgstr "Giusto? Non ha quell'atmosfera?"

msgctxt "152\t538178\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Yeah! S-Sure!"
msgstr "Sì! S-Certo!"

msgctxt "152\t538192\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Right, guys!? Tell me I'm not crazy here!"
msgstr "Giusto, ragazzi!? Dimmi che non sono pazzo qui!"

msgctxt "152\t538234\t7\tCHK"
msgid "That's a terrible idea!"
msgstr "È un'idea terribile!"

msgctxt "152\t538258\t8\tCHK"
msgid ""
"What are you saying?\n"
"And why's everyone lined up?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152\t538308\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Thanks for leaving our pinkies on⑬"
msgstr "Grazie per aver lasciato i nostri mignoli⑬"

msgctxt "152\t538345\t10\tCHK"
msgid "I mean, I'm tickled pink to have worked with you!"
msgstr "Voglio dire, sono felicissimo di aver lavorato con te!"

msgctxt "152\t538395\t11\tCHK"
msgid "What's gotten into you guys?"
msgstr "Ma che ti è preso?"

msgctxt "152\t538424\t12\tCHK"
msgid ""
"If you're not already with a production agency,\n"
"you should sign a contract with us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152\t538508\t13\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Sorry. But I'm not interested in acting.\n"
"I should be leaving now anyway."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "153\t539928\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "153\t539929\t1\tCHK"
msgid "That's just the beginning!"
msgstr "Questo è solo l'inizio!"

msgctxt "153\t539956\t2\tCHK"
msgid "But this'll put you outta your misery."
msgstr "Ma questo ti tirerà fuori dalla tua miseria."

msgctxt "153\t539995\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Super Flying..."
msgstr "Super volo..."

msgctxt "153\t540011\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Taichi Kick!"
msgstr "Calcio Taichi!"

msgctxt "153\t540024\t5\tCHK"
msgid "One, two, three!"
msgstr "Uno due tre!"

msgctxt "153\t540041\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Yahoo! I finally got a win!"
msgstr "Dannazione, dov'è andato...?"

msgctxt "153\t540069\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You're the worst, Taichi!\n"
"Why do you always take this so serious!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "153\t540136\t8\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Huh? Hey!\n"
"Hey, Taichi!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "153\t540159\t9\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Can you hear me, Taichi!?\n"
"C'mon, get up!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "153\t540200\t10\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Oh crap! Uncle Kaz!\n"
"Taichi's... Taichi's hurt!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "154\t541192\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "154\t541193\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Wait."
msgstr "Aspetta."

msgctxt "154\t541199\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Dragon! Look out!"
msgstr "Dragon! Attento!"

msgctxt "154\t541217\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Taichi!"
msgstr "Taichi!"

msgctxt "154\t541225\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Hold on, I was just⑬"
msgstr "Aspetta, stavo giusto⑬"

msgctxt "154\t541248\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Super Flying..."
msgstr "Super volo..."

msgctxt "154\t541264\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Taichi Kick!"
msgstr "Calcio Taichi!"

msgctxt "154\t541277\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Eat this!"
msgstr "Mangia questo!"

msgctxt "154\t541287\t8\tCHK"
msgid "One!"
msgstr "Uno!"

msgctxt "154\t541292\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Two!"
msgstr "Due!"

msgctxt "154\t541297\t10\tCHK"
msgid "Three!"
msgstr "Tre!"

msgctxt "154\t541304\t11\tCHK"
msgid "You all right, Taichi?"
msgstr "Tutto bene, Taichi?"

msgctxt "154\t541327\t12\tCHK"
msgid "Huh? I feel... great."
msgstr "Eh? Mi sento... benissimo."

msgctxt "155\t542184\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "155\t542185\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Take this!"
msgstr "Prendi questo!"

msgctxt "155\t542196\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Strike!"
msgstr "Sciopero!"

msgctxt "155\t542204\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Oh c'mon!"
msgstr "Non è vero, Saki?"

msgctxt "155\t542214\t4\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Hey, Taichi. That kid's been\n"
"hanging around here a lot, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "155\t542275\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Who is he?"
msgstr "Chi è?"

msgctxt "155\t542286\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Beats me."
msgstr "Non lo so."

msgctxt "155\t542296\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Why don't you go see if he wants to play?"
msgstr "Perché non vai a vedere se vuole giocare?"

msgctxt "156\t543464\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156\t543465\t1\tCHK"
msgid "One of the older kids."
msgstr "Uno dei ragazzi più grandi."

msgctxt "156\t543488\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Hashimoto-kun."
msgstr "Hashimoto-kun."

msgctxt "156\t543503\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Huh!?"
msgstr "Eh!?"

msgctxt "156\t543509\t4\tCHK"
msgid "How could this happen!?"
msgstr "Come è potuto succedere!?"

msgctxt "156\t543533\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Or should I involve the board!?"
msgstr "O dovrei coinvolgere il consiglio!?"

msgctxt "156\t543565\t6\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You! What is the meaning of this?\n"
"Explain yourself!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156\t543617\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And you're a teacher!\n"
"This is how you raise your own son!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156\t543676\t8\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Get better soon, Akira-kun!\n"
"There's a lot we still have to teach you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "157\t545400\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "157\t545401\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Stop!"
msgstr "Fermo!"

msgctxt "157\t545407\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Whoa, just look at it."
msgstr "Whoa, guardalo e basta."

msgctxt "157\t545430\t3\tCHK"
msgid "What the heck?"
msgstr "Che diavolo?"

msgctxt "157\t545445\t4\tCHK"
msgid "You're disgusting."
msgstr "Lei mi fa schifo."

msgctxt "157\t545464\t5\tCHK"
msgid "You'll pay for that!"
msgstr "Combina la difesa con l'attacco"

msgctxt "157\t545485\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Mitsuo?"
msgstr "Mitsuo?"

msgctxt "157\t545493\t7\tCHK"
msgid "What was that?"
msgstr "Cosa hai detto?"

msgctxt "157\t545508\t8\tCHK"
msgid "Take this!"
msgstr "Prendi questo!"

msgctxt "157\t545519\t9\tCHK"
msgid "What's up with him?"
msgstr "Che gli prende?"

msgctxt "157\t545539\t10\tCHK"
msgid "Are you hurt, Okada-kun?"
msgstr "Sei ferito, Okada-kun?"

msgctxt "157\t545564\t11\tCHK"
msgid "I was just in the area, and..."
msgstr "Ero proprio in zona e..."

msgctxt "157\t545595\t12\tCHK"
msgid "You okay?"
msgstr "Tutto bene?"

msgctxt "157\t545605\t13\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Mitsuo...\n"
"You don't think it's gross?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "157\t545643\t14\tCHK"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "157\t545649\t15\tCHK"
msgid "My burn."
msgstr "La mia bruciatura."

msgctxt "157\t545658\t16\tCHK"
msgid "Of course not!"
msgstr "Certo che no!"

msgctxt "157\t545673\t17\tCHK"
msgid "I know this isn't easy for you, Riona..."
msgstr "So che non è facile per te, Riona..."

msgctxt "157\t545714\t18\tCHK"
msgid "That's way weirder than any scar, huh?"
msgstr "È molto più strano di qualsiasi cicatrice, eh?"

msgctxt "157\t545753\t19\tCHK"
msgid "...Bad joke."
msgstr "...Brutto scherzo."

msgctxt "157\t545766\t20\tCHK"
msgid "I'm so sorry."
msgstr "Mi dispiace tanto!"

msgctxt "157\t545780\t21\tCHK"
msgid "Huh? For what?"
msgstr "COSÌ. Sai cosa deve essere fatto."

msgctxt "157\t545795\t22\tCHK"
msgid ""
"You orphans are the worst!\n"
"Come on, Okada-kun!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "157\t545842\t23\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Sorry. I wasn't following you\n"
"or anything, I swear!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "157\t545894\t24\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But hey, look at me. I don't even have to go\n"
"outside and I'm the darkest kid in town!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "158\t547752\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "158\t547753\t1\tCHK"
msgid "I'm home!"
msgstr "Sono a casa!"

msgctxt "158\t547763\t2\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Looks like things didn't\n"
"turn out so well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "158\t547806\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Yeah, but I'll get him next time!"
msgstr "Sì, ma lo prenderò la prossima volta!"

msgctxt "158\t547840\t4\tCHK"
msgid "That's the spirit, young man!"
msgstr "Questo è lo spirito, giovanotto!"

msgctxt "158\t547870\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Huh? Who's he?"
msgstr "Eh? Chi è lui?"

msgctxt "158\t547885\t6\tCHK"
msgid ""
"A guest. Go on and\n"
"introduce yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "158\t547924\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Nice to meet you, Mister.\n"
"I'm Shiro."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "158\t547961\t8\tCHK"
msgid "Hey, you! Are you Kiryu!?"
msgstr "Ei, tu! Sei Kiryu!?"

msgctxt "158\t547987\t9\tCHK"
msgid ""
"What kind of parenting\n"
"are you doing over here!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "158\t548036\t10\tCHK"
msgid "Akasaka-sensei!?"
msgstr "Akasaka-sensei!?"

msgctxt "158\t548053\t11\tCHK"
msgid ""
"It's a pleasure to meet you, too.\n"
"Your manners are impeccable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "158\t548116\t12\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Look what your kid did to my son!\n"
"What were you thinking!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "158\t548175\t13\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Oh, Hashimoto-san.\n"
"Good to see you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "159\t549624\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "159\t549625\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Everyone!"
msgstr "Tutti"

msgctxt "159\t549635\t2\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Ayako-chan.\n"
"Thanks for always helping me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "159\t549677\t3\tCHK"
msgid "This is for you."
msgstr "Questo è per te."

msgctxt "159\t549694\t4\tCHK"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "E cioè?"

msgctxt "159\t549706\t5\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Sorry.\n"
"And thanks, for everything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "159\t549741\t6\tCHK"
msgid "\"Laundry Coupon\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "159\t549758\t7\tCHK"
msgid "You guys..."
msgstr "Ragazzi..."

msgctxt "159\t549770\t8\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Everyone's gonna pitch in and help you, Ayako-chan.\n"
"It's the least we can do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "159\t549848\t9\tCHK"
msgid "This last one's from me."
msgstr "Quest'ultimo è mio."

msgctxt "159\t549873\t10\tCHK"
msgid "A Homework Coupon?"
msgstr "Un buono per i compiti?"

msgctxt "159\t549892\t11\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Who'd want that!?\n"
"You can barely do your own homework!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "159\t549947\t12\tCHK"
msgid "\"Shopping Coupon\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "159\t549965\t13\tCHK"
msgid "I've got one, too!"
msgstr "Ne ho uno anch'io!"

msgctxt "159\t549984\t14\tCHK"
msgid "Yeah, that's just giving her more work!"
msgstr "Sì, questo le sta solo dando più lavoro!"

msgctxt "160\t550920\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160\t550921\t1\tCHK"
msgid "I got you now!"
msgstr "Preso!"

msgctxt "160\t550936\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Ah!"
msgstr "Ah!"

msgctxt "160\t550940\t3\tCHK"
msgid ""
"C'mere, you mutt!\n"
"Come to Papa Mikio!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "161\t552280\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "161\t552281\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Take this, fatass!"
msgstr "Prendi questo, ciccione!"

msgctxt "161\t552300\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Uncle Mikio!"
msgstr "Zio Mikio!"

msgctxt "161\t552313\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Izumi."
msgstr "Izumi."

msgctxt "161\t552320\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Take the dog! Go!"
msgstr "Prendi il cane! Andare!"

msgctxt "161\t552338\t5\tCHK"
msgid "But..."
msgstr "Ma..."

msgctxt "161\t552345\t6\tCHK"
msgid "You heard me! Run!"
msgstr "Mi hai sentito! Correre!"

msgctxt "161\t552364\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Mame. Come on."
msgstr "Mamma. Dai."

msgctxt "161\t552379\t8\tCHK"
msgid "Please!"
msgstr "Ti prego!"

msgctxt "161\t552387\t9\tCHK"
msgid "The shit!?"
msgstr "Che merda!?"

msgctxt "161\t552398\t10\tCHK"
msgid "Mame!"
msgstr "Mamma!"

msgctxt "161\t552404\t11\tCHK"
msgid "Don't hit me, hit the dog!"
msgstr "Non picchiarmi, colpisci il cane!"

msgctxt "161\t552431\t12\tCHK"
msgid "You there!"
msgstr "Tu, lì!"

msgctxt "161\t552442\t13\tCHK"
msgid "Get back here!"
msgstr "Torna qui!"

msgctxt "161\t552457\t14\tCHK"
msgid "Hey, you okay?"
msgstr "Ehi, stai bene?"

msgctxt "161\t552472\t15\tCHK"
msgid "Oh, sir."
msgstr "Oh, signore."

msgctxt "161\t552481\t16\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Looks like I was right\n"
"to worry about you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "161\t552524\t17\tCHK"
msgid ""
"That was my bad.\n"
"I tried to stop 'em."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "161\t552562\t18\tCHK"
msgid "Izumi. You all right?"
msgstr "Non capisci?"

msgctxt "161\t552584\t19\tCHK"
msgid "Yeah, I think so."
msgstr "Già, penso di sì."

msgctxt "161\t552602\t20\tCHK"
msgid "Mame! Where's Mame!?"
msgstr "Mamma! Dov'è mamma!?"

msgctxt "161\t552623\t21\tCHK"
msgid "Ya did it!"
msgstr "Già, ce l'hai fatta!"

msgctxt "161\t552634\t22\tCHK"
msgid "Mame."
msgstr "Mamma."

msgctxt "161\t552640\t23\tCHK"
msgid "Huh? But you promised!"
msgstr "Eh? Ma l'avevi promesso!"

msgctxt "161\t552663\t24\tCHK"
msgid "Didn't he, Mame?"
msgstr "Non è vero, mamma?"

msgctxt "161\t552680\t25\tCHK"
msgid "All right, all right."
msgstr "Va bene, va bene."

msgctxt "161\t552702\t26\tCHK"
msgid "Crap, we gotta leg it!"
msgstr "Cavolo, dobbiamo darci una mossa!"

msgctxt "161\t552725\t27\tCHK"
msgid ""
"A doghouse, huh? I can build stuff, sure...\n"
"but I dunno if I can build that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "162\t555144\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "162\t555145\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Eri-chan."
msgstr "Eri-chan."

msgctxt "162\t555155\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Go on. Show me how brave you can be."
msgstr "Vai avanti. Mostrami quanto puoi essere coraggioso."

msgctxt "162\t555192\t3\tCHK"
msgid "To be honest..."
msgstr "Ad essere onesti..."

msgctxt "162\t555208\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Huh!?"
msgstr "Eh!?"

msgctxt "162\t555214\t5\tCHK"
msgid "But even still..."
msgstr "Ma anche ancora..."

msgctxt "162\t555232\t6\tCHK"
msgid "If only I could take it back."
msgstr "Se solo potessi riprenderlo."

msgctxt "162\t555262\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I'm supposed to be your sister,\n"
"but I wasn't brave enough to stop you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "162\t555333\t8\tCHK"
msgid "So... I'm sorry."
msgstr "Oh... Mi dispiace."

msgctxt "162\t555350\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Will you ever forgive me?"
msgstr "Mi perdonerai mai?"

msgctxt "162\t555376\t10\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, too!\n"
"I'm so sorry!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "162\t555406\t11\tCHK"
msgid "Ayako-chan, I..."
msgstr "Ayako-chan, io..."

msgctxt "162\t555423\t12\tCHK"
msgid ""
"It's okay. And...\n"
"I'm sorry, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "162\t555457\t13\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Huh? Why are you\n"
"apologizing, Ayako-chan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "162\t555499\t14\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I saw you take the money from my bag,\n"
"Eri-chan. I knew it was you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "162\t555566\t15\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I couldn't bring myself to stop you.\n"
"Even though it was the right thing to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "162\t555645\t16\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And now seeing what you're going through,\n"
"I really wish I had."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "162\t555708\t17\tCHK"
msgid ""
"If I just had a little courage,\n"
"none of this would ever have happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "163\t557464\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "163\t557465\t1\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I guess I'm just getting\n"
"better at saving money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "163\t557514\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Anyone home?"
msgstr "Qualcuno a casa?"

msgctxt "163\t557527\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Sir. There's something I gotta tell you."
msgstr "Signore. C'è qualcosa che devo dirti."

msgctxt "163\t557568\t4\tCHK"
msgid "What's up?"
msgstr "Che c'è?"

msgctxt "163\t557579\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Enjoy, everyone!"
msgstr "Buon divertimento a tutti!"

msgctxt "163\t557596\t6\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Sukiyaki, huh? We're eating like kings tonight.\n"
"What's the occasion?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "163\t557665\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I saw Haruka talkin' to two thugs in town today.\n"
"Almost like she knew 'em."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "163\t557740\t8\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But just one glance was enough to tell me\n"
"those guys were no good. Not at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164\t559480\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164\t559481\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Things aren't lookin' so hot, huh?"
msgstr "Le cose non sembrano così calde, eh?"

msgctxt "164\t559516\t2\tCHK"
msgid "You're dang right they're not."
msgstr "Hai proprio ragione, non lo sono."

msgctxt "164\t559547\t3\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I did some figuring, and we're really\n"
"gonna have to start scrimpin'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164\t559616\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Sucks how quick they spring those rent hikes on ya."
msgstr "Fa schifo la velocità con cui ti fanno pagare quegli aumenti dell'affitto."

msgctxt "164\t559668\t5\tCHK"
msgid "We can't afford to spend another yen, though."
msgstr "Non possiamo permetterci di spendere altri yen, però."

msgctxt "164\t559714\t6\tCHK"
msgid "I get it, I get it!"
msgstr "Ho capito, ho capito!"

msgctxt "164\t559734\t7\tCHK"
msgid "But what can we do?"
msgstr "Ma cosa possiamo fare?"

msgctxt "164\t559754\t8\tCHK"
msgid "What'd Kiryu-aniki have to say?"
msgstr "Cos'ha da dire Kiryu-aniki?"

msgctxt "164\t559786\t9\tCHK"
msgid "Then, maybe if we... chip in⑬"
msgstr "Allora, forse se... contribuissimo⑬"

msgctxt "164\t559818\t10\tCHK"
msgid "Guess so, huh."
msgstr "Immagino di sì, eh."

msgctxt "164\t559833\t11\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Can't forget the food bill either.\n"
"Everyone eats truckloads."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164\t559894\t12\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Next month's rent's gonna be tight.\n"
"Way too tight for comfort."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164\t559957\t13\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Didn't tell him.\n"
"I don't want him worryin'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164\t560001\t14\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Dumbass! We can't help if\n"
"we can barely support ourselves!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "165\t563400\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "165\t563401\t1\tCHK"
msgid ""
"In December of 2005,\n"
"I lost someone very important to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "165\t563459\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Looking back..."
msgstr "Guardando indietro..."

msgctxt "165\t563475\t3\tCHK"
msgid ""
"...maybe that was when our fates had\n"
"been sealed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "165\t563525\t4\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Back when I was still in the Dojima Family\n"
"<Sign:22><Sign:22>a branch of the Tojo Clan<Sign:22><Sign:22>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "165\t563630\t5\tCHK"
msgid ""
"<Sign:22><Sign:22>there were only three people in the\n"
"world that I considered family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "165\t563716\t6\tCHK"
msgid ""
"My best friend, Akira Nishiki, who grew\n"
"up in the same orphanage as me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "165\t563788\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Having lost my parents at a young age,\n"
"these three..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "165\t563842\t8\tCHK"
msgid ""
"...were the only ones I could really\n"
"call \"family.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "165\t563894\t9\tCHK"
msgid "However..."
msgstr "Però..."

msgctxt "165\t563905\t10\tCHK"
msgid "He had tried to force himself on Yumi."
msgstr "Aveva cercato di imporsi su Yumi."

msgctxt "165\t563944\t11\tCHK"
msgid "I was prepared to do anything..."
msgstr "Ero pronto a fare qualsiasi cosa..."

msgctxt "165\t563977\t12\tCHK"
msgid "...to protect the ones I loved."
msgstr "...per proteggere coloro che amavo."

msgctxt "165\t564009\t13\tCHK"
msgid "I was sentenced to ten years."
msgstr "Sono stato condannato a dieci anni."

msgctxt "165\t564039\t14\tCHK"
msgid ""
"After going inside, I got a letter of\n"
"expulsion from the Dojima Family..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "165\t564113\t15\tCHK"
msgid "...and found out that Yumi had disappeared."
msgstr "...e ho scoperto che Yumi era scomparsa."

msgctxt "165\t564157\t16\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I was branded as the traitor who capped\n"
"his own boss."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "165\t564211\t17\tCHK"
msgid "My foster father, Shintaro Fuma."
msgstr "Il mio padre adottivo, Shintaro Fuma."

msgctxt "165\t564244\t18\tCHK"
msgid "After my release, I returned to Kamurocho."
msgstr "Dopo il mio rilascio tornai a Kamurocho."

msgctxt "165\t564287\t19\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And I also wanted to find out what had\n"
"happened in the last ten years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "165\t564358\t20\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But I wasn't prepared for what awaited\n"
"me there..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "165\t564409\t21\tCHK"
msgid "My former best friend, now changed..."
msgstr "Il mio ex migliore amico, ora è cambiato..."

msgctxt "165\t564447\t22\tCHK"
msgid ""
"...and a group of hardened killers\n"
"searching for missing money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "165\t564511\t23\tCHK"
msgid ""
"There was a sudden struggle to\n"
"decide the Tojo Clan's successor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "165\t564576\t24\tCHK"
msgid "And I found myself right in the middle of it."
msgstr "E mi sono trovato proprio nel mezzo."

msgctxt "165\t564622\t25\tCHK"
msgid "...instead of Yumi..."
msgstr "...invece di Yumi..."

msgctxt "165\t564644\t26\tCHK"
msgid "...I found a young girl."
msgstr "...Ho trovato una giovane ragazza."

msgctxt "165\t564669\t27\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And lastly, Yumi<Sign:22><Sign:22>the woman I had\n"
"loved since childhood."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "165\t564742\t28\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Lying in front of me was the corpse of\n"
"the patriarch of the Dojima Family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "165\t564817\t29\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The organization had abandoned me,\n"
"and I began to slowly retreat into myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "165\t564895\t30\tCHK"
msgid "But there was one person who never forgot me."
msgstr "Ma c'era una persona che non mi ha mai dimenticato."

msgctxt "165\t564941\t31\tCHK"
msgid "I had to see my father."
msgstr "Dovevo vedere mio padre."

msgctxt "165\t564965\t32\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I looked for Yumi, taking my father's word\n"
"that she was connected to the money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "166\t568680\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "166\t568681\t1\tCHK"
msgid "However..."
msgstr "Però..."

msgctxt "166\t568692\t2\tCHK"
msgid "We were on the run day after day."
msgstr "Eravamo in fuga giorno dopo giorno."

msgctxt "166\t568726\t3\tCHK"
msgid "It was then that we met a detective."
msgstr "Fu allora che incontrammo un detective."

msgctxt "166\t568763\t4\tCHK"
msgid "An ex<Sign:22>yakuza and a detective."
msgstr "Un ex<Sign:22>yakuza e un detective."

msgctxt "166\t568801\t5\tCHK"
msgid ""
"We had been brought together by a strange\n"
"twist of fate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "166\t568858\t6\tCHK"
msgid "And eventually, we became friends."
msgstr "E alla fine siamo diventati amici."

msgctxt "166\t568893\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Date was caught between us and the police<Sign:22><Sign:22>"
msgstr "La data è rimasta intrappolata tra noi e la polizia<Segno:22><Segno:22>"

msgctxt "166\t568953\t8\tCHK"
msgid "<Sign:22>and he chose us."
msgstr "<Sign:22>e ci ha scelto."

msgctxt "166\t568979\t9\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Her name was Haruka.\n"
"She was just 9 years old."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "166\t569026\t10\tCHK"
msgid ""
"She had come to the city by herself to\n"
"look for her mother."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "166\t569086\t11\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Our meeting was coincidental,\n"
"but we did have one thing in common."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "166\t569153\t12\tCHK"
msgid ""
"This girl who was searching for her\n"
"mother, also knew Yumi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "166\t569213\t13\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Maybe it was fate that brought us together.\n"
"She and I proceeded to find the truth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "166\t569296\t14\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The Tojo Clan believed Haruka was the\n"
"key to the missing 10 billion yen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "166\t569369\t15\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I did my best to protect Haruka while\n"
"looking for Yumi and the money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "166\t569439\t16\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Makoto Date.\n"
"Formerly of Investigations Division 1."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "166\t569491\t17\tCHK"
msgid ""
"His investigation of me had twisted\n"
"his outlook on life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "166\t569548\t18\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And now he had come to ask for my help\n"
"in getting his career back on track."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "166\t569624\t19\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Police Chief Sudo had made it his personal\n"
"mission to find Haruka and me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "167\t573816\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "167\t573817\t1\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Lastly, there was Yayoi, wife of Sohei\n"
"Dojima, the man who was murdered in 1995."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "167\t573898\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Her words hung heavy on my heart."
msgstr "Le sue parole mi pesavano sul cuore."

msgctxt "167\t573932\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Terada from the Omi Alliance."
msgstr "Terada dell'Alleanza Omi."

msgctxt "167\t573962\t4\tCHK"
msgid "And finally..."
msgstr "E infine..."

msgctxt "167\t573977\t5\tCHK"
msgid "His name was Kage."
msgstr "Nessun riguardo per la posizione che ricopri."

msgctxt "167\t573996\t6\tCHK"
msgid ""
"He was a legendary information dealer\n"
"who worked in Kamurocho's underground."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "167\t574073\t7\tCHK"
msgid "His name was Jingu Kyohei."
msgstr "Il suo nome era Jingu Kyohei."

msgctxt "167\t574100\t8\tCHK"
msgid "But who were they?"
msgstr "Ma chi erano?"

msgctxt "167\t574119\t9\tCHK"
msgid "At last, I had discovered the truth."
msgstr "Alla fine avevo scoperto la verità."

msgctxt "167\t574156\t10\tCHK"
msgid "However..."
msgstr "Però..."

msgctxt "167\t574167\t11\tCHK"
msgid "...my father told me everything."
msgstr "...mio padre mi ha raccontato tutto."

msgctxt "167\t574200\t12\tCHK"
msgid "...my father passed away."
msgstr "...mio padre è morto."

msgctxt "167\t574226\t13\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Many people stood in our way as we\n"
"continued our investigation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "167\t574290\t14\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Futo Shimano, who was after both the 10\n"
"billion and the position of chairman..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "167\t574370\t15\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Goro Majima, lieutenant of\n"
"the Shimano Family..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "167\t574419\t16\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Our fight against the hard<Sign:22>bitten veterans\n"
"of many yakuza wars was as fierce as ever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "167\t574513\t17\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And yet there were also people who\n"
"tried to help me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "167\t574566\t18\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Kazuki, the owner of the host bar,\n"
"Stardust, and one of the hosts, Yuya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "167\t574639\t19\tCHK"
msgid ""
"These people, whom I met through\n"
"my father, gave me courage to go on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "167\t574709\t20\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I met a man who helped me get to the\n"
"bottom of what had happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "167\t574775\t21\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Kage's information led us to the man who\n"
"had been controlling everything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "167\t574849\t22\tCHK"
msgid ""
"A politician had been involved with the\n"
"stolen 10 billion yen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "167\t574912\t23\tCHK"
msgid ""
"He had given the money to the Tojo Clan\n"
"as part of an investment scheme."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "167\t574985\t24\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Jingu had been using the Tojo Clan to\n"
"make money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "167\t575035\t25\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The people who had stolen the money had\n"
"done so to protect the Tojo Clan from Jingu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "167\t575120\t26\tCHK"
msgid "After sacrificing his life to save Haruka..."
msgstr "Dopo aver sacrificato la sua vita per salvare Haruka..."

msgctxt "167\t575165\t27\tCHK"
msgid ""
"After revealing the secret that he had\n"
"kept for so long..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168\t579208\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168\t579209\t1\tCHK"
msgid "<Sign:22><Sign:22>Millennium Tower."
msgstr "<Segno:22><Segno:22>Torre del Millennio."

msgctxt "168\t579245\t2\tCHK"
msgid "We found Yumi waiting for us there."
msgstr "Abbiamo trovato Yumi che ci aspettava lì."

msgctxt "168\t579281\t3\tCHK"
msgid "And as it turned out..."
msgstr "E come si è scoperto..."

msgctxt "168\t579305\t4\tCHK"
msgid "...she was also Haruka's mother."
msgstr "...era anche la madre di Haruka."

msgctxt "168\t579338\t5\tCHK"
msgid "At last mother and daughter were reunited."
msgstr "Alla fine madre e figlia si riunirono."

msgctxt "168\t579381\t6\tCHK"
msgid "...and confronted us."
msgstr "Devo raggiungere la Millenium Tower."

msgctxt "168\t579403\t7\tCHK"
msgid "However..."
msgstr "Però..."

msgctxt "168\t579414\t8\tCHK"
msgid "Yumi's desperate courage..."
msgstr "Il coraggio disperato di Yumi..."

msgctxt "168\t579442\t9\tCHK"
msgid ""
"...and my father's strength helped me\n"
"do what had to be done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168\t579504\t10\tCHK"
msgid "We were able to defeat Jingu."
msgstr "Siamo riusciti a sconfiggere Jingu."

msgctxt "168\t579534\t11\tCHK"
msgid "The past ten years had changed us."
msgstr "Gli ultimi dieci anni ci avevano cambiato."

msgctxt "168\t579569\t12\tCHK"
msgid "We had no choice but to fight."
msgstr "Non avevamo altra scelta che combattere."

msgctxt "168\t579600\t13\tCHK"
msgid "And then..."
msgstr "Poi..."

msgctxt "168\t579612\t14\tCHK"
msgid "...my best friend sacrificed his life..."
msgstr "...il mio migliore amico ha sacrificato la sua vita..."

msgctxt "168\t579653\t15\tCHK"
msgid "...to save Haruka and me."
msgstr "...per salvare me e Haruka."

msgctxt "168\t579679\t16\tCHK"
msgid "...and Haruka."
msgstr "...e Haruka."

msgctxt "168\t579694\t17\tCHK"
msgid "...and left the Tojo Clan."
msgstr "...e lasciò il clan Tojo."

msgctxt "168\t579721\t18\tCHK"
msgid "I decided to start a new life with Haruka."
msgstr "Ho deciso di iniziare una nuova vita con Haruka."

msgctxt "168\t579764\t19\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Now aware of the truth, Haruka and I\n"
"headed to where the money lay<Sign:22><Sign:22>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168\t579849\t20\tCHK"
msgid "But this happy moment would not last long."
msgstr "Ma questo momento felice non sarebbe durato a lungo."

msgctxt "168\t579892\t21\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Jingu Kyohei had come to take back his\n"
"10 billion yen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168\t579947\t22\tCHK"
msgid ""
"He had betrayed the Tojo Clan and joined\n"
"with the Omi Alliance from Osaka."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168\t580022\t23\tCHK"
msgid ""
"He was trying to control both the yakuza\n"
"and the government."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168\t580083\t24\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Jingu tricked Terada, a friend of my\n"
"father's who was in the Omi Alliance..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168\t580160\t25\tCHK"
msgid "But just as we thought everything was over..."
msgstr "Ma proprio quando pensavamo che tutto fosse finito..."

msgctxt "168\t580206\t26\tCHK"
msgid "My father, Yumi and Nishiki."
msgstr "Mio padre, Yumi e Nishiki."

msgctxt "168\t580235\t27\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I had lost everyone.\n"
"I had lost the will to live."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168\t580285\t28\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I regained the will to live with the help\n"
"of Date..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168\t580338\t29\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I gave the title of Chairman to Terada,\n"
"who would carry on after my father..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "169\t584424\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "169\t584425\t1\tCHK"
msgid "December 2005"
msgstr "Dicembre 2005"

msgctxt "169\t584439\t2\tCHK"
msgid "We enjoyed our new, peaceful life..."
msgstr "Ci siamo goduti la nostra nuova vita pacifica..."

msgctxt "169\t584476\t3\tCHK"
msgid ""
"...and did our best to support each other\n"
"in the days that followed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "169\t584545\t4\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Contrary to Haruka's wishes, it was when\n"
"we were at the graves of those we'd lost..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "169\t584630\t5\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And now he was considering a truce\n"
"with the largest organization in Osaka<Sign:22><Sign:22>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "169\t584722\t6\tCHK"
msgid "<Sign:22><Sign:22>the Omi Alliance."
msgstr "<Segno:22><Segno:22>l'Alleanza Omi."

msgctxt "169\t584758\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Die!"
msgstr "Muori!"

msgctxt "169\t584763\t8\tCHK"
msgid "Terada was shot."
msgstr "Terada è stato colpito."

msgctxt "169\t584780\t9\tCHK"
msgid ""
"...he asked me to carry out the truce\n"
"with the Omi Alliance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "169\t584841\t10\tCHK"
msgid "The loss of its chairman could be fatal."
msgstr "La perdita del suo presidente potrebbe essere fatale."

msgctxt "169\t584882\t11\tCHK"
msgid "I went back to Kamurocho to save the clan."
msgstr "Sono tornato a Kamurocho per salvare il clan."

msgctxt "169\t584925\t12\tCHK"
msgid "I had to go back there..."
msgstr "Dovevo tornare lì..."

msgctxt "169\t584951\t13\tCHK"
msgid ""
"He was a young man belonging to my old\n"
"organization<Sign:22><Sign:22>the Dojima Family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "169\t585039\t14\tCHK"
msgid ""
"He was the son of Sohei Dojima,\n"
"patriarch of the Dojima Family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "169\t585103\t15\tCHK"
msgid ""
"One mistake in the negotiations and I\n"
"would be a dead man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "169\t585162\t16\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Yeah. And that's why I'm back.\n"
"To take responsibility!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "169\t585217\t17\tCHK"
msgid "And so Daigo and I went to Osaka..."
msgstr "E così Daigo e io siamo andati a Osaka..."

msgctxt "169\t585253\t18\tCHK"
msgid "After the 10 billion yen incident..."
msgstr "SUB050_追え"

msgctxt "169\t585290\t19\tCHK"
msgid ""
"...I turned over a new leaf, and started\n"
"a new chapter in my life with Haruka."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "169\t585369\t20\tCHK"
msgid "\"I don't wanna lose any more loved ones.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "169\t585411\t21\tCHK"
msgid "A truce?"
msgstr "Una tregua?"

msgctxt "169\t585420\t22\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Terada had taken over after me,\n"
"becoming the Tojo Clan's Fifth Chairman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "169\t585493\t23\tCHK"
msgid "As he struggled to remain conscious..."
msgstr "Mentre lottava per rimanere cosciente..."

msgctxt "169\t585532\t24\tCHK"
msgid "The Tojo Clan had grown weak."
msgstr "Il clan Tojo era diventato debole."

msgctxt "169\t585562\t25\tCHK"
msgid "...to meet a man."
msgstr "...per incontrare un uomo."

msgctxt "169\t585580\t26\tCHK"
msgid "Return to the Tojo Clan. They need you."
msgstr "Ritorna al clan Tojo. Hanno bisogno di te."

msgctxt "169\t585620\t27\tCHK"
msgid "If anything were to happen to me..."
msgstr "Se mi dovesse succedere qualcosa..."

msgctxt "169\t585656\t28\tCHK"
msgid ""
"It doesn't matter what you say.\n"
"I'll go with or without you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "170\t588760\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "170\t588761\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Sotenbori, Osaka."
msgstr "Sotenbori, Osaka."

msgctxt "170\t588779\t2\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The night before our meeting with Jin Goda,\n"
"chairman of the Omi Alliance..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "170\t588855\t3\tCHK"
msgid "They called him \"The Dragon of Kansai.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "170\t588895\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Ryuji Goda was trying to start a war."
msgstr "Ryuji Goda stava cercando di iniziare una guerra."

msgctxt "170\t588933\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Ryuji Goda was after two things."
msgstr "Ryuji Goda voleva due cose."

msgctxt "170\t588966\t6\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Gaining complete control of Japan through\n"
"the Go<Sign:22>Ryu Clan..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "170\t589035\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"To prevent the truce between the Tojo\n"
"Clan and the Omi Alliance..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "170\t589102\t8\tCHK"
msgid "That was how I met Kaoru Sayama."
msgstr "Fu così che incontrai Kaoru Sayama."

msgctxt "170\t589135\t9\tCHK"
msgid ""
"...I had a fateful meeting with a man\n"
"in Osaka's red light district."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "170\t589204\t10\tCHK"
msgid ""
"His name was Ryuji Goda, chairman of the\n"
"Go<Sign:22>Ryu Clan<Sign:22><Sign:22>a branch of the Omi Alliance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "170\t589312\t11\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Just as Ryuji said, that night the Fuma\n"
"Family office in Kamurocho was blown up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "170\t589393\t12\tCHK"
msgid ""
"He even targeted Jin Goda, who had\n"
"approved the truce between Tojo and Omi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "170\t589469\t13\tCHK"
msgid "...and fighting me, the \"Dragon of Dojima.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "170\t589513\t14\tCHK"
msgid ""
"...he was willing to kidnap his own father,\n"
"the chairman of the Omi Alliance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "170\t589591\t15\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Daigo and I went to face off against Ryuji\n"
"and rescue Jin Goda."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "170\t589655\t16\tCHK"
msgid "But we were stopped by an unexpected visitor."
msgstr "Ma siamo stati fermati da un visitatore inaspettato."

msgctxt "171\t593608\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "171\t593609\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Age had only made his wits sharper."
msgstr "L'età aveva solo reso il suo ingegno più acuto."

msgctxt "171\t593645\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Their target?"
msgstr "Il loro obiettivo?"

msgctxt "171\t593659\t3\tCHK"
msgid "Her true goal..."
msgstr "Il suo vero obiettivo..."

msgctxt "171\t593676\t4\tCHK"
msgid "...was to answer questions about her past."
msgstr "...doveva rispondere a domande sul suo passato."

msgctxt "171\t593719\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Who were her birth parents?"
msgstr "Chi erano i suoi genitori naturali?"

msgctxt "171\t593747\t6\tCHK"
msgid "I knew the pain of losing your parents."
msgstr "Conoscevo il dolore di perdere i tuoi genitori."

msgctxt "171\t593787\t7\tCHK"
msgid "And of growing up an orphan."
msgstr "E di crescere orfano."

msgctxt "171\t593816\t8\tCHK"
msgid "So there we were, a detective and a yakuza..."
msgstr "Ebbene, Kiryu?"

msgctxt "171\t593862\t9\tCHK"
msgid ""
"...working together to accomplish\n"
"each other's goals."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "171\t593916\t10\tCHK"
msgid ""
"A man at the Metropolitan Police HQ was\n"
"preparing to find a missing link..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "171\t593992\t11\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The link between the internal war of the Omi\n"
"Alliance, and the explosion at Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "171\t594079\t12\tCHK"
msgid ""
"He was nicknamed \"Killer Kawara\" for\n"
"excessive gunfire use during investigations."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "171\t594161\t13\tCHK"
msgid ""
"He called his former partner, Date, to\n"
"help him investigate an underground gang."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "171\t594242\t14\tCHK"
msgid "Kazuki, the owner of the host bar, Stardust."
msgstr "Kazuki, il proprietario del bar, Stardust."

msgctxt "171\t594287\t15\tCHK"
msgid "At the time, I was with Kaoru in Osaka."
msgstr "A quel tempo ero con Kaoru a Osaka."

msgctxt "171\t594327\t16\tCHK"
msgid ""
"She kept me in custody and had me\n"
"contact members of the Omi Alliance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "171\t594398\t17\tCHK"
msgid ""
"She wanted information about the\n"
"power struggle within the organization."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "171\t594471\t18\tCHK"
msgid ""
"But I discovered she had an ulterior\n"
"motive for approaching me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "171\t594535\t19\tCHK"
msgid "And why did she have to lose them?"
msgstr "E perché ha dovuto perderli?"

msgctxt "171\t594570\t20\tCHK"
msgid ""
"She thought the Tojo Clan was involved.\n"
"And she was using me to find the truth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "171\t594650\t21\tCHK"
msgid "Maybe that was why I couldn't leave her."
msgstr "Forse era per questo che non potevo lasciarla."

msgctxt "171\t594691\t22\tCHK"
msgid ""
"We pressed forward, knowing that the\n"
"road would lead to nothing but sadness."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172\t600520\t0\tSUS"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172\t600521\t1\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Slowly, the truth about Kaoru's past\n"
"began to unravel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172\t600576\t2\tCHK"
msgid ""
"And with it, so did her connection to\n"
"an incident that occurred 20 years ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172\t600654\t3\tCHK"
msgid "The Jingweon Mafia."
msgstr "La mafia di Jingweon."

msgctxt "172\t600674\t4\tCHK"
msgid ""
"At last, Kaoru learned the truth about\n"
"her past."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172\t600723\t5\tCHK"
msgid ""
"As he lay dying, Kawara confessed the\n"
"truth to Kaoru<Sign:22><Sign:22>that he was her father."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172\t600817\t6\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Then he closed his eyes,\n"
"finally at peace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172\t600860\t7\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Meanwhile, the \"Dragon of Kansai\" was\n"
"on the move."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172\t600911\t8\tCHK"
msgid "But things took an unexpected turn."
msgstr "Ma le cose hanno preso una piega inaspettata."

msgctxt "172\t600947\t9\tCHK"
msgid "There in front of me was..."
msgstr "Là davanti a me c'era..."

msgctxt "172\t600975\t10\tCHK"
msgid ""
"...Terada.\n"
"A man who should have been dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172\t601019\t11\tCHK"
msgid ""
"20 years ago, during the incident\n"
"at Kamurocho..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172\t601069\t12\tCHK"
msgid "Terada was one of them."
msgstr "Terada era uno di questi."

msgctxt "172\t601093\t13\tCHK"
msgid "It was a sad fight."
msgstr "È stata una lotta triste."

msgctxt "172\t601113\t14\tCHK"
msgid "Maybe Terada had been prepared to die..."
msgstr "Forse Terada era pronto a morire..."

msgctxt "172\t601154\t15\tCHK"
msgid "...from the moment he appeared before me."
msgstr "...dal momento in cui mi è apparso davanti."

msgctxt "172\t601196\t16\tCHK"
msgid "With his final breath, he said to me..."
msgstr "Con il suo ultimo respiro, mi disse..."

msgctxt "172\t601236\t17\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Immediately after those words were spoken,\n"
"a time bomb began its countdown."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172\t601312\t18\tCHK"
msgid "But..."
msgstr "Ma..."

msgctxt "172\t601319\t19\tCHK"
msgid ""
"As a man, there was one more thing\n"
"that I had to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172\t601372\t20\tCHK"
msgid "December 24th, 2006."
msgstr "24 dicembre 2006."

msgctxt "172\t601393\t21\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I scrambled from east to west, searching for\n"
"Jin Goda and investigating Kaoru's past."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172\t601479\t22\tCHK"
msgid ""
"I discovered that my father and I were\n"
"deeply involved."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172\t601535\t23\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Meanwhile in Kamurocho, an organization\n"
"was working to get revenge..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172\t601605\t24\tCHK"
msgid "...for what happened 20 years ago."
msgstr "...per quello che è successo 20 anni fa."

msgctxt "172\t601640\t25\tCHK"
msgid ""
"A foreign organization erased from\n"
"Kamurocho by the Dojima Family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172\t601707\t26\tCHK"
msgid ""
"The remaining members had come up\n"
"with a desperate plan for revenge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172\t601776\t27\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Kawara had been watching them for\n"
"20 years since the incident."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172\t601839\t28\tCHK"
msgid ""
"When he picked up on their plan, he\n"
"relayed the information to Kaoru and me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172\t601916\t29\tCHK"
msgid ""
"We headed to Millennium Tower,\n"
"where the Jingweon Mafia awaited us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172\t601984\t30\tCHK"
msgid ""
"It was a pathetic revenge plot orchestrated\n"
"by Kurahashi, an active police chief."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172\t602066\t31\tCHK"
msgid ""
"In the end, Kurahashi and Kawara died at\n"
"each other's hands."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172\t602127\t32\tCHK"
msgid "He was on his way to the final battle."
msgstr "Era sulla strada per la battaglia finale."

msgctxt "172\t602166\t33\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Putting aside the struggles between the\n"
"Tojo Clan and the Omi Alliance..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172\t602240\t34\tCHK"
msgid ""
"...I headed to where Ryuji awaited me,\n"
"to settle things man<Sign:22>to<Sign:22>man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172\t602324\t35\tCHK"
msgid ""
"...my father had spared the lives of some\n"
"members of the Jingweon Mafia."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172\t602397\t36\tCHK"
msgid "Consumed by his need for revenge..."
msgstr "Consumato dal suo bisogno di vendetta..."

msgctxt "172\t602433\t37\tCHK"
msgid ""
"...Terada had even faked his own death\n"
"in order to set his plan into motion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172\t602510\t38\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Terada was shot by Takashima,\n"
"the true mastermind behind it all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172\t602575\t39\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Ryuji took advantage of Takashima's\n"
"momentary panic, and put an end to it all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172\t602654\t40\tCHK"
msgid ""
"Thus the curtain fell on the war between\n"
"east and west, Osaka and Tokyo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172\t602727\t41\tCHK"
msgid "At last my long journey had come to an end."
msgstr "Finalmente il mio lungo viaggio era giunto al termine."

